<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="NUM" style="id">KUWA Zigua Bible Version</book>
  <para style="toc3">Kuwa</para>
  <para style="toc2">Kuwazwa</para>
  <para style="toc1">Chitabu cha Kuwazwa</para>
  <para style="mt1">CHITABU CHA</para>
  <para style="mt2">KUWAZWA</para>
  <para style="imt">Ulongozi</para>
  <para style="ip">Yemndani mwe chitabu cha kuwazwa.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ulongozi we chitabu cha Uwazwa chatambalisa ntambo ya mihilimo 40 ya wana wa Izulaeli kujinkila kwedijangwa, umo hewenati kwingilw mwe isi ye indagano, kugamba isi ya Kanaani. Chitabu chenye chetangwa Uwazwa kwa kwaviya china hantu haidi zikulavya mligano wa wagosi wagomba nkondo we mwe chila kabila dya Izulaeli. Mwe sula ya 1 na 26. Kwa kuhokela, wasomile wa mbuli za chibibiliya wazumila kugamba chitabu cha Uwazwa, iviya na vitabu vituhu vimndani mwe Tolati (Nkongo, Kulawa, Mbuli za Walawi, na Mbuli za Lukumbusa), vyawandikagwa ni muwoni Musa. Chindedi chino chalongwa hadodo ni ichitabu chenye kwa kulongo Zumbe Chohile alongaga na Musa (Uwazwa 1:1). Iviya vyadahika kugamba Musa awandikaga hantu hakulu mwe chino chitabu chenye na wata kuwandika watuhu niyo wajenyeza muntu msiku mihilimo itimile nyumani. Kwa mligano, ni vidala kufanyanya kugamaba Musa nakadaha kuwandika msitale uge udya wa Uwazwa 12:3, hantu aho kunyanyahala kwakwe mwenye kutogolwa. Mwe ntambo yawo ya kwedijangwa, wana wa Izulaeli nawakafuzuma na kumhituka Chohile nkanana siku. Kulawana ne izintendwa zawo izo, wakantilwa. Mligano umwenga we imbuli iyo ni hadya wana wa Izuaeli wagohe na kufuzuma kugamba Wakanani wandega na nguvu zitendese kujinka wowosana kuliko wowo (Uwazwa 14:1-4). Kulawane ne ntendwa ino, Chohile agambaga cheleko cha wantu nachibanike umo wana wa Izulaeli hawenati kwingila mndani mwe isi ye ndagano. Navibula hata Musa mwenye kadunduga niyo abalanga kutimila viya akunga Chohile, kulawana ne mbuli ino Musa hadahile kwingila mwe isi ye ndagano. Hata hegu wantu nendile wahituka, mna Chohile kajendeleza kuwadima. Umo wankondo Wakati wa watu wa Izulaeli wamkodishe muwoni ywa wantu wakuvikila matukulu akwitangwa Balaamu awaligite wana wa Izulaeli, Chohile kamleka du alonge mbuli za ujimbiko mwa Waizulaeli. (Uwazwa 22-24).</para>
  <para style="io">Yemndani. 1. Sula 1 kubula ya 10:11 ziwandika mbuli zikulanga kuwazwa kwa wana wa Izulaeli, Iviya kuwandwa kwe inkambi yawo ivyo ipangigwe, ndima ya walavyantambiko, na malavyo yalavigwe na kuchisanywa kulawa mwe chila kabila umo imazabahu ne idihema dyo vikukizwe. 2. Vikaheza ivyo chitabu cha Uwazwa chatambalisa ntambo ya wantu wa Izulaeli kujinkila kwedijangwa, mwe sula ya 10:12 kubula 25. 3. Sula ya 26 kubula 36 yatambalisa uwazwa wa kaidi na simulizi ntuhu kwachausa cha wantu wa Izulaeli. Iyo ni hamwenga na mazina ya umo awantu wa Izulaeli waikaga nkambi wakatenda mwe ntambo kwita kwe isi ye ndagano, na ivyo isi naisangwe mwa amakabila yose wakatenda wengila kale mwe isi yawo wenye.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="NUM 1" />
  <para style="s">Waizulaeli wawazwa nkanana ya nkongo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 1:1" />Mwe dizuwa dya nkongo dyo mwezi wa kaidi, mhilimo wa kaidi wantu wa Izulaeli weze walaile Misili, Zumbe Chohile niyo alonga na Musa mndani mwe Dihema Dikukile kwedijangwa dya Sinai, amgamba vino, <verse eid="NUM 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 1:2" />“Weye na Haluni wazani izinkolo zose za Izulaeli, wandikani amazina ya wagosi wose kuligana na nkolo na kaya kwa kaya, <verse eid="NUM 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 1:3" />wadya wose mwa Izulaeli wakudaha kwita kwe nkondo, kukongela mihilimo milongo midi na kujendeleza, namuwajele mo uwazwa wa wagomba nkondo awo. <verse eid="NUM 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 1:4" />Naho chilongozi yumwenga kulaila chila kabila mwe ikaya iyo, uyo nawambizeni kudamanya uwo uwazwa.”<verse eid="NUM 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 1:5" />Yano nayo amazina ya awantu wakunga wakwambize, kabila dya Lubeni ni Elisuli mwana ywa Shedeuli.<verse eid="NUM 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 1:6" />Mwe idikabila dya Simoni ni Selumieli mwana ywa Suli shadai, <verse eid="NUM 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 1:7" />mwe idikabila dya Yuda ni Nashoni mwana ywa Aminadabu, <verse eid="NUM 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 1:8" />mwe idikabila dya Isakali ni Nesaneli mwana ywa Suali, <verse eid="NUM 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 1:9" />mwe idikabila dya Zabuloni ni Eliyabu mwana ywa Heloni, <verse eid="NUM 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 1:10" />mwe idikabila dya Efulaimu ni Elishama mwana ywa Amihudi, <verse eid="NUM 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 1:11" />mwe idikabila dya Benyamini ni Abidani mwana ywa Gidioni, <verse eid="NUM 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 1:12" />mwe idikabila dya Dani ni Ahiezeli mwana ywa Amishadai, <verse eid="NUM 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 1:13" />mwe idikabila dya Asheli ni Pagieli mwana ywa Okilani, <verse eid="NUM 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 1:14" />mwe idikabila dya Gadi ni Eliasafu mwana ywa Deueli, <verse eid="NUM 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 1:15" />mwe idikabila dya Nafutali ni Ahila mwana ywa Enani.<verse eid="NUM 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 1:16" />Wano nawo vilongozi wasagulwe ni Chohile mwe izinkolo zose za wana wa Izulaeli, saviya vilongozi wakulu wa amakabila yawo na vilongozi we izinkolo za Izulaeli.<verse eid="NUM 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 1:17" />Elo, Musa na Haluni niyo wawetanga awo awantu watajigwe. <verse eid="NUM 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 1:18" />Mwe idizuwa dya nkongo dyo mwezi wa kaidi niyo wawetanga wantu wose wendile wawazigwe chila yumwenga na wanawe ne ikaya yakwe. Wawandika amazina ya wose wata lika dya mihilimo milongo midi na kujendeleza wawazigwe, <verse eid="NUM 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 1:19" />Musa niyo awawaza awantu awo kwe dijangwa dya Sinai saviya Chohile amgambile.<verse eid="NUM 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 1:20" />Wantu walaile kwe dikabila dya Lubeni, endile mwelekwa ywa nkongo ywa Izulaeli, kwa kutimila vyeleko vyawo, mliganyo we zinkolo zawo ne zikaya zawo, kuligana na mazina yawo chila yumwenga. Chila mgosi nandile na lika dya mihilimo milongo midi na kujendeleza, awo wadahaga kwita kwe nkondo, <verse eid="NUM 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 1:21" />nendile ni wantu milongo magana mine na mtandatu na magana milongo mishano. (46,500). <verse eid="NUM 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 1:22" />Kulaila mwe idikabila dya Simoni kutimila vyeleko vyawo ne zinkolo zawo wawo kuligana ne izikaya zawo na mazina ya wagosi chila yumwenga, wata lika dikukongela mihilimo milongo midi na kujendeleza, wakudaha kwita kwe nkondo, <verse eid="NUM 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 1:23" />wendaga wantu magana mishano mashano na chenda na magana matatu. <verse eid="NUM 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 1:24" />Vyeleko kulaila mwe idikabila dya Gadi wagosi wose wendaga na mihilimo milongo midi na kujendeleza wawandikagwa amazina yawo chila yumwenga wakudaha kwita kwe nkondo, <verse eid="NUM 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 1:25" />Welekwa we idikabila dya Gadi wendaga wantu magana milongo mine na mishano magana mtandatu na milongo mashano. <verse eid="NUM 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 1:26" />Welekwa kulaila kwe idikabila dya Yuda wagosi wose wabuzaga mihilimo milongo midi na kujendeleza wadahaga kwita kwenkondo wawandikagwa amazina yawo kutimila ne vyeleko vyawo ne zinkolo zawo. <verse eid="NUM 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 1:27" />Welekwa kulaila mwe idikabila dya Yuda wendaga wantu magana milongo mfungate na mine na magana mtandatu. <verse eid="NUM 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 1:28" />Welekwa Kulaila mwe idikabila dya Isakali wendaga wagosi wose wabuzaga mihilimo milongo midi na kujendeleza wadahaga kwita kwenkondo wawandikagwa amazina yawo kutimila ne vyeleko vyawo ne zikaya zawo. <verse eid="NUM 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 1:29" />Wantu wawazigwe kulaila kwe idikabila dya Isakali wendaga magana milongo mishano na mine na magana milongo mine. <verse eid="NUM 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 1:30" />Kulaila mwe idikabila dya Zabuloni wagosi wose wabuzaga mihilimo milongo midi na kujendeleza wadahaga kwita kwenkondo wawandikagwa amazina yawo kutimilana ne kaya zawo na nkolo zawo, <verse eid="NUM 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 1:31" />Wadya wawazizwe mwe idikabila dya Zabuloni wendaga wantu magana milongo mishano na mfungate na magana mane. <verse eid="NUM 1:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 1:32" />Welekwa walawaga mwe dikabila dya Efulaimu mwana ywa Yusufu wendaga wantu magana milongo mishano na mfungate na magana mane, <verse eid="NUM 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 1:33" />wadya wawazigwe kulaila mwe dikabila dya Efulaimu wendaga wantu magana milongo mine na mishano. <verse eid="NUM 1:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 1:34" />Kulaila kabila dya Manase, mwana ywa Yusufu kwa kutimila vyeleko vyawo kuligana nezinkolo zawo na wagosi wose wabuzaga mihilimo milongo midi na kujendeleza wakudaha kwita kwe wankondo, wawandikagwa amazina yawo kuligana na kaya zawo na nkolo zawo, <verse eid="NUM 1:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 1:35" />wadya wawazigwe mwe dikabila dya Manase wendaga wantu magana milongo mitatu na magana maidi. <verse eid="NUM 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 1:36" />Welekwa kulaila mwe idikabila dya Benyamini. Wagosi wose wabuzaga mihilimo milongo midi na kujendeleza wadahaga kwita kwe nkondo wawandikagwa amazina yawo kuligana na kaya zawo na nkolo zawo. <verse eid="NUM 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 1:37" />Wadya wawazigwe mwe idikabila dya Benjamini wendaga wantu magana milongo mitatu na milongo mishano na magana mane. <verse eid="NUM 1:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 1:38" />Welekwa kulaila mwe idikabila dya Dani, wagosi wose wabuzaga mihilimo milongo midi na kujendeleza wadahaga kwita kwe nkondo wawandikagwa amazina yawo kuligana na nkolo zawo na kaya zawo. <verse eid="NUM 1:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 1:39" />Welekwa walaile mwe idikabila dya Dani wendaga wantu magana mtandatu na midi na magana mfungate. <verse eid="NUM 1:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 1:40" />Welekwa walaile mwe dikabila dya Asheli. Wagosi wose wabuzaga mihilimo milongo midi na kujendeleza wadahaga kwita kwe nkondo wawandikagwa amazina yawo kuligana na kaya zawo na nkolo zawo. <verse eid="NUM 1:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 1:41" />Welekwa walaile mwe dikabila dya Asheli wendaga wantu magana milongo mine na mlongo umwenga na magana mashano. <verse eid="NUM 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 1:42" />Welekwa walaile mwe idikabila dya Nafutali. Wagosi wose wabuzaga mihilimo milongo midi na kujendeleza wadahaga kwita kwe nkondo wawandikagwa amazina yawo kuligana na kaya zawo na nkolo zawo. <verse eid="NUM 1:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="NUM 1:43" />Wadya wawazigwe kulaila mwe idikabila dya Nafutali wendaga wantu magana milongo mishano na mitatu na magana mane.<verse eid="NUM 1:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="NUM 1:44" />Awo, nawo awantu wendile wawazigwe ni Musa na Haluni wakambizwa ni wadya vilongozi milongo midi wa Izulaeli, chila chilongozi endaga akachimaila ulukolo lwakwe. <verse eid="NUM 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NUM 1:45" />Waizulaeli wagosi wose wendaga na mihilimo milongo midi na kujendeleza awo wadahaga kwita kwe nkondo wawazagwa kuligana na kaya zawo na nkolo zawo. <verse eid="NUM 1:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="NUM 1:46" />Chahamwenga uwazwa wawo wose wendaga ni magana milomgo mtandatu na milonngo mitatu na magana mashano na milongo mishano.<verse eid="NUM 1:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="NUM 1:47" />Mna mwa awantu awo, Walawi hawawazigwe, <verse eid="NUM 1:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="NUM 1:48" />kwaviya Chohile kamgamba Musa, <verse eid="NUM 1:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="NUM 1:49" />“Usekuwawaza wantu we idikabila dya Walawi mwa awantu wa Izulaeli, <verse eid="NUM 1:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="NUM 1:50" />mna awo nowasagule watende wachimaila mwe Idihema Dikukile ne viya vyakwe vyose na chila chintu chiyumo mndani mwakwe, nawatende wakenula hamwenga ne viya vyakwe vyose. Nawasankane umo mndani na kwika nkambi zawo kudizunguluka. <verse eid="NUM 1:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="NUM 1:51" />Naho chipindi Idihema Dikukile dikauswa Walawi nawo wakungwa wadyuse na chipindi dikachimaliswa Walawi nawo wakungwa wadichimalise. Mntu yoyose suyo Mlawi nadisogeile nakomwe. <verse eid="NUM 1:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="NUM 1:52" />Waizulaeli watuhu wose nawaike nkambi zawo mabunga bunga, chila yumwenga mwe dibunga naike chilagiso chakwe. <verse eid="NUM 1:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="NUM 1:53" />Mna Walawi nawaike nkambi zawo kuzunguluka Idihema Dikukile chani mntu yoyose anasekudisogeila niyo ahosa maya yangu yawamukila wantu wa Izulaeli.” <verse eid="NUM 1:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="NUM 1:54" />Ivyo Waizulaeli niyo wadamanya saviya vyose Zumbe Chohile amlagize Musa.<verse eid="NUM 1:54" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="NUM 2" />
  <para style="s">Malagizo ya kuzenga nkambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 2:1" />Zumbe Chohile kawenka Musa na Haluni, malagizo yakutimila. <verse eid="NUM 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 2:2" />“Waizulaeli nawaike nkambi zawo, chila kabila nadikale nkambi hantu he bendela yawo, he chilagiso cho ulukolo lwawo, nawaike nkambi zawo kudizunguluka Idihema Dikukile.”<verse eid="NUM 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 2:3" />“Wadya nawaike inkambi ntendele yo ulailo wa zuwa kuhinga ulailo wa zuwa nawatende bunga dya wantu wakwikala he chilagiso cha Yuda na chilongozi ywawo natende Nashoni mwana ywa Aminadabu. <verse eid="NUM 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 2:4" />Bunga dyakwe kuligana na viya wawazigwe ni wagosi milongo mfungate na milongo mine na magana mtandatu. <verse eid="NUM 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 2:5" />Wadya nawatimile kwika inkambi nyumani mwa wantu wa Yuda nawatende kabila dya Isakali, chilongozi ywawo natenda ni Nasaneli mwana ywa Suali, <verse eid="NUM 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 2:6" />bunga dyakwe kuligana na viya wawazigwe wagosi wendaga milongo mishano na mine na magana mane. <verse eid="NUM 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 2:7" />Vikaheza, kabila dya Zabuloni, chilongozi ywawo natenda Eliabu mwana ywa Heloni. <verse eid="NUM 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 2:8" />Bunga dyakwe kuligana na wawazigwe wendaga wagosi milongo mishano na mfungate na magana mane. <verse eid="NUM 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 2:9" />Mligano wose wa wantu nautende mwe nkambi ya Yuda kuligana na mabunga yawo ni wantu magana gana mlongo na magana mnane na mtandatu na magana mane. Awo nawo nawalongole chila wakakonga utafi.”<verse eid="NUM 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 2:10" />Kwe ntendele ya kwamwenye mzi, wadya wakwikala he bendela ye dibunga dya Lubeni kuligana na mabunga yawo, chilongozi ywawo natenda Elisuli mwana ywa Shedeuli, <verse eid="NUM 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 2:11" />Bunga dyakwe kuligana na wawazigwe nawatende na wantu milongo mine na mtandatu na magana mashano. <verse eid="NUM 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 2:12" />Vikaheza nawaike nkambi hankanda ha wantu wa Lubeni nawatende ni wantu wa kabila dya Simeoni, wakalogozwa ni Selumieli mwana ywa Sulishadai, <verse eid="NUM 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 2:13" />Bunga dyakwe kuligana na wawazigwe na watende na wantu milongo mishano na chenda magana matatu. <verse eid="NUM 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 2:14" />Dikutimila ni idikabila dya Gadi, wakalongozwa ni Eliasafu mwana ywa Leueli, <verse eid="NUM 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 2:15" />Bunga dyakwe kuligana na wawazigwe nawatende wantu magana milongo mine magana mtandatu na milongo mishano. <verse eid="NUM 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 2:16" />Wose wawazigwe mwe nkambi ya Lubeni kuligana na mabunga yawo ni wantu magana mlongo gana na milongo mishano na imwenga na magana mane na milongo mishano. Wano nawo wakungwa watende wakaidi mo utafi.<verse eid="NUM 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 2:17" />“Vikaheza, nkambi ye idikabila dya Walawi dikatenda dihagati hezinkambi zose wakatenda wenula Idihema Dikukile nawahalawe, chila bunga naditambe kutimilana na hantu hakwe kwa chilagiso.”<verse eid="NUM 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 2:18" />“Ntendele ya uswelo wa zuwa nakutende na chilagiso bunga dya Efulaimu nawaike nkambi kuligana na mabunga yawo wakalongozwa ni Elishama mwana ywa Amihudi. <verse eid="NUM 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 2:19" />Mabunga yakwe kuligana na viya wawazigwe wendaga wagosi magana milongo mine na magana mashano. <verse eid="NUM 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 2:20" />Vikaheza idikabila dya Efulaimu naditimile kabila dya Manase chilongozi ywawo natende Gamalieli mwana ywa Pedasuli, <verse eid="NUM 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 2:21" />bunga dya wawazigwe, wendaga magana milongo mitatu na magana milongo midi, <verse eid="NUM 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 2:22" />Vikaheza kabila dya Benyamini dikalongozwa ni Abidani mwana ywa Gideoni. <verse eid="NUM 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 2:23" />Mabunga ya wadya wawazigwe, wendaga magana milongo mitatu na mishano na magana mane. <verse eid="NUM 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 2:24" />Wantu wose wawazigwe mwe Efulaimu wendaga magana gana na mlongo na magana mnane, kuligana na mabunga yakwe. Nawo nawatambe mwe nkanana ya katatu.”<verse eid="NUM 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 2:25" />“Ntendele ya chenya nawaike nkambi ya bunga dyakwe mwe chilagiso cha Dani wakalongozwa ni Ahiezeli mwana ywa Amishadai. <verse eid="NUM 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 2:26" />Mabunga ya wadya wawazigwe wendaga magana milongo mtandatu na maidi na magana mfungate. <verse eid="NUM 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 2:27" />Wantu wa Asheli nawo wakunga watimile, wakalongozwa ni Pagieli mwana ywa Okilani, <verse eid="NUM 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 2:28" />mabunga yose yawazigwe yendaga magana gana milongo mine na umwenga magana mashano. <verse eid="NUM 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 2:29" />Vikaheza kabila dya Nafutali niyo dyatimila, wakalongozwa ni Ahila mwana ywa Enani, <verse eid="NUM 2:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 2:30" />mabunga ya wawazigwe, wendaga magana gana milongo mishano na mitatu na magana mane. <verse eid="NUM 2:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 2:31" />Wantu wose wawazigwe mwe idibunga dya Dani wendaga wantu magana mlongo gana na milongo mishano na mfungate na magana mtandatu. Awo nawo nawatende mwe bunga dya udumo mwe chilagiso chawo.”<verse eid="NUM 2:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 2:32" />Awo nawo Waizulaeli wawazigwe kuligana ne izinkolo za mabunga yawo, wose wendaga magana gana mlongo mtandatu na magana mashano na milongo mishano. <verse eid="NUM 2:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 2:33" />Mna Walawi hawawazigwe mwa wana wa Izulaeli, saviya Zumbe amlagize Musa. <verse eid="NUM 2:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 2:34" />Vino nivyo Waizulaeli wadamanye chila chintu saviya Zumbe amlagise Musa niyo waika nkambi zawo, kutimila chilagiso chawo niyo watamba chila yumwenga akatimilana na kaya na nkolo zawo.<verse eid="NUM 2:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="NUM 3" />
  <para style="s">Wana wa Haluni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 3:1" />Wakutimila nawo welekwa wa Haluni na Musa wawazigwe mwe idizuwa Zumbe Chohile alongaga na Musa kolugulu lwa Sinai. <verse eid="NUM 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 3:2" />Mazina ya wana wa Haluni, mwelekwa ywakwe ywa nkongo ni Nadabu, Abihu na Eleazali na Itamali. <verse eid="NUM 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 3:3" />Wano wasentagwa kwa kuhakwa mavuta chani watende walavyantambiko. <verse eid="NUM 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 3:4" />Mna Nadabu na Abihu wabanikaga wakamsankanila Zumbe Chohile, chipindi wamlavize Chohile moto heukungwa mwe dijangwa dya Sinai. Wano hawana wana. Ivyo Eleazali na Itamani watenda saviya walavyantambiko chipindi cho wikazi wa Haluni tati yawo.<verse eid="NUM 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Walawi wasagulwa kuwasankanila walavyantambiko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 3:5" />Niyo Zumbe amgamba Musa, <verse eid="NUM 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 3:6" />“Wegale Walawi, uwaike ha mlavyantambiko Haluni chani wamsankanile. <verse eid="NUM 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 3:7" />Nawamsankanile Haluni na Waizulaeli wose hamwenga mwe Dihema Dikukile. <verse eid="NUM 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 3:8" />Nawavidime iviya vye Dihema Dikukile na kuwambiza Waizulaeli wakadamanya ndima zawo. <verse eid="NUM 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 3:9" />Walawi naumwinke Haluni na welekwa wakwe walavyantambiko, awo walavigwa mgati mwa Waizulaeli. <verse eid="NUM 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 3:10" />Naumsente Haluni na wanawe watende walavyantambiko mna uneva mntu mtuhu anasogela Idihema Dikukile nakomwe.” <verse eid="NUM 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 3:11" />Zumbe niyo amgamba Musa,<verse eid="NUM 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 3:12" />“Haluse siwasagula Walawi mgati mwa Waizulaeli wose, mwa mwelekwa ywa nkongo mgosi mwa mamiyake mwe chila kaya ya Izulaeli. Walawi ni wangu, <verse eid="NUM 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 3:13" />Ivyo chila mwelekwa ywa nkongo mwa Izulaeli ni ywangu. Umo nawakomaga welekwa wa nkongo wose wa Wamisili nasikukiza chila mwelekwa ywa nkongo mwe Izulaeli atende mntu hegu mnyama natende ywangu. Miye ni Zumbe.”<verse eid="NUM 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Walawi wawazwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 3:14" />Vikaheza Zumbe niyo amgamba Musa mwe dijangwa dya Sinai, <verse eid="NUM 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 3:15" />“Wawaze wana wa Lawi wose kuligana ne zikaya zawo na walukolo wawo, chila mgosi kukongela wana wata lika dya mwezi umwenga na kujendeleza.” <verse eid="NUM 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 3:16" />Ivyo, Musa niyo awawaza, saviya alagizwe ni Zumbe.<verse eid="NUM 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 3:17" />Wano nawo wendaga wana wa Lawi Gelisoni, Kohati na Melali. <verse eid="NUM 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 3:18" />Yano nayo amazina ya wana wa Gelisoni kuligana ne zinkolo zawo Libuni na Shimei. <verse eid="NUM 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 3:19" />Wana wa Kohati kuligana ne zinkolo zawo ni Amlamu na Ishali na Hebuloni na Uzieli. <verse eid="NUM 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 3:20" />Wana wa Melali kuligana ne izinkolo zawo ni Mahili na Mushi. Wano nawo welekwa wa Walawi.<verse eid="NUM 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 3:21" />Walibuni na Washimei nawo walawane no ulukolo lwa Gelisoni. <verse eid="NUM 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 3:22" />Uwazwa wawo umo wawazagwa wagosi wose wendaga kukongela wata lika dya mwezi umwenga na kujendeleza ni magana mlongo mfungate na magana mashano. <verse eid="NUM 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 3:23" />Nkolo za Wagelishoni nawaike nkambi yawo ntendele ya uswelo wa zuwa na kunyuma kwe Idihema Dikukile. <verse eid="NUM 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 3:24" />Eliasafu mwana ywa Laeli nuyo endaga umkulu ywo lukolo lwa Wagelisoni. <verse eid="NUM 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 3:25" />Ndima za wana wa Gelisoni zendaga ni kudima Idihema Dikukile hamwenga ne ingubiko yakwe, hamwenga ne idipaziya dyo lwivi lwe Dihema Dikukile, <verse eid="NUM 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 3:26" />mapaziya yo uwa wi mwe Dihema Dikukile na inchanja yo kulaviza ntambiko na paziya dyo lwivi lwo uwa ne izisigi zakwe. <verse eid="NUM 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 3:27" />Nkolo za Wamlami na Waishali na Wahebuloni na Wauzieli zalawanaga na Kohati. <verse eid="NUM 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 3:28" />Awo wawazigwe wagosi wose kukongela wata lika dya mwezi umwenga na kujendeleza wendaga wantu magana milongo mnane na magana mtandatu wasankane Hantu Hakukile. <verse eid="NUM 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 3:29" />Nkolo za Kohati nazike nkambi yawo ntendele ya kwamwenye mzi ye Dihema Dikukile. <verse eid="NUM 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 3:30" />Elisafani mwana ywa Uzieli, endaga mkulu ywe izinkolo za Wakohati. <verse eid="NUM 3:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 3:31" />Awo indima yawo yendaga ni kudima idishanduku dye dilagano, meza, chiya cha kwikiya itaa, ne nchanja yo kulaviza ntambiko, viya vya walavyantambiko wakusankana mwe Dihema Dikukile na paziya dikupagula hantu Hakukile na Hantu Hakukise, ndima zose izo zendaga zawo. <verse eid="NUM 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 3:32" />Eleazali mwana ywa mlavyantambiko Haluni kaikwa kutenda sekulu ywa wakulu wa Walawi na mdimi ywa wandima wose wa Hantu Hakukile. <verse eid="NUM 3:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 3:33" />Nkolo za Wamahili na Wamusi zilawana na Melali, <verse eid="NUM 3:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 3:34" />Zino ni zinkolo za Melali. Wagosi wose wawazigwe kukongela wata lika dya mwezi umwenga na kujendeleza wendaga wantu magana milongo mtandatu na magana maidi. <verse eid="NUM 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 3:35" />Mkulu ywo lukolo lwa Melali endaga Sulieli mwana ywa Abihaili, wano nawaike nkambi yawo ntendele ya chenya mwe Dihema Dikukile. <verse eid="NUM 3:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 3:36" />Awo indima yawo yendaga kudima izimbawo ze Dihema Dikukile, imiti yakwe na nguzo ne visimiko na vintu vyose vya kutozeza Idihema Dikukile. <verse eid="NUM 3:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 3:37" />Ivyo wongigwa kudima izinguzo zizunguluke ne visimiko vyakwe, mitunga ne izisigi zakwe. <verse eid="NUM 3:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 3:38" />Musa na Haluni na wanawe nawaike nkambi yawo kulongozi kwe Idihema Dikukile ntendele ya ulailo wa zuwa, ndima yawo naitende kusankana mwe Hantu Hakukile kwa dyodyose dyungike kudamanyika kwa chausa cha Waizulaeli. Mntu mtuhu yoyose nasogele hajihi nakomwe. <verse eid="NUM 3:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 3:39" />Kuwazwa kwa Walawi kuligana na walukolo wawo, wagosi wose kukongela wana wata lika dya mwezi umwenga na kujendeleza awo Musa na Haluni wawazize kwa lagizo dya Zumbe, wendaga wantu magana milongo midi na magana maidi.<verse eid="NUM 3:39" /></para>
  <para style="s">Walawi waguha hantu hawelekwa wa nkongo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 3:40" />Vikaheza Zumbe niyo amgamba Musa, “Wawaze na kuwandika amazina ya wagosi welekwa wa nkongo wose wa Izulaeli kukongela wata lika dya mwezi umwenga na kujendeleza. <verse eid="NUM 3:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 3:41" />Nisentela Walawi miye Zumbe watende hantu hawelekwa wa nkongo na welekwa wa nkongo wo ludimo lwa Walawi hantu holudimo lwa wantu wa Izulaeli.” <verse eid="NUM 3:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 3:42" />Ivyo, Musa niyo awawaza welekwa wa nkongo wose wa wantu wa Izulaeli saviya Zumbe alagize. <verse eid="NUM 3:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="NUM 3:43" />Welekwa wa nkongo wagosi wazigwe na kuwandikwa amazina yawo, kukongela wata lika dya mwezi umwenga na kujendeleza, wendaga magana milongo midi na magana maidi na milongo mfungate na ntatu. <verse eid="NUM 3:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="NUM 3:44" />Zumbe Chohile niyo amgamba Musa, <verse eid="NUM 3:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NUM 3:45" />“Waike Walawi wose watende wangu mwa welekwa wa nkongo wa Waizulaeli. Naho unikiye izinjeku za Walawi wose mo lweleko lwa nkongo mo ludimo lwa Waizulaeli. Miye ni Zumbe. <verse eid="NUM 3:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="NUM 3:46" />Mna kwaviya kuna welekwa wa nkongo wa wagosi mwa Waizulaeli kujinka Walawi, ivyo wadya wantu wa Izulaeli magana maidi na milongo mfungate na ntatu wongezekele waungwa wakombolwe kulaila kwangu, <verse eid="NUM 3:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="NUM 3:47" />nauhokele kwa chila mgosi hela shekeli shano, kuligana ne chihimo cha Hantu Hakukile, ivyo ni mligano na chumbu vihande milongo midi, <verse eid="NUM 3:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="NUM 3:48" />izihela za amaliho yawo wadya wongezekele wawazigwe na umwinke Haluni na wanawe.” <verse eid="NUM 3:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="NUM 3:49" />Ivyo, Musa niyo azumila, aguha izihela za maliho yawo wongezekele wawazigwe walihilwe ni Walawi, <verse eid="NUM 3:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="NUM 3:50" />ahokela kulaila kwa welekwa wa nkongo wa Izulaeli hela mligano we shekeli gana dimwenga magana matatu milongo mtandatu na mishano, kuligana ne chihimo che Idihema Dikukile, <verse eid="NUM 3:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="NUM 3:51" />Musa niyo awenka Haluni na wanawe izihela izo za maliho saviya Zumbe alagize.<verse eid="NUM 3:51" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="NUM 4" />
  <para style="s">Ndima wenkigwe Wakohati</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 4:1" />Zumbe awagamba Musa na Haluni, <verse eid="NUM 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 4:2" />“Muwawaze wantu wo lukolo lwa Kohati, mwe izinkolo za Lawi, kutimila kaya zawo na nkolo zawo, <verse eid="NUM 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 4:3" />namuwawaze wagosi wose wata lika dya mihilimo milongo mitatu na milongo mishano wakudaha kusankana mwe Idihema Dikukile. <verse eid="NUM 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 4:4" />Ndima ya wana Kohati naitende kukaulisa vintu vikukise. <verse eid="NUM 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 4:5" />Chipindi cho kusamiza inkambi, Haluni na wanawe nawengile mwe Dihema Dikukile na kuseleza idipaziya dikupagula Hantu Hakukile na Hantu Hakukise hedishanduku dye dilagano, ukaheza wadigubike ne dipaziya idyo. <verse eid="NUM 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 4:6" />Mlanga mwakwe nawaike ngubiko ya mkota udeleke wa mnyama akwikala mwe bahali, ukajika nawaike mlanga mwakwe chitambala cha langi ibuluu iyodu. Ukajika nawaike mitengo ya kwinuila idishanduku idyo. <verse eid="NUM 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 4:7" />Naho mlanga mwe meza ya kulaviza migate ikwikwa ha Zumbe nawagubike chitambala che langi ya buluu na mlanga mwakwe nawaike sahani, visahani vya ubani, bakuli na binauli, kwa chausa cha kulaviza malavyo yakunywa mazuwa yose nakutende na mgate mlanga mwe meza. <verse eid="NUM 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 4:8" />Ukajika nawavigubike viya vino vyose kwa chitambala chinkundu na mlanga mwakwe na waike ngubiko ya mkota udeleke wa mbuzi. Ukajika nawaingize imitengo yakwe ya kwinuila imeza, <verse eid="NUM 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 4:9" />nawachiguhe ichitambala che langi ibuluu chiya na wagubikile ichiya cho kwikiya taa ne zita zakwe, mikasi yakwe, sahani zakwe ne viya vyose vikudamanyiza kwikiya mavuta ya mizaituni. <verse eid="NUM 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 4:10" />Nawaike hamwenga ne viya vyakwe vyose mndani mwe mkota udeleke wa mbuzi na kuvitaliza mwe imitengo yo kwinuila. <verse eid="NUM 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 4:11" />Ukajika wagubike chitambala cha langi ibuluu mlanga mwe nchanja idamanywe kwa zahabu ya kulaviza ntambiko na ngubiko ya mkota udeleke wa mbuzi. Ukajika na uingize imitengo yakwe yo kwinuila. <verse eid="NUM 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 4:12" />Nawaguhe viya vyose vikujeseza mwe Hantu Hakukile na wavigubike kwa chitambala cha langi buluu na kuvigubika kwa mkota udeleke wa mbuzi, ukajika nawavike mlanga mwe imitengo yakwe yo kwinuila. <verse eid="NUM 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 4:13" />Nawause amaivu mlanga mwe nchanja ya shaba yo kulaviza ntambiko za kutikimya na mlanga mwakwe nawagubike chitambala che langi izambalau. <verse eid="NUM 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 4:14" />Mlanga mwakwe na waike viya vyose vikujesezwa mo mviko mwe nchanja yo kulaviza ntambiko champa na zae na mabakuli. Ukaheza, mlanga mwakwe nawagubike ngubiko ya mkota udeleke wa mbuzi na kwingiza imitengo yakwe yo kwinuila. <verse eid="NUM 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 4:15" />Ukaheza Haluni na wanawe wagubike Hantu Hakukile hamwenga ne viya na ivintu vyakwe vyose, wakatenda wemalanya kukonga intambo, wantu wo lukolo lwa Kohati na weze na kuvinula. Mna wawo hawakungigwa kutoza iviya ivyo wanase kukomwa. Iyo niyo indima yo lukolo lwa Kohati chila chipindi Idihema Dikukile dikausigwa. <verse eid="NUM 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 4:16" />Eleazeli mwana ywa mlavyantambiko Haluni nadime amavuta ye ita, ubani wa kuvunkiza malavyo ye izinkande za chila zuwa na mavuta yo kuhaka na chila chintu chikukile mwe Dihema idyo.” <verse eid="NUM 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 4:17" />Ukajika Zumbe niyo awagamba Musa na Haluni,<verse eid="NUM 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 4:18" />“Msekuleka ulukolo lwa Kohati mwa Walawi lukakomwa. <verse eid="NUM 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 4:19" />Ivyo, chani kuwachinda wanase kukomwa kwa kusogeila iviya ivyo vikukile mna naudamanye vino, Haluni na wanawe nawengile na kuwapangila chila yumwenga na undima wakwe. <verse eid="NUM 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 4:20" />Mna welekwa wa Kohati hawengile kuvikaula vintu ivyo vikukise wanadamanya ivyo nawakomwe.”<verse eid="NUM 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ndima wenkigwe Walawi wo lukolo lwa Gelisoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 4:21" />Niyo Zumbe amgamba Musa, <verse eid="NUM 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 4:22" />“Wawaze wantu wo lukolo lwa Gelisoni kutimila kaya zawo na nkolo zawo, <verse eid="NUM 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 4:23" />nauwawaze wagosi wose wata lika dya kukongela mihilimo milongo mitatu na mihilimo milongo mishano wakudaha kusankana mwe Dihema Dikukile. <verse eid="NUM 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 4:24" />Ndima yawo naitende ino, <verse eid="NUM 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 4:25" />nawenule diipaziya dye Dihema Dikukile hamwenga ne ngubiko yakwe, ngubiko ya mkota udeleke wa mbuzi chimlanga mwakwe ne dipaziya dye inchili, <verse eid="NUM 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 4:26" />namapaziya ne izisigi zo uwa wi mmpezo mwe idihema na mwe nchanja yo kulaviza ntambiko, mapaziya ye nchili yo uwa, ne vintu vyose vyokujeseza hamwenga ne vintu vino. Awo nawasankane ne zimbuli zose zikunga ivintu ivyo. <verse eid="NUM 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 4:27" />Haluni na wanawe walavyantambiko nawo wakunga walavye lagizo mwe izindima zose za Wagelisoni mwe vintu wakunga wenule ne izindima wakunga wadamanye. Nauwasangile vintu vyose viya wakungigwa wenule. <verse eid="NUM 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 4:28" />Ino niyo indima ya walukolo wa Gelisoni mwe Idihema Dikukile na wadamanye ndima wakalongozwa ni Itamali mwana ywa mlavyantambiko Haluni.”<verse eid="NUM 4:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ndima wenkigwe Walawi wo lukolo lwa Melali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 4:29" />“Ukajika uwawaze wana wa Melali, kutimilana na kaya zawo na izinkolo zawo. <verse eid="NUM 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 4:30" />Nauwawaze wagosi wose wata lika dya mihilimo milongo mitatu na wata lika dya mihilimo milongo mishano, wakudaha kwingila mwe undima we kusankana mwe Dihema kikukile. <verse eid="NUM 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 4:31" />Wowo nawatende na ndima ya kwinula mbawo na miti na vyegamo vye Dihema Dikukile. <verse eid="NUM 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 4:32" />Ivyo nawenule nguzo zo uwa zo kuzuguluka ntendele zose na visimiko na vijinji na sigi hamwenga na vintu vyakwe vyose ne viya vyakwe vyose. Naho weye na uwasangile vintu wakungigwa wenule.”<verse eid="NUM 4:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Walawi wawazwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 4:33" />“Ino niyo indima ya wantu wo ulukolo lwa Melali, mwe Dihema Dikukile nawalongozwe ni Itamali mwana ywa mlavyantambiko Haluni.” <verse eid="NUM 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 4:34" />Ivyo, Musa na Haluni na vilongozi wa Waizulaeli niyo wawawaza wantu wo lukolo lwa Kohati, kutimilana ne izikaya zawo, <verse eid="NUM 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 4:35" />Niyo wawawaza wantu wose wata lika dya mihilimo milongo mitatu wata lika dya milongo mishano, chila mntu awagile kwingila mwe undima wa kusankana mwe Idihema Dikukule. <verse eid="NUM 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 4:36" />Uwazwa wawo kutimila walukolo wawo wendaga wantu magana milongo midi na magana mfungate na milongo mishano. <verse eid="NUM 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 4:37" />Awo nawo wawazigwe mwe walukolo wa Wakohati, wadya wasankane mwe Dihema Dikukile wadya Musa na Haluni wawazize saviya Zumbe amlagize Musa. <verse eid="NUM 4:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 4:38" />Uwazwa wa wantu wo lukolo lwa Gelisoni kutimila kaya zawo, <verse eid="NUM 4:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 4:39" />Kukongela wa lika dya mihilimo milongo mitatu kubula lika dya mihilimo milongo mishano, wawagile kusankana mwe Dihema Dikukile. <verse eid="NUM 4:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 4:40" />Wendaga wantu magana milongo midi magana mtandatu na milongo mitatu. <verse eid="NUM 4:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 4:41" />Uno nuwo wendaga uwazwa wa wantu wa lukolo lwa wana Gelisoni wose wasankane mwe Dihema Dikukile, wadya Musa na Haluni wawazize saviya Zumbe amlagize. <verse eid="NUM 4:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 4:42" />Uwazwa wo lukolo lwa Melali kutimila nkolo wawo na kaya zawo. <verse eid="NUM 4:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="NUM 4:43" />Wata lika dikukongela mihilimo milongo mitatu na milongo mishano wawagile kusankana mwe Dihema Dikukile. <verse eid="NUM 4:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="NUM 4:44" />Wendaga wantu magana milongo mitatu na magana maidi. <verse eid="NUM 4:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NUM 4:45" />Uno nuwo uwazwa wa wantu wo lukolo lwa Melali awo Musa na Haluni wawawazize saviya Zumbe amlagize Musa. <verse eid="NUM 4:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="NUM 4:46" />Ivyo, Walawi wose wawazigwe ni Musa na Haluni ne vilongozi wa wantu kwa kutimila kaya na nkolo zawo zose. <verse eid="NUM 4:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="NUM 4:47" />Wata mihilimo kukongela milongo mitatu na milongo mishano, naho wawagila mwe indima yo kwinula Idihema Dikukile, <verse eid="NUM 4:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="NUM 4:48" />Mligano wawo wendaga wantu magana milongo mnane magana mashano na milongo mnane. <verse eid="NUM 4:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="NUM 4:49" />Chila yumwenga kenkingwa ndima yakwe ya kudamanya mwo kwinula Idihema Dikukile saviya Zumbe amlagize Musa.<verse eid="NUM 4:49" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="NUM 5" />
  <para style="s">Wantu wazavu mwe isila yo kumvikila Choile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 5:1" />Zumbe amgamba Musa, <verse eid="NUM 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 5:2" />“Walagize Waizulaeli wamlavye kuse kwe nkambi chila mntu mta moha na chila mntu akulawa ufila na chila mntu mwavu kwa kutoza wabanike. <verse eid="NUM 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 5:3" />Namuwalavye kuse kwe nkambi wantu wose awo, wagosi kwa wavyele hewekuwagila chani wasekubalanga inkambi yangu hwikala.” <verse eid="NUM 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 5:4" />Waizulaeli nivyo wadamanya, wawalavya kuse kwe nkambi saviya Zumbe amlagize Musa.<verse eid="NUM 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Maliho ya masa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 5:5" />Vikaheza, Zumbe amgamba Musa, <verse eid="NUM 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 5:6" />“Wagambile Waizulaeli Kugamba, mntu yoyose mgosi hegu mvyele anamkola masa mnyawe, uyo natende kadamanya wavu kwa miye Zumbe. <verse eid="NUM 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 5:7" />Aungwa ausizwe masa yakwe adamanye, nalavye maliho jejeje kwa masa yakwe, akongeza chihimo milongo midi cha maliho ayo, nalavye maliho ayo kwa yudya amkoile amasa. <verse eid="NUM 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 5:8" />Mna uneva mntu uyo kabanika naho hana mlukolo ywa tombo dimwe yudya akudaha kuhokela amaliho ayo, ivyo maliho ya masa nayalavigwe kwa Zumbe, wenkigwe walavyantambiko, maliho ayo ni hamwenga na ndolome kwa wivano wa yudya najeseze kwa masa yakwe. <verse eid="NUM 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 5:9" />Chila malavyo yasentigwe kwa Zumbe ya Waizulaeli nawalavye nayatende ya mlavyantambiko. <verse eid="NUM 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 5:10" />Chila chintu chisentigwe cha mntu nachitende cha mlavyantambiko na chintu chochose mntu akumlaviza mlavyantambiko nachitende chakwe.”<verse eid="NUM 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malaho ya wavyele sawo wakanuni kwa wagosi zawo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 5:11" />Niyo Zumbe amgamba Musa, <verse eid="NUM 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 5:12" />“Wagambile Waizulaeli uneva mvyele ywa mntu anazaganya na kumbalanga mgosiwe na kuswesa ukanuni kwa mgosiwe, <verse eid="NUM 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 5:13" />kwa kujenda na mgosi mtuhu yoyose akumanya kanibalanga hata hegu hahana mntu awone mbuli iyo kwa viya hagwiligwe. <verse eid="NUM 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 5:14" />Mna, uneva mgosiwe anengilwa ni nkama na kutenda na chinyulu mwa mkaziwe he balange hegu katenda na chinyulu mwa mkaziwe hata hegu mkaziwe habalange, <verse eid="NUM 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 5:15" />ivyo wose waidi nawaite kwa mlavyantambiko na kwigala malavyo yakungigwa, nikugamba chilo imwenga ya unga wa shaili mna haunajele mavuta hegu vunkizo kwavivyo ni lavyo dya nkande ya mgosi mta chinyulu kwa mkaziwe kwa lukumbusa lwa masa. <verse eid="NUM 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 5:16" />Mlavyantambiko namwigale uyo mvyele hajihi, nakumchimalisa ha Zumbe. <verse eid="NUM 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 5:17" />Vikaheza najuluze mazi yakukile mwe viya vya ulongo naguhe lumbi dya hasi he Idihema Dikukile na kudijela mwa ayo mazi kuyatenda ye sungu. <verse eid="NUM 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 5:18" />Mlavyantambiko namwigale kwa Zumbe na kumchakula izifili na kumwinka uyo mvyele idilavyo idyo dye nkande ikulavigwa kwachausa che chinyulu cha mgosiwe. Mlavyantambiko mwenye natoze ichiya icho cha amazi yesungu yakwigala ligito.” <verse eid="NUM 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 5:19" />Vikaheza mlavyantambiko namuwapize uyo mvyele akagamba, “Uneva hujendile na mgosi mtuhu na kwebalanga chipindi ukatenda na mgosiwo, ivyo, hombwilwe ni ligito dikwigalwa ni yano amazi yesungu. <verse eid="NUM 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 5:20" />Mna hegu kujenda na mgosi mntuhu kuno ukamanya unamgosiwo, mna kejela uzavu kwa kujenda na mgosi mtuhu, <verse eid="NUM 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 5:21" />Zumbe akwangalaze utende na ligito na cheliso mwa wantu wako, utende hukweleka naho inda yako ituntumke. <verse eid="NUM 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 5:22" />Mazi yano yakwigala ligito yengile mwe inda yako na kukutenda usekweleka ne inda yako ituntumke.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NUM 5:22">Uyo mvyele nazumile, “Taile, sizumila.”<verse eid="NUM 5:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 5:23" />Vikaheza mlavyantambiko nawandike idiligito idyo na kudijela mwa amazi ayo yesungu dilujukile umo, <verse eid="NUM 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 5:24" />Vikaheza namnywese amazi yesungu uyo mvyele yakuhosa idiligito nayo nayamwingile na kumtenda alumiswe ni kundani uneva katenda imbuli iyo. <verse eid="NUM 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 5:25" />Ivyo mlavyantambiko naguhe idilavyo dye zinkande ze chinyulu mwe mikono yo mvyele uyo na kwinula kwa Zumbe, nakudigala mlanga mwe nchanja yo kumvikila Chohile. <verse eid="NUM 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 5:26" />Vikaheza naguhe fumba dimwenga mwe idilavyo idyo dyo unga kwa lukumbusa na kudyoka mwe nchanja yo kumvikila Chohile. Ivyo namnywese amazi ayo uyo mvyele. <verse eid="NUM 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 5:27" />Akaheza ukunywa, hegu kejela uzavu na hatendile mkanuni kwa mgosiwe mazi ayo yakwigala idiligito nayengile mwe inda yakwe na kumtenda alumiswe, naho inda yakwe na ituntumke naye natende hakweleka. Mvyele uyo natende na ligito mwa awantu wakwe. <verse eid="NUM 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 5:28" />Mna uneva mvyele uyo hejeile uzavu nawagile kwa Chohile, ivyo haligitwe naho natende na cheleko. <verse eid="NUM 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 5:29" />Dino nidyo idilagizo dye mbuli ye chinyulu mwe mvyele akatenda na mgosiwe, akafosa na kwejela uzavu, <verse eid="NUM 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 5:30" />hegu mgosi natozwe ni chinyulu na kutenda na nkama na mkaziwe. Namchimalise umvyele uyo ha Zumbe, mlavyantambiko nachisanye malagizo yose ye sigilizi ino. <verse eid="NUM 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 5:31" />Mgosiwe hatende na wihi wowose, mna mvyele nenule wihi wakwe.<verse eid="NUM 5:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="NUM 6" />
  <para style="s">Malagizo ya nazili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 6:1" />Niyo Zumbe amgamba Musa, <verse eid="NUM 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 6:2" />Uwenke Waizulaeli malagizo yano, uneva mgosi hegu mvyele anaika nazili, kweika kwa Zumbe, <verse eid="NUM 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 6:3" />enege kukolwa asekunywa divai hegu mpombe yoyose idamanywe kwa zabibu naho asekunywa chochose chidamanywe kwa zabihu hegu kudya zabibu ziviye hegu zinyaile. <verse eid="NUM 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 6:4" />Chipindi chose akatenda na nazili asekudya chintu chochose chikulawana na zabibu hegu mbeyu hegu amakanka yakwe.<verse eid="NUM 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 6:5" />Mazuwa yose ye nazili yakwe anasekuwegula izifili zakwe, kubula mwe chipindi che nazili yakwe yokweika kwakwe kwa Zumbe, natende mkuka, naleke izifili zo mtwi wakwe zikule zitende ntali. <verse eid="NUM 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 6:6" />Mazuwa yose natende kakuka kwa Zumbe mntu uyo asekusogeila chiimba cha mntu, <verse eid="NUM 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 6:7" />hata hegu ni tati yakwe hegu nine hegu mlukolo hegu lumbudye, chani ase kwejela uzavu, kwaviya chilagiso che nazili yakwe kwa Zumbe ikomtwi. <verse eid="NUM 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 6:8" />Chipindi chose akatenda ne nazili kakuka kwa Zumbe Chohile. <verse eid="NUM 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 6:9" />Uneva mntu yoyose ehajihi na yudya ekiye inazili niyo anabanika kwa chipumpa ivyo izifili za uyo aikiye inazili nazitende na uzavu, uyo mta inazili nekale mazuwa mfungate akaheza nawegule izifili zakwe atenda mkuka. <verse eid="NUM 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 6:10" />Mwe dizuwa dya mnane negale wasuwa manga waidi hegu machinda maidi ya suwa manga kwa mlavyantambiko he nchili ye Dihema Dikukile. <verse eid="NUM 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 6:11" />Mlavyantambiko nalavye akamwenga katende lavyo kwachausa cha masa na akatuhu katenda lavyo dya kutikimya, naye namdamanyize mviko wa wivano, kwaviya kadamanya masa kwachausa kukufya chiimba. Mwe idizuwa idyo nakukize umtwi wakwe. <verse eid="NUM 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 6:12" />Nakweika kwa Zumbe kwa mazuwa yakwe yo kwesenta. Idyo idizuwa dya nkongo hadiwazwe kwa viya izifili zakwe zendile zikukile zijelwa uzavu. Nalavye ndolome ina mhilimo umwenga kutenda lavyo dya kusa masa.<verse eid="NUM 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 6:13" />Ino niyo isigilizi ya mta nazili akabinda ichipindi chakwe cho kwekukiza. Negalwe he nchili ye Dihema Dikukile, <verse eid="NUM 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 6:14" />nakumlaviza Zumbe jeleko dyakwe. Mwana ndolome imwenga ya mhilimo umwenga heina lema ya lavyo dya kutikimya, mwate umwenga wa mhilimo umwenga heuna lema ya lavyo dya kusa masa na ndolome imwenga heina lema ya lavyo dya utondowazi. <verse eid="NUM 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 6:15" />Ivyo nalavye ntangulu ya migate he ijeligwe hamila. Mandazi ya unga ulegele na mavuta, na migate misisili ihakigwe mavuta hamwenga na lavyo dya nkande na vyakunywa.<verse eid="NUM 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 6:16" />Mlavyantambiko namlavize Zumbe vintu vyose ivyo hamwenga na lavyo dyakwe dya masa na lavyo dyakwe dya kutikimya. <verse eid="NUM 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 6:17" />Namlavize Zumbe iyo indolome itende lavyo ya utondowazi na mlavye hamwenga na ntangulu ya migate heigwaduswe, lavyo dya nkande na vyakunywa. <verse eid="NUM 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 6:18" />Uyo mta kwika inazili nawegule izifili zakwe he nchili ye Idihema Dikukile na kuzoka mo moto wihasi he nchanja yo kulaviza ntambiko yo utondowazi. <verse eid="NUM 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 6:19" />Vikaheza mlavyantambiko naguhe umkono we indolome ikatenda yambikwa hamwenga na ndazi dimwenga dijeligwe hamila imwe ntangulu ye migate imisisili ivyo heijeligwe hamila na kumwinka mta inazili mwe mikono anajika kuwegula izifili zakwe ananazo mwe chipindi cho kwekukiza. <verse eid="NUM 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 6:20" />Vikaheza mlavyantambiko navinule ivintu ivyo saviya lavyo dya kwinula kwa Zumbe, vyose vino ni malavyo yakukile kwa mlavyantambiko, hamwenga ne chifuwa chinulwe ne idiwambo dilavigwe saviya lavyo. Nyumani mwa ayo yose, mta inazili adaha kunywa idivai. <verse eid="NUM 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 6:21" />“Ino niyo isigilizi ikumunga mta kwika nazili. Lavyo dyakwe kwa Zumbe kuligana ne inazili yakwe, kujendeleza chintu chochose chituhu akudaha kulavya nadamanye kuligana ne inazili ekiye, viya isigilizi yo kweika ukuka kwakwe.”<verse eid="NUM 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ujimbiko wa Chohile kujinkila walavyantambiko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 6:22" />Niyo Zumbe amgamba Musa, <verse eid="NUM 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 6:23" />wagambile Haluni na wanawe vino nivyo mkungwa muwajimbike Waizulaeli. Namuwagambe. <verse eid="NUM 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 6:24" />Zumbe awajimbike na kuwadima, <verse eid="NUM 6:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 6:25" />Zumbe awasinye kwa wedi na kuwadamanyiza yedi.<verse eid="NUM 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 6:26" />Zumbe awalagiseni uwedi wakwe na kuwenkani utondowazi. <verse eid="NUM 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 6:27" />Vino nivyo walavyantambiko nawawajimbike wantu wa Izulaeli, wanadamanya ivyo nami naniwajimbike awantu awo.<verse eid="NUM 6:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="NUM 7" />
  <para style="s">Malavyo ya vilongozi mwe kudichimalisa Idihema Dikukile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 7:1" />Mwe dizuwa Musa eze aheze kuchimalisa Idihema niyo adijidila mavuta chani adikukize hamwenga ne viya vyakwe vyose. Niyo aijidila mafuta inchanja yo kulaviza ntambiko na kuikukiza hamwenga ne viya vyakwe vyose. <verse eid="NUM 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 7:2" />Vikaheza vilongozi wa Izulaeli na wakulu wa nkolo na vilongozi wa chila kabila walavya malavyo yawo, awo ni wadya wamwambize Musa mokuwaza awantu, <verse eid="NUM 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 7:3" />Wamwigaila Zumbe malavyo yawo myutuka igubikwe mtandatu ikubuluzwa ni njeku mlongo umwenga na mbili, mutuka umwenga kwa vilongozi waidi na njeku imwenga kwa chila chilongozi. Vikaheza wavilavya he Dihema Dikukile, <verse eid="NUM 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 7:4" />Zumbe niyo amgamba Musa, <verse eid="NUM 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 7:5" />“Hokela amalavyo yano chani ya damanye ndima mwe Idihema Dikukile, uwenke Walawi, chila yumwenga kwa ndima yakwe.” <verse eid="NUM 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 7:6" />Ivyo, Musa aguha myutuka ne izinjeku awenka Walawi. <verse eid="NUM 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 7:7" />Wagelisoni niyo wenkigwa myutuka midi na njeku nne, kwe ndima yawo, <verse eid="NUM 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 7:8" />na Wamelali winkigwa myutuka mine na njeku mnane kwa kuwambiza mwezindima zawo zose. Wagelisoni na Wamelali awo wendaga mwe ulongozi wa Itamali mwana ywa mlavyantambiko Haluni. <verse eid="NUM 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 7:9" />Mna Musa hawenkile myutuka na njeku Wakohati kwaviya wowo wendaga na ndima ya kudima vintu vikukile viya vyungigwe vihagatwe.<verse eid="NUM 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malavyo ya vilongozi mwe inchaja yo kulaviza ntambiko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 7:10" />Vilongozi awo niyo walavya lavyo kukukiza inchanja yo kulaviza ntambiko zuwa diya ijidilwe mavuta, walavya malavyo yawo he nchanja yo kulaviza ntambiko. <verse eid="NUM 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 7:11" />Zumbe niyo amgamba Musa, “Chila zuwa chilongozi yumwenga nalavye lavyo dyakwe kukukiza inchanja yo kulaviza ntambiko.”<verse eid="NUM 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 7:12" />Zuwa dya nkongo Nasoni mwana ywa Aminadabu chilongozi ywe idikabila dya Yuda alavyaga. <verse eid="NUM 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 7:13" />Malavyo yakwe yendaga ni sahani imwenga ya chumbu ina uzami wa chilo imwenga na nusu, na bakuli dimwenga dya chumbu dina uzami wa gilamu magana mnane, kuligana na vihimo vye Idihema Dikukile, viya vyose vidi vyamemaga unga udinyike uhanganywe na mavuta kwa lavyo dya nkande, <verse eid="NUM 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 7:14" />chisosa chimwenga cha zahabu kina uzami wa gilamu gana dimwenga na mlongo umwenga chimemile mavunkizo, <verse eid="NUM 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 7:15" />njeku imwenga na ndolome imwenga na ndolome imwenga ya mhilimo umwenga, naitende lavyo dya kutikimya, <verse eid="NUM 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 7:16" />vulata dimwenga ditende lavyo dya kusa masa, <verse eid="NUM 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 7:17" />kwa lavyo dya utondowazi njeku mbili na ndolome shano na mavulata mashano na ndolome shano za mhilimo umwenga. Ayo yose nayo amalavyo ya Nashoni mwana ywa Aminadabu.<verse eid="NUM 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 7:18" />Zuwa dya kaidi Nasanieli mwana ywa Suali, chilongozi ywa kabila dya Isakali, alavyaga. <verse eid="NUM 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 7:19" />Malavyo yakwe yendaga ni sahani imwenga ya chumbu ina uzami wa chilo imwenga na nusu na bakuli dimwenga dya chumbu dina uzami wa gilamu magana mnane kuligana ne ivihimo vye Idihema Dikukile, viya ivyo vyose vidi vyamemaga unga udinyike uhanganywe na mavuta, kutenda lavyo dya nkande, <verse eid="NUM 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 7:20" />chisose chimwenga cha zahabu kina uzami wa gilamu gana dimwenga na mlongo umwenga chikatenda chimemaga mavunkizo, <verse eid="NUM 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 7:21" />kajeku kamwenga na ndolome imwenga na ndolome ya mhilimo umwenga, itende lavyo dya kutikimya, <verse eid="NUM 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 7:22" />vulata dimwenga ditende lavyo dya kusa masa, <verse eid="NUM 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 7:23" />kwa lavyo dya utondowazi njeku mbili na ndolome shano na mavulata mashano na ndolome shano za mhilimo umwenga. Ayo yose nayo amalavyo ya Nasanieli mwana ywa Suali.<verse eid="NUM 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 7:24" />Zuwa dya katatu Eliabu mwana ywa Heloni, mwanawe umkulu Zabuloni alavyaga. <verse eid="NUM 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 7:25" />Malavyo yakwe yendaga sahani imwenga ya chumbu ina uzami wa chilo imwenga na nusu na bakuli dimwenga dya chumbu dina uzami wa gilamu magana mnane kuligana ne ivihimo vye Idihema Dikukile, viya ivyo vyose vidi vyamemaga unga udinyike uhanganywe na mavuta, vitende lavyo dya nkande, <verse eid="NUM 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 7:26" />chisosa chimwenga cha zahabu, kina uzami wa gilamu gana dimwenga na mlongo umwenga, chimemile mavunkizo, <verse eid="NUM 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 7:27" />kanjeku kamwenga na ndolome imwenga na ndolome imwenga ina mhilimo umwenga, vitende lavyo dya kutikimya, <verse eid="NUM 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 7:28" />vulata dimwenga ditende lavyo dya kusa masa, <verse eid="NUM 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 7:29" />kwa lavyo dya utondowazi, njeku mbili na ndolome shano na mavulata mashano na ndolome shano za mhilimo umwenga. Ayo yose nayo yendaga amalavyo ya Eliyabu mwana ywa Heloni.<verse eid="NUM 7:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 7:30" />Zuwa dya kane Elisuli mwana ywa Shedeuli, chilongozi ywe idikabila dya Lubeni alavyaga. <verse eid="NUM 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 7:31" />Malavyo yakwe yendaga sahani imwenga ya chumbu ina uzami wa chilo imwenga na nusu na bakuli dimwenga ya chumbu dina uzami wa gilamu magana mnane kuligana ne ivihimo vye Idihema Dikukile, viya ivyo vyose vidi vyendaga vimemaga unga udinyike uhanganywe na mavuta, vitende lavyo dya nkande, <verse eid="NUM 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 7:32" />chisosa chimwenga cha zahabu kina uzami wa gilamu gana dimwenga na mlongo umwnga kimemile mavunkizo, <verse eid="NUM 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 7:33" />kanjeku kamwenga na ndolome imwenga na ndolome imwenga ya mhilimo umwenga vitende lavyo dya kutikimya, <verse eid="NUM 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 7:34" />vulata dimwenga ditende lavyo ya kusa masa, <verse eid="NUM 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 7:35" />kwa lavyo dya utondowazi njeku mbili na ndolome shano na mavulata mashano na ndolome shano za mhilimo umwenga kwa malavyo ya utondowazi. Ayo yose nayo yendaga amalavyo ya Elisuli mwana ywa Shedeuli.<verse eid="NUM 7:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 7:36" />Zuwa dya shano Shelumieli mwana ywa Sulishadai chilongozi ywe idikabila dya Simeoni alavyaga. <verse eid="NUM 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 7:37" />Malavyo yakwe yendaga sahani imwenga ya chumbu ina uzami wa chilo imwenga na nusu na bakuli dimwenga dya chumbu dina uzami wa gilamu magana mnane kuligana ne ivihimo vye Idihema Dikukile. Viya ivyo vyose vidi vyendaga vimema unga udinyike uhanganywe na mavuta, vitende lavyo dya nkande, <verse eid="NUM 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 7:38" />chisosa chimwenga cha zahabu kina uzami wa gilamu gana dimwenga na mlongo umwenga chimemile mavunkizo, <verse eid="NUM 7:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 7:39" />kajeku kamwenga na ndolome imwenga na mwana ndolome yumwenga ywa mhilimo umwenga kwa malavyo ya kutikimya, <verse eid="NUM 7:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 7:40" />vulata dimwenga ditende lavyo dya kusa masa, <verse eid="NUM 7:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 7:41" />kwa lavyo dya utondowazi njeku mbili na ndolome shano na mavulata mashano na ndolome shano zina mhilimo umwenga kwa malavyo ya utondowazi. Ayo yose nayo yendaga amalavyo ya Shelumieli mwana ywa Sulishadai.<verse eid="NUM 7:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 7:42" />Zuwa dya mtandatu Eliasafu mwana ywa Deueli chilongozi ywe idikabila dya Gadi alavyaga. <verse eid="NUM 7:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="NUM 7:43" />Malavyo yakwe yendaga sahani imwenga ya chumbu ina uzami wa chilo imwenga na nusu na bakuli dimwenga dya chumbu dina uzami wa gilamu magana mnane, kuligana ne ivihimo vye Idihema Dikukile. Viya ivyo vyose vidi vyendaga vimema unga udinyike uhanganywe na mavuta, vitende lavyo dya nkande, <verse eid="NUM 7:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="NUM 7:44" />chisosa chimwenga cha zahabu kina uzami wa gilamu gana dimwenga na mlongo umwenga chimemile mavunkizo, <verse eid="NUM 7:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NUM 7:45" />kajeku kamwenga na ndolome imwenga na mwana ndolome yumwenga ywa mhilimo umwenga kwa malavyo ya kutikimya, <verse eid="NUM 7:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="NUM 7:46" />vulata dimwenga ditende lavyo dyo kuza masa, <verse eid="NUM 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="NUM 7:47" />kwa lavyo dya utondowazi njeku mbili na mavulata mashano na ndolome shano na ndolome za mhilimo umwenga kwa malavo ya utondowazi. Ayo yose nayo yendaga amalavo ya Eliasafu mwana Deuli.<verse eid="NUM 7:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="NUM 7:48" />Zuwa dya mfungate Elishama mwana ywa Amihudi chilongozi ywe idikabila dya Efulaimu alavyaga. <verse eid="NUM 7:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="NUM 7:49" />Malavyo yakwe yendaga sahani imwenga ya chumbu ina uzami wa chilo imwenga na nusu na bakuli dimwenga dya chumbu dina uzami wa gilamu magana mnane, kuligana ne ivihimo vye Idihema Dikukile. Viya ivyo vyose vidi vyendaga vimema unga udinyike uhanganywe na mavuta, vitende lavyo dya nkande, <verse eid="NUM 7:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="NUM 7:50" />chisosa chimwenga cha zahabu kina uzami wa gilamu gana dimwenga na mlongo umwenga chimemile mavunkizo, <verse eid="NUM 7:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="NUM 7:51" />kajeku kamwenga na ndolome imwenga na mwana ndolome yumwenga ywa mhilimo umwenga kwa malavyo ya kutikimya, <verse eid="NUM 7:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="NUM 7:52" />vulata dimwenga ditende lavyo dyo kuza masa, <verse eid="NUM 7:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="NUM 7:53" />kwa lavyo dya utondowazi njeku mbili na mavulata mashano na ndolome shano na ndolome shano za mhilimo umwenga. Ayo yse nayo yendaga amalavo ya Elishama mwana ywa Amihudi.<verse eid="NUM 7:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="NUM 7:54" />Zuwa dya mnane Gamalieli mwana ywa Pedasueli, chilongozi ywe idikabila dya Manase alavyaga. <verse eid="NUM 7:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="NUM 7:55" />Malavyo yakwe yendaga sahani imwenga ya chumbu ina uzami wa chilo imwenga na nusu na bakuli dimwenga dya chumbu dina uzami wa gilamu magana mnane, kuligana ne ivihimo vye Idihema Dikukile. Viya ivyo vyose vidi vyendaga vimema unga udinyike uhanganywe na mavuta, vitende lavyo dya nkande, <verse eid="NUM 7:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="NUM 7:56" />chisosa chimwenga cha zahabu kina uzami wa gilamu gana dimwenga na mlongo umwenga chendaga chimema mavunkizo, <verse eid="NUM 7:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="NUM 7:57" />kajeku kamwenga na ndolome ya mhilimo umwenga kwa lavyo dya kutikimya, <verse eid="NUM 7:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="NUM 7:58" />vulata dimwenga ditende lavyo dya kusa masa, <verse eid="NUM 7:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="NUM 7:59" />kwa lavyo dya utondowazi njeku mbili na mavulata mashano na ndolome shano na ndolome za mhilimo umwenga. Ayo yose nayo yendaga amalavo ya Gamalieli mwana ywa Pedasueli.<verse eid="NUM 7:59" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="NUM 7:60" />Zuwa dya chenda Abidani mwana ywa Gidioni chilongozi ywe idikabila dya Benjamini alavyaga. <verse eid="NUM 7:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="NUM 7:61" />Malavyo yakwe yendaga sahani imwenga ya chumbu ina uzami wa chilo imwenga na nusu na bakuli dimwenga dya chumbu dina uzami wa gilamu magana mnane, kuligana ne ivihimo vye Idihema Dikukile. Viya ivyo vyose vidi vyendaga vimema unga udinyike uhanganywe na mavuta, vitende lavyo dya nkande, <verse eid="NUM 7:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="NUM 7:62" />chisosa chimwenga cha zahabu kina uzami wa gilamu gana dimwenga na mlongo umwenga chimemile mavunkizo, <verse eid="NUM 7:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="NUM 7:63" />kajeku kamwenga na ndolome ya mhilimo umwenga kwa lavyo dya kutikimya, <verse eid="NUM 7:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="NUM 7:64" />vulata dimwenga ditende lavyo dya kusa masa, <verse eid="NUM 7:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="NUM 7:65" />kwa lavyo dya utondowazi njeku mbili na mavulata mashano na ndolome shano na ndolome shano za mhilimo umwenga. Ayo yose nayo yendaga amalavo ya Abidani mwana ywa Gidioni.<verse eid="NUM 7:65" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="NUM 7:66" />Zuwa dya mlongo Ahiezeli mwana ywa Amishadai chilongozi ywe idikabila dya Dani alavyaga. <verse eid="NUM 7:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="NUM 7:67" />Malavyo yakwe yendaga sahani imwenga ya chumbu ina uzami wa chilo imwenga na nusu na bakuli dimwenga dya chumbu dina uzami wa gilamu magana mnane, kuligana ne ivihimo vye Idihema Dikukile. Viya ivyo vyose vidi vyendaga vimema unga udinyike uhanganywe na mavuta, vitende lavyo dya nkande, <verse eid="NUM 7:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="NUM 7:68" />chisoa chimwenga cha zahabu kina uzami wa gilamu gana dimwenga na mlongo umwenga chimemile mavunkizo, <verse eid="NUM 7:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="NUM 7:69" />njeku imwenga ya mhilimo umwenga kwa lavyo dya kutikimya, <verse eid="NUM 7:69" /><verse number="70" style="v" sid="NUM 7:70" />vulata dimwenga ditend lavyo dya kusa masa, <verse eid="NUM 7:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="NUM 7:71" />kwa lavyo dya utondowazi njeku mbili na mavulata mashano na ndolome shano na ndolome shano za mhilimo umwenga. Ayo yose nayo yendaga amalavo ya Ahiezeli mwana ywa Amishadai.<verse eid="NUM 7:71" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="NUM 7:72" />Zuwa dya mlongo na imwe Pagieli mwana ywa Okilani chilongozi ywe idikabila dya Asheli alavyaga. <verse eid="NUM 7:72" /><verse number="73" style="v" sid="NUM 7:73" />Malavyo yakwe yendaga sahani imwenga ya chumbu ina uzami wa chilo imwenga na nusu na bakuli dimwenga dya chumbu dina uzami wa gilamu magana mnane, kuligana ne ivihimo vye Idihema Dikukile. Viya ivyo vyose vidi vyendaga vimema unga udinyike uhanganywe na mavuta, vitende lavyo dya nkande, <verse eid="NUM 7:73" /><verse number="74" style="v" sid="NUM 7:74" />chisosa chimwenga cha zahabu kina uzami wa gilamu gana dimwenga na mlongo umwenga chimemile mavunkizo, <verse eid="NUM 7:74" /><verse number="75" style="v" sid="NUM 7:75" />njeku imwenga ya mhilimo umwenga kwa lavyo dya kutikimya, <verse eid="NUM 7:75" /><verse number="76" style="v" sid="NUM 7:76" />vulata dimwenga ditende lavyo dya kusa masa, <verse eid="NUM 7:76" /><verse number="77" style="v" sid="NUM 7:77" />kwa lavyo dya utondowazi njeku mbili na mavulata mashano na ndolome shano na ndolome shano za mhilimo umwenga. Ayo yose nayo yendaga amalavo ya Pegieli mwana ywa Okilani.<verse eid="NUM 7:77" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="78" style="v" sid="NUM 7:78" />Zuwa dya mlongo na mbidi Ahila mwana ywa Enani chilongozi ywe idikabila dya Nafutali alavyaga. <verse eid="NUM 7:78" /><verse number="79" style="v" sid="NUM 7:79" />Malavyo yakwe yendaga sahani imwenga ya chumbu ina uzami wa chilo imwenga na nusu na bakuli dimwenga dya chumbu dina uzami wa gilamu magana mnane, kuligana ne ivihimo vye Idihema Dikukile. Viya ivyo vyose vidi vyendaga vimema unga udinyike uhanganywe na mavuta, vitende lavyo dya nkande, <verse eid="NUM 7:79" /><verse number="80" style="v" sid="NUM 7:80" />chisosa chimwenga cha zahabu kina uzami wa gilamu gana dimwenga na mlongo umwenga chimemile mavunkizo, <verse eid="NUM 7:80" /><verse number="81" style="v" sid="NUM 7:81" />kajeku kamwenga na ndolome ya mhilimo umwenga kwa lavyo dya kutikimya, <verse eid="NUM 7:81" /><verse number="82" style="v" sid="NUM 7:82" />vulata dimwenga ditende lavyo dya kusa masa, <verse eid="NUM 7:82" /><verse number="83" style="v" sid="NUM 7:83" />kwa lavyo dya utondowazi njeku mbili na mavulata mashano na ndolome shano na ndolome shano za mhilimo umwenga. Ayo yose nayo yendaga amalavo ya Ahila mwana ywa Enani.<verse eid="NUM 7:83" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="84" style="v" sid="NUM 7:84" />Malavyo yose ye ivilongozi wa Izulaeli kwachausa che inchanja yo kulaviza ntambiko mwe idizuwa isentigwe, yendaga sahani za chumbu mlongo umwenga na mbili na bakuli ya chumbu mlongo umwenga na mbili na visosa vya zahabu mlongo na vidi. <verse eid="NUM 7:84" /><verse number="85" style="v" sid="NUM 7:85" />Chila sahani ya chumbu uzami wakwe wendaga chilo imwenga na nusu na chila chisosa chendaga na uzami wa gilamu magana mnane. Ivyo viya vyose ivyo vyendaga na uzami wa chilo milongo midi na mfungate na gilamu magana mtandatu kuligana ne ivihimo vye Idihema Dikukile.<verse eid="NUM 7:85" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="86" style="v" sid="NUM 7:86" />Ivisosa vye zahabu mlongo umwenga na vidi vimemile amavunkizo, chila chimwenga chendaga na uzami wa gilamu gana dimwenga na mlongo umwenga kuligana ne vihimo vye Idihema Dikukile, ivyo vyose chahamwenga uzami wakwe wendaga chilo imwenga na gilamu magana matatu na milongo midi. <verse eid="NUM 7:86" /><verse number="87" style="v" sid="NUM 7:87" />Wanyama wose wa amalavyo yo kutikimya ni majeku mlongo umwenga na maidi na ndolome mlongo umwenga na mbili na ndolome za mhilimo umwenga mlongo umwenga na mbili hamwenga na malavyo ya nkande na mavulata mlongo umwenga na maidi kwa lavyo dya kusa masa, <verse eid="NUM 7:87" /><verse number="88" style="v" sid="NUM 7:88" />kwa lavyo dya utondowazi, wanyama walavigwe wendaga ni majeku milongo midi na mane na ndolome milongo mtandatu na ndolome za mhilimo umwenga milongo mtandatu. Ayo nayo amalavyo yalavyagwa kwachausa che inchanja yo kulaviza ntambiko, umo ize iheze kujidilwa mavuta. <verse eid="NUM 7:88" /><verse number="89" style="v" sid="NUM 7:89" />Musa eze engile mndani mwe Dihema Dikukile kulonga na Zumbe Chohile, niyo eva izwi kulaila ntendele ya kulanga ye ngubiko, mlanga mwe dishanduku dye dilagano, kulaila hagati heviya ivyumbe ividi vina mawawawa vikwitangwa makelubi.<verse eid="NUM 7:89" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="NUM 8" />
  <para style="s">Malagizo mo kwika izita</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 8:1" />Niyo Zumbe amgamba Musa, <verse eid="NUM 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 8:2" />“Umgambile Haluni kugamba chipindi naike ziya izita mfungate mwe chiya cha kwikiya izita, azike chani zilangaze ntendele ya kulongozi ye chiya icho.” <verse eid="NUM 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 8:3" />Haluni azumila lagizo idyo, niyo aika izita izo chani zilangaze ntendele ya kulongozi ye ichiya, saviya Zumbe amlagize Musa. <verse eid="NUM 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 8:4" />Ivyo nivyo chasanagwa ichiya icho che izita kulaila kulanga kubula hasi chendaga chisanwa kwa untanda kwa zahabu ifuligwe kutimilana na ivyo Zumbe amlagize Musa.<verse eid="NUM 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malagizo ya kuwasenta Walawi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 8:5" />Naho Zumbe amgamba Musa, <verse eid="NUM 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 8:6" />“Uwasente Walawi mwa Waizulaeli na kuwakukiza. <verse eid="NUM 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 8:7" />Vino nivyo ukunga uwakukize uwamyagile mazi ya kwekukiza akaheza uwagambe wemonye mwili mjima, wafule suche zawo nawatende wawagila. <verse eid="NUM 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 8:8" />Vikaheza waguhe kajeku imwenga hamwenga na lavyo dyakwe dya nkande na unga udinyike uhanganywe na mavuta, nauguhe kajeku ntuhu itende lavyo dya kusa masa. <verse eid="NUM 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 8:9" />Wegale Walawi kulongozi kwe Idihema Dikukile, ukaheza wachisanye Waizulaeli wose, <verse eid="NUM 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 8:10" />umo Walawi wakatenda kulongozi kwa Zumbe Waizulaeli nawawaikiye mikono mwe mitwi yawo. <verse eid="NUM 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 8:11" />Vikaheza Haluni nawaike awo Walawi kulongozi kwangu saviya lavyo dya kwinulwa mwa Waizulaeli chani wanisankanile. <verse eid="NUM 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 8:12" />Ivyo Walawi nawaike imikono yawo mwe mitwi ye izinjeku izo, imwenga noilavye kutenda lavyo dya kusa masa, na iyo intuhu nailavye itende lavyo dya kutikimya ikulavigwa kwangu, kwa kuwadamanyiza Walawi wivano.”<verse eid="NUM 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 8:13" />“Vikaheza nowachimalise Walawi kwa Haluni na wanawe na kuwaika kwangu watende saviya lavyo dya kwinula. <verse eid="NUM 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 8:14" />Vino nivyo nowasente Walawi mwa Waizulaeli chani watende wangu. <verse eid="NUM 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 8:15" />Vikaheza kuwakukiza Walawi nawatende wawagila wadaha kudamanya ndima ze Idihema Dikukile. <verse eid="NUM 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 8:16" />Wano walavigwa watende wangu jejeje, hantu ha welekwa wa nkongo wa Waizulaeli. <verse eid="NUM 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 8:17" />Kwaviya welekwa wose wa nkongo mwa waizulaeli ni wangu, wantu na wanyama, kwaviya nawatendaga wakukile mweidizuwa nawakomaga welekwa wa nkongo wose wa Misili. <verse eid="NUM 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 8:18" />Haluse nawaguha Walawi hantu ha welekwa wa nkongo mwa Waizulaeli, <verse eid="NUM 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 8:19" />Siwalavya kwa Haluni na wanawe, watende jeleko kulaila kwa Waizulaeli, chani wadahe kudamanya ndima mwe Idihema Dikukile kwa Waizulaeli na kuwadamanyiza wivano kusekulaila nkunto mwa Waizulaeli wakasogeila Idihema Dikukile.” <verse eid="NUM 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 8:20" />Ivyo Musa na Haluni na Waizulaeli wose wawaikaga Walawi kwa Zumbe, saviya Zumbe amlagize Musa. <verse eid="NUM 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 8:21" />Walawi niyo wekukiza na kufula izisuche zawo, Haluni niyo awalavya saviya lavyo dya kwinulwa kwa Zumbe. Iviya Haluni niyo awakukiza chani kuwadamanyiza wivano. <verse eid="NUM 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 8:22" />Vikaheza Walawi niyo waita wakudamanya ndima mwe Idihema Dikukile wakalongozwa ni Haluni na wanawe, saviya Zumbe amlagize Musa.<verse eid="NUM 8:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 8:23" />Zumbe amgamba Musa, <verse eid="NUM 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 8:24" />“Chila Mlawi mta lika dya mihilimo milongo midi na mishano na kujendeleza, nawadamanye ndima mwe Idihema Dikukile, <verse eid="NUM 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 8:25" />kukongela lika dya mihilimo milongo mishano naleke ndima, asekusankana vituhu. <verse eid="NUM 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 8:26" />Walawi awo wadaha kuwambiza Walawi weyawe wakasankana mwe Idihema, mna hakungigwa kudamanya ndima yoyose ichedu. Vino nivyo nowenke Walawi wadamanye ndima.”<verse eid="NUM 8:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="NUM 9" />
  <para style="s">Pasaka ya kaidi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 9:1" />Ivyo mwo mwezi wa nkongo mo mhilimo wa kaidi nyumani mwa Waizulaeli kulaila Misili, Zumbe niyo alonga na Musa kwe dijangwa dya Sinai. Niyo amgamba, <verse eid="NUM 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 9:2" />“Waizulaeli watoze zuwa dye ngasu ye Pasaka kwa chipindi chikigwe. <verse eid="NUM 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 9:3" />Dino naditende zuwa dya mlongo na nne yo mwezi uno, chipindi cha chisingi nawadamanye ivyo kutimilana na malagizo ne miko yakwe yose.” <verse eid="NUM 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 9:4" />Ivyo, Musa awagambila wantu kugamba wongigwa kutoza idizuwa idyo dye Pasaka. <verse eid="NUM 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 9:5" />Ivyo wasendemka Ipasaka chisingi, zuwa dya mlongo na nne dyo mwezi wa nkongo, mwe dijangwa dya Sinai. Waizulaeli wadamanya yose saviya Zumbe amlagize Musa.<verse eid="NUM 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 9:6" />Mna wantu wamwenga na wehadya na hewekudaha kusendemka mwe Pasaka kwa viya nawatoza viimba, niyo watenda wazavu. Awo wawabasa Musa na Haluni, <verse eid="NUM 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 9:7" />Niyo wawagamba, “Suwe hachikukile kwa viya chitoza vimba, mna kwa mbwani chilemezwe kumlaviza Zumbe malavyo yakwe kwa chipindi chungigwe hamwenga na Waizulaeli watuhu?”<verse eid="NUM 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 9:8" />Musa awahitula, “Gojani kubula aho Zumbe nanigambile dyokudamanya mwenyu.”<verse eid="NUM 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 9:9" />Zumbe niyo amgamba Musa, <verse eid="NUM 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 9:10" />Yumwenga ywenyu hegu yumwenga mwa welekwa wenyu akatenda hakukile kwa viya katoza chiimba hegu akatenda ehale mwe ntambo, mna akatenda aunga asendemke mwe Pasaka, <verse eid="NUM 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 9:11" />Mntu sauyo ongigwa adamanye ivyo mwezi umwenga ukajinka, uhelo we dizuwa dya mlongo na mine yo mwezi wa kaidi. Nadamanye kwa kudya migate he ijeligwe hamila na mboga isungu. <verse eid="NUM 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 9:12" />Wasekusigaza nkande yoyose kubula mtando, naho wasekutula vuha dyodyose dye nyama ye Pasaka. Nawasendemke mwe Pasaka kuligana na malagizo yakwe yose. <verse eid="NUM 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 9:13" />Mna mntu yoyose akuwagila hegu hamuli mwe ntambo hanadamanye Ipasaka, apagulwe na wantu wakwe kwa viya hanilavize lavyo kwa chipindi chungigwe. Mntu uyo nasulumizwe masa yakwe. <verse eid="NUM 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 9:14" />“Uneva kuna mjeni akwikala naye naaunge kudamanya ngasu ye Pasaka, mntu uyo aungigwa adamanye ivyo kuligana na viya vikungigwa na malagizo yose ye Pasaka. Chila mntu natimile malagizo ayadya, akatenda mjeni hegu mkaya.”<verse eid="NUM 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ingu dya moto mlanga mwe Idihema</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 9:15" />Mwe idizuwa Idihema Dikukile dikigwa, ingu dyaselaga na kugubika Idihema idyo. Chipindi cha nechilo ingu idyo diwonigwa saviya moto kubula mtondo. <verse eid="NUM 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 9:16" />Ivyo nivyo navili chila zuwa, ingu dyagubikaga Idihema Dikukile nomsi, na nechilo dyawonekaka saviya moto. <verse eid="NUM 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 9:17" />Chila nkanana ingu idyo dikenulwa mlanga mwe Idihema, Waizulaeli wavuna inkambi na kwika nkambi naho hantu hatuhu hadya idingu nadichimale. <verse eid="NUM 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 9:18" />Watambaga kwa lagizo dya Zumbe, na kwika nkambi naho kwa lagizo dyakwe. Chipindi chose idyo idingu dikatenda mlanga mwe Idihema, wantu wekalaga mwe inkambi iyo. <verse eid="NUM 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 9:19" />Hata hegu Idingu idyo dyekalaga mlanga mwe idihema kwa chipindi chitali, Waizulaeli watimila ivyo Zumbe natende, hawahalaile. <verse eid="NUM 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 9:20" />Chipindi chituhu ingu idyo dyekalaga mlanga mwe Idihema kwa mazuwa majeche du. Waizulaeli watambaga kwa lagizo dya Zumbe, naho waikaga nkambi kwa lagizo dya Zumbe. <verse eid="NUM 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 9:21" />Chipindi chituhu ingu idyo dyekalaga mlanga mwe Idihema kulaika chisigi kubula mtando, iviya dikakwinulwa wantu awo wakongaga ntambo. Hegu nadikala mlanga mwe Idihema msi wose na chilo chose, wowo wahalawa du umo ingu idyo dikenulwa. <verse eid="NUM 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 9:22" />Ikatenda ni mazuwa maidi hegu mwezi mjima hegu chipindi chitali, chipindi chochose ingu dikatenda mlanga mwe Idihema, Waizulaeli hawahalaile, iviya dikakwinulwa nawo wahalawa. <verse eid="NUM 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 9:23" />Watambaga kwa lagizo dya Zumbe naho waikaga nkambi kwa lagizo dya Zumbe. Watoza lagizo dya Zumbe saviya alagize kwa sila ya Musa.<verse eid="NUM 9:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="NUM 10" />
  <para style="s">Gunda disanigwe kwa chumbu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 10:1" />Zumbe niyo amgamba Musa, <verse eid="NUM 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 10:2" />“Sana magunda maidi ya chumbu. Magunda ayo noyajeseze kuchisanyiza wantu na umo mokuwagambila wavune inkambi. <verse eid="NUM 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 10:3" />Umo magunda yose maidi yakatoigwa chahamwenga wantu wose nawadugane haguhi na weye kulongozi kwe inchili ye Idihema Dikukile. <verse eid="NUM 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 10:4" />Mna dinatoigwa gunda dimwenga du, vilongozi wa amakabila ya Izulaeli awodu nawo nawadugane haguhi na weye. <verse eid="NUM 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 10:5" />Chilagiso cha kutoigwa gunda dya kwitusa chinalaila, wekazi we izinkambi ntendele ya ulailo wa zuwa nawakonge ntambo. <verse eid="NUM 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 10:6" />Chilagiso icho chokwitusa chikatoigwa nkanana ya kaidi, wadya wantu kwe nkambi ntendele ya kwamwenyemzi nawakonge kuhalawa. Chilagiso icho che idigunda nachitoigwe chila nkanana mkakonga intambo. <verse eid="NUM 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 10:7" />Mna chipindi cha kuwetanga wantu wadugane hamwenga, nayatoigwe magunda hayekwitusa. <verse eid="NUM 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 10:8" />Welekwa wa Haluni walavyantambiko, nawo nawatowe ayo amagunda.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NUM 10:8">“Dino naditende lagizo dyenyu dya kutimila mazuwa yose mwa welekwa wenyu wose.”<verse eid="NUM 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 10:9" />“Chipindi cha nkondo mwe isi yenyu wankondo wakawebungani, namtowe magunda ya maizwi sayadya yokuhalaila ayo yatende chilagiso cha nkondo chani Zumbe, Chohile ywenyu naweveni na kuwakombolani mwa awankondo wenyu. <verse eid="NUM 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 10:10" />Naho mwa mazuwa yenyu ye chinyemi, seiviya mwe ngasu za kutontomoka kwa mnenge na ngasu ntuhu, namtowe amagunda ayo umo mkalavya malavyo yenyu ya kutikimya na malavyo yenyu ya utondowazi. Aho miye Chohile ywenyu naniwakumbukeni. Ni Miye Zumbe, Chohile ywenyu.”<verse eid="NUM 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Waizulaeli wahalawa Sinai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 10:11" />Mwe idizuwa dya mlongo wa kaidi yo mhilimo wa kaidi, mo mwezi wa kaidi kukongela Waizulaeli weze walawe Misili, ingu dyendaga dihalanga he Idihema Dikukile niyo dyenulwa, <verse eid="NUM 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 10:12" />Waizulaeli niyo wakonga ntambo kulaila kwe dijangwa dya Sinai. Ingu idyo niyo dyakwela dyachimala kwe dijangwa dya Palani.<verse eid="NUM 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 10:13" />Wakongaga ntambo nkanana ya nkongo kwa lagizo dya Zumbe saviya dilavigwe ni Musa. <verse eid="NUM 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 10:14" />Wadya wendaga mwe chilagiso cha wankondo we dikabila dya Yuda, niyo walongola, bunga dimwenga kutimila tuhu. Chilongozi ywawo endaga Nasoni mwana ywa Aminadabu. <verse eid="NUM 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 10:15" />Chilongozi ywe idibunga dya wankondo we dikabila dya wana wa Isakali endaga ni Nasaneli. <verse eid="NUM 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 10:16" />Chilongozi dya bunga dya wankondo we idikabila dya Zabuloni endaga ni Eliyabu mwana ywa Heloni.<verse eid="NUM 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 10:17" />Vikaheza Hema niyo dyaselezwa, wantu wo lukolo lwa Gelisoni na Wamelali awo wadinulaga wakonga kuhalawa.<verse eid="NUM 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 10:18" />Ukajika wantu wendaga mwe chilagiso cha wankondo we idikabila dya Lubeni, niyo watimila bunga dimwenga kunyuma kwe tuhu. Chilongozi ywawo nendile ni Elisuli mwana ywa Sedeuli. <verse eid="NUM 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 10:19" />Kabila dya Simeoni nadilongozwa ni Selumieli mwana ywa Sulishadai. <verse eid="NUM 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 10:20" />Elisafu mwana ywa Deweli nendile akalongoza kabila dya Gadi.<verse eid="NUM 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 10:21" />Wantu wa lukolo lwa Kohati niyo watimila, wenula viya vikukile. Weze wabule hema nendile dichimaliswa kale.<verse eid="NUM 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 10:22" />Niyo watimilwa ni wantu we chilagiso cha wankondo we dikabila dya Efulaimu bunga dimwenga kunyuma kwe bunga tuhu. Chilongozi ywawo endiga ni Elisama mwana ywa Amihudi. <verse eid="NUM 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 10:23" />Kabila dya Manase nendile dikalongozwa ni Gamalieli mwana ywa Pedasuli, <verse eid="NUM 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 10:24" />Kabila dya Benyamini nendile dikalongozwa ni Abidani mwana ywa Gidioni.<verse eid="NUM 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 10:25" />Mo udumo wadya wendile mwe chilagiso cha wankondo we idikabila dya Dani, awo wendaga ni wamizi kunyuma kwa amabunga yose ya wagomba nkondo, niyo watamba, bunga dimwenga kunyuma kwe bunga tuhu. Wano nendile wakalongozwa ni Ahizeli mwana ywa Amishadai. <verse eid="NUM 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 10:26" />Kabila dya Asheli nendile dikalongozwa ni Pagieli mwana ywa Okilani. <verse eid="NUM 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 10:27" />Ahila mwana ywa Enani nendile akalongoza kabila dya Nafutali. <verse eid="NUM 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 10:28" />Yano ni mazwelaya Waizulaeli watimile kuligana na mabunga yawo, chila chipindi wakavuna izinkambi wakonge kutamba.<verse eid="NUM 10:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 10:29" />Musa niyo amgamba Hobabu mwana ywa Laweli Mmidiani mnamuwe, “Suwe chatamba chaita hantu Zumbe agambile, Nanimwinkeni ahantu aho. Haluse chitanye, suwe nachikudamanyize yedi kwaviya Zumbe kelisa kuwatendela yedi Waizulaeli.” <verse eid="NUM 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 10:30" />Mna Hobabu niyo ahitula, “Miye sanite na nyuwe, mna nanuye kwe isi yangu na kwawalukolo wangu.”<verse eid="NUM 10:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 10:31" />Musa niyo amgamba, “Hampu usekuchasa, kwaviya weye kumanya hantu chikunga chike nkambi kwe idijangwa, wadaha kuchilagisa kokwita. <verse eid="NUM 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 10:32" />Naho chinaitanya chochose chedi Zumbe nachitendele, nicho notendelwe.”<verse eid="NUM 10:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ntambo yakonga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 10:33" />Wantu niyo watamba kulaila Sinai, lugulu lwa Zumbe. Shanduku dye Idilagano dya Zumbe dyawalongoilaga lujendo lwa mazuwa matatu wakalonda hantu hakwika nkambi. <verse eid="NUM 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 10:34" />Chila nkanana wakatamba kulaila kwe nkambi ino kwita kwe nkambi ntuhu, ingu dya Zumbe nendile dimlanga mwawo nomsi.<verse eid="NUM 10:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 10:35" />Chila nkanana shanduku dikatamba kujendeleza nentambo, Musa nakagamba, “Zumbe Chohile inuka uwatimulaganye wankondo wako awo wakukwihiwa chani wakusumke.” <verse eid="NUM 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 10:36" />Naho chila nkanana dikachimala, Musa nendile akagamba, “Zumbe Chohile yawiye yano mafyo kwa mafyo ya Waizulaeli.”<verse eid="NUM 10:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="NUM 11" />
  <para style="s">Wantu wafuzuma kwedijangwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 11:1" />Wantu niyo wakonga kumfuzumila Zumbe mwe zinkunto zawo, eze eve Zumbe niyo emukawa ni maya. Moto kulaila kwa Zumbe niyo wawakila na koka ntendele imwenga ye nkambi. <verse eid="NUM 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 11:2" />Wantu wamwilila Musa, naye niyo amlombeza Zumbe moto uwo niyo wafa. <verse eid="NUM 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 11:3" />Ivyo ahantu hadya hetangwa Tabela, kwa viya hantu hadya naho umoto wa Zumbe wakile mwa wantu.<verse eid="NUM 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Musa asagula vilongozi milongo mfungate</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 11:4" />Mwa Waizulaeli mwendaga na bunga tuhu ditimilane nawo idyo dyendaga na nkwina nkulu ya kudya nyama. Waizulaeli nawo waila, wakagamba, “Hegu chabwile nyama ya kudya! <verse eid="NUM 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 11:5" />Chakumbuka izisamaki chadyaga Misili hehena maliho, mboga na matigiti na matanga, vitungulu na vitungulu saumu! <verse eid="NUM 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 11:6" />Mna haluse nguvu zichisilila naho hahana nkande ntuhu mna ino imana iyodu.”<verse eid="NUM 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 11:7" />Mana iyo yendaga mbeyu ndodo saviya uhemba naho yendaga na langi injano ihangane na ing'aile. <verse eid="NUM 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 11:8" />Wantu wazunguluka na kuichisanya, wakajika waisaga mwa mayuwe hegu kuibunda, wakajika waitipwilisa na kudamanya migate. Umwile wakwe ni saviya migate yokigwe mwe mavuta ya mizeituni. <verse eid="NUM 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 11:9" />Mnyuzu wize ulagale mwe nkambi chipindi cha nechilo, mana nayo yagwa hamwenga no mnyuzu.<verse eid="NUM 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 11:10" />Musa niyo eva wantu waila wakafuzuma mwa walukolo wose, chila mntu kolwivi lwe dihema dyakwe. Zumbe niyo emukiswa ni maya, Musa naye niyo ehiwa. <verse eid="NUM 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 11:11" />Vikaheza Musa niyo amgamba Zumbe, “Ni mbwani ukunidamanyiza vihiye miye mndima ywako? Ni mbwani sizumilwe ha meso yako? Ni mbwani kunitwisa mzigo wa kuwadima awantu wano wose? <verse eid="NUM 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 11:12" />Miye nimiye niweleke awantu wose wano? Vikuleka ukunigamba niwenule mwe chifuwa saviya mwelesi akwinula lutiti, naho kuwegala kwe isi welisize kuwenka wababa zawo? <verse eid="NUM 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 11:13" />Naniilondole kuhi nyama yose ya kuwalisa awantu wose awa? Kwaviya wakunila wakagamba, Chinke nyama chidye.” <verse eid="NUM 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 11:14" />Miye sikudaha kuwadima awantu wose wano ichedu, kwaviya ino ni ndima ndala vitendese. <verse eid="NUM 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 11:15" />Uneva ivyo nivyo naunitende, na nivyedi usunguze kunikoma! Hegu wadaha unizumile, usekuinileka nijendeleze mwe zikunto zino.<verse eid="NUM 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 11:16" />Vikaheza Zumbe niyo amgamba Musa, “Wachisanye wadalahala milongo mfungate wa Izulaeli, umanyize kugamba watunywa na kuzumilwa ni wantu watende vilongozi, uwegale kwe Idihema Dikukile, wachimale hajihi na weye. <verse eid="NUM 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 11:17" />Nanisele nize nilonge na weye, naniguhe hantu hadodo mo muye hwinkile, niwenke awantu awo. Chani nawo wakwambize mwe indima ya kuwadima awantu wano use kuwadima ichedu.” <verse eid="NUM 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 11:18" />Haluse wagambile awantu vino, “Kwekukizeni kwaviya luvi, namdye nyama. Zumbe keva indilo yenyu kugamba hahana akudaha kuwenkani nyama, naho mkagamba mwekalaga vyedi umo mwendaga Misili.” Haluse Zumbe nawenkeni nyama, nanywi namwidye. <verse eid="NUM 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 11:19" />Namdye nyama naho siyo zuwa dimwenga du, hegu mazuwa maidi du, hegu mazuwa mashano du, hegu mazuwa mlongo du hegu mazuwa milongo midi du, <verse eid="NUM 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 11:20" />mna kwa chipindi cha mwezi mjima! Namwidye niyo mwayehukwa, niyo yawanunkilani naho hamuyunge. Ayo yose nikwaviya mumlemela Zumbe Chohile emwenyu, na kwila mkagamba, “Ni mbwani chikulawa Misili.”<verse eid="NUM 11:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 11:21" />Mna Musa niyo amgamba Zumbe, “Wantu hulongoza ni magana milongo mtandatu wakujenda lwa viga, wenawe wagamba, naniwenke nyama ikuwachinta mwezi mjima! <verse eid="NUM 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 11:22" />Togola, hana ngoto na ngo'mbe zikudaha kuchinjwa na kuwachinta? Hegu samaki zose mwe bahali chinazilowa na ziwachinte?”<verse eid="NUM 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 11:23" />Zumbe niyo amlandula Musa, “Togola udahi wangu uhunguka? Ivyo nauwone ulosi wangu ni wachindedi kwako hegu bule.”<verse eid="NUM 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 11:24" />Ivyo Musa niyo aita na kuwagambila wantu yadya Zumbe alongile. Akaheza, niyo awachisanya wadalahala milongo mfungate awaika hampezo kuzunguluka Idihema Dikukile. <verse eid="NUM 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 11:25" />Zumbe aselaga mwe ingu na kulonga naye. Akaheza aguha hantu hadodo mo muye amwinkaga Musa, niyo awenka chila yumwenga mwa wadya wadalahala milongo mfungate. Weze wengilwe nu umuye uwo, wadalahala awo niyo wakonga kulavya uhima ndege, mna hawavikalise.<verse eid="NUM 11:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 11:26" />Wadalahala waidi mwe wadya milongo mfungate wasagulwe, Elidadi na Medadi, nawasigala kwe nkambi weyawe weze waite kwe Idihema muye uwezila umo mwe nkambi niyo wakonga kulonga mbuli za uwoni wa Chohile ziyaho na mbuli zikwiza hantu ahadya na weli. <verse eid="NUM 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 11:27" />Mmbwnga yumwenga niyo alawa na nkuluko na kumgambila Musa, “Elidadi na Medadi walonga mbuli za uwoni mwe nkambi.”<verse eid="NUM 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 11:28" />Aho Yoshuwa mwana ywa Nuni yudya endile mwambizi ywa Musa kukongela umbwanga wakwe, niyo amgamba Musa, “Sekulu ywangu, walemeze.” <verse eid="NUM 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 11:29" />Mna Musa niyo amhitula, “Togola wawona chinyulu mwangu? Hegu Zumbe awenkile wantu wakwe wose muye wakwe chani nawo watende wawoni!” <verse eid="NUM 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 11:30" />Vikaheza Musa niyo auya kwe nkambi hamwenga na wadya wadalahala milongo mfungate wa Izulaeli.<verse eid="NUM 11:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Zumbe egala nkwale zilozize</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 11:31" />Aho, Zumbe niyo egala nkung'nto, igale nkwale kulaila kwe bahali na kuchima mnkande mwe nkambi, utali wa lujendo lwa zuwa dimwe chila ntendele kuizunguluka inkambi, niyo zaumbala hasi kubula futi ntatu kukwela kulanga. <verse eid="NUM 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 11:32" />Ivyo, zuwa idyo dyose, chilo chose, zuwa ditimile wantu wachisanya nkwale, hahana mntu achisanye vihunguke kubula chilo magana mlongo umwenga. Niyo wazanika zinyale chila hantu hankanda he inkambi. <verse eid="NUM 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 11:33" />Wakatenda wachei na nyama hewenati kubinda, Zumbe niyo awehiwa, niyo awegaila unyonje wihiye, <verse eid="NUM 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 11:34" />ivyo ahantu hadya henkigwa zina dya Kibuloti hatava. Kwaviya uko nuko wahambigwe wantu wendaga na umelo wa kudya nyama.<verse eid="NUM 11:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 11:35" />Kulaila aho Kibuloti hatava niyo wantu watamba kwita Haseloti, niyo waika nkambi uko wekala.<verse eid="NUM 11:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="NUM 12" />
  <para style="s">Miliamu na Haluni wamfuzumila Musa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 12:1" />Vikaheza, Miliamu na Haluni niyo wakonga kumhiga Musa kwaviya nakasola mvyele Mkushi. <verse eid="NUM 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 12:2" />Niyo wagamba, “Vino ni chindedi Zumbe Chohile kalonga na Musa ichedu? Togola, iviya halongile na suwe naswi?” Zumbe Chohile niyo eva ulosi wawo. <verse eid="NUM 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 12:3" />Musa endaga ni mntu mta kunyanyahala kujinka wantu watuhu wose wendaga mwe isi.<verse eid="NUM 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 12:4" />Ahadya, Zumbe Chohile niyo awagamba Musa, Haluni na Miliamu, “Nyuwe watatu soni kwe Idihema Dikukile.” Ivyo, wose watatu niyo waita kwe Idihema Dikukile. <verse eid="NUM 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 12:5" />Zumbe Chohile asela mwe nguzo ya ingu, achimala holwivi lwe Idihema Dikukile, niyo awetanga Haluni na Miliamu. Wose waidi niyo wasogela kulongozi. <verse eid="NUM 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 12:6" />Zumbe Chohile awagamba, “Tegelezani ulosi wangu, hegu hana muoni mwenyu, miye Zumbe Chohile nanelavyanye kwakwe mwe uwoni na kulonga naye mwe sozi. <verse eid="NUM 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 12:7" />Mna mwa mndima ywangu Musa, mbuli zivituhu vitendese. Uyodu nuyo mkanuni simwinka ndima awadime awantu wangu wose wa Izulaeli. <verse eid="NUM 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 12:8" />Miye nalosana naye mlomo kwa mlomo, pwilili sikulonga naye kwa lufyambo. Uyo aniwona ivyo nili miye Zumbe Chohile. Elo, ni mbwani mkulonga mbuli saizo mwa mndima ywangu Musa?”<verse eid="NUM 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 12:9" />Aho Zumbe niyo emukiswa ni maya mwawo, niyo ahalawa zakwe. <verse eid="NUM 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 12:10" />Ingu dize dihalawe mwe Idihema Dikukile, Miliamu niyo awonigwa ana unyonje wa nkanda, ulekile inkanda yakwe ing'ale chwee. Haluni eze ahituke na kumsinya Miliamu, niyo ehelwa kuwona kugamba kengilwa ni unyonje wa nkanda. <verse eid="NUM 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 12:11" />Aho, Haluni niyo amgamba Musa, “Weye sekulu ywangu, chidamanya mbuli za uhezi na kukola masa. Mna usekuchikantila! <verse eid="NUM 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 12:12" />Usekumdamanya Miliamu atende saviya mwana elekwe kabanike, yudya ntili yo mwili ihajihi na kuwola.”<verse eid="NUM 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 12:13" />Musa niyo amwilila Zumbe akagamba, “Nakweila weye Zumbe mhonye!”<verse eid="NUM 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 12:14" />Mna Zumbe niyo amgamba Musa, “Hegu tati yakwe amtwele mate mo uso kwa kumfunda kwaviya kadamanya yehiye, ivyo hapatile yano kwa mazuwa mfungate? Ivyo mwingaseni mwe nkambi ekale uko kuse mazuwa mfungate ukajika wadaha kumlekeila auye kwe nkambi!” <verse eid="NUM 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 12:15" />Ivyo, Miliamu niyo engaswa mwe nkambi kwa mazuwa mfungate. Wantu hawakongile ntambo kubula aho Miliamu avuzigwe vituhu mwe nkambi. <verse eid="NUM 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 12:16" />Wantu awo weze walawe aho niyo wakonga ntambo kulaila Haseloti, waika nkambi mwe dijangwa dya Palani.<verse eid="NUM 12:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="NUM 13" />
  <para style="s">Wantu wakupelemba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 13:1" />Zumbe Chohile niyo amgamba Musa, <verse eid="NUM 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 13:2" />“Lagiza wantu waite wakapelembe isi ya Kanani idya huwenka wantu Waizulaeli. Lagiza mntu yumwenga kulaila mwe chila kabila, mntu uyo aungwa atende chilongozi mwe idikabila dyakwe.”<verse eid="NUM 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 13:3" />Ivyo, Musa niyo adamanya saviya alagizwe ni Zumbe, alagiza wantu kulaila kwe dijangwa dya Palani. Wantu wose walagizwe wendaga vilongozi wa amakabila ya Izulaeli. <verse eid="NUM 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 13:4" />Amazina ya awantu awo ni yano. Kulaila mwe Idikabila dya Lubeni Shaumua endaga mwana ywa Zakaliya. <verse eid="NUM 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 13:5" />Mwe idikabila dya Simoni endaga Shafati mwana ywa Holi. <verse eid="NUM 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 13:6" />Mwe ikabila dya Yuda endaga ni Kalebu mwana ywa Yefune. <verse eid="NUM 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 13:7" />Mwe idikabila dya Isakali endaga ni Igali mwana ywa Yosefu. <verse eid="NUM 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 13:8" />Mwe idikabila dya Efulaimu endaga ni Hoshea mwana ywa Nuni. <verse eid="NUM 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 13:9" />Mwe idikabila dya Benjamini endaga ni Paliti mwana ywa Lafu. <verse eid="NUM 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 13:10" />Mwe idikabila dya Zabuloni endaga ni Gadieli mwana ywa Sodi. <verse eid="NUM 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 13:11" />Mwe idikabila dya Yusufu, Kugamba kabila dya manase, endaga ni Gadi mwana ywa Susi. <verse eid="NUM 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 13:12" />Mwe idikabila dya Dani endaga ni Amieli mwana ywa Gemali. <verse eid="NUM 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 13:13" />Mwe idikabila dya Asheli endaga ni Sesuli mwana ywa Mikaeli. <verse eid="NUM 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 13:14" />Mwe idikabila dya Nafutali endaga ni Nabi mwana ywa Wofisi. <verse eid="NUM 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 13:15" />Mwe idikabila dya Gadi endaga ni Geueli mwana ywa Maki. <verse eid="NUM 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 13:16" />Yano nayo amazina ya wantu awo Musa awalagize waite wakaipelembe isi ya Kanani. Musa amwinka Hosea mwana ywa Nuni zina hya, amwitanga Yoshuwa. <verse eid="NUM 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 13:17" />Eze awasigile kwita kupelemba isi ya Kanani, Musa niyo awagamba, “Hitani kwe isi yedibwandasi ntendele ya kwamwenyemzi ya Kanani mkwele kubula kweisi ya amagulu, <verse eid="NUM 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 13:18" />muipelembe isi ivyo ili. Iviya mkaule awantu wakwikala umo kugamba ni wata nguvu hegu wasokela, waloza hegu ni wajeche. <verse eid="NUM 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 13:19" />Ipelembeni muiwone isi iyo ni yedi hegu iha, imizi wakwikala ni nkambi hegu ni nyumba zizungulusizwe ngome. <verse eid="NUM 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 13:20" />Iviya muikaule isi yenye ina sanga ntana hegu bule, ina miti hegu bule. Mtende na moyo wa ukankalu naho mkauya mchigaile ntunda zeisi iyo.” Chipindi icho zabibu nazikakonga kwiva. <verse eid="NUM 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 13:21" />Ivyo, wantu awo waita na kuipelemba isi kulaila kwe dijangwa dya Sini kubula Lehobu, hajihi ne sila ya kwingilila Hamati. <verse eid="NUM 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 13:22" />Niyo waita kubula ntendele ya kwamwenyemzi ya Kanani wajinka kubula komzi wa Hebuloni. Uko wawabwila Waahimani na Washeshai na Watalimai, welekwa wa Anaki. Mzi wa Hebuloni wazengagwa mihilimo mfungate umo mzi wa Soani wikweisi ya Misili hewinati kuzengwa. <verse eid="NUM 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 13:23" />Wapelembi awo weze wabule mwedibwandasi dya Eshikoli niyo wakanta tambi dya mzabibu dyendaga na vikocha vya ntunda zilozize nadyo nadinulwa ni wantu waidi mwe mtengo. Iviya waguha na makomamanga majeche na tini. <verse eid="NUM 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 13:24" />Aho hetangangwa kolongo dya Eshikoli kugamba ni kakocha kamemaga zabibu kakantagwa ni Waizulaeli ahantu aho.<verse eid="NUM 13:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 13:25" />Weze waheze kuipelemba isi kwa mazuwa milongo mine, wantu awo niyo wauya. <verse eid="NUM 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 13:26" />Wauya kwa Musa na Haluni na wantu Waizulaeli uko Kadeshi, mwe dijangwa dya Palani, niyo walavya ulosi we zimbuli wawone na kulagisa amatunda ye isi iyo. <verse eid="NUM 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 13:27" />Wamgamba Musa, “Chibula mwe isi mchisigile kuipelemba. Iyo isi ni ntana ina sanga yedi yawagila kulima na ludimo, na zino nizo izi ntunda zakwe. <verse eid="NUM 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 13:28" />Mna wekazi wawo ni wata nguvu vitendese, ne mizi yawo itogesa, naho ikulisa naho izengelwa ngome. Ukajendeleza mwa ayo, seivyo chiwona mazintu makulu welekwa wa Anaki. <verse eid="NUM 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 13:29" />Waamaleki wakwikala ntendele ya kwamwenyemzi ya Kanani na Wahiti na Wayebusi na Waamoli wakwikala ko lugulu, na Wakanani wakwikala hajihi ne bahali ya Mediteleniyani na hajihi na mpwani yo mto Yolidani.”<verse eid="NUM 13:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 13:30" />Mna Kalebu niyo awagamba wamwetegeleze awantu halongozi ha Musa, “Chite chikaiguhe isi iyo. Kwa viya china udahi wa kuwahuda.” <verse eid="NUM 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 13:31" />Mna awantu waitanya naye kuipelemba isi niyo wagamba, “Hachidahe kutowana na wantu awo, awo wana nguvu kujinka suwe.” <verse eid="NUM 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 13:32" />Ivyo walonga mbuli za udanti mwa wantu wa Izulaeli mwe isi iyo waipelembe, wakagamba, “Isi iyo yadya awantu wakwe. Naho wantu wose chiwone uko ni mazintu makulu. <verse eid="NUM 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 13:33" />Uko chiwawona mazintu makulu, welekwa wa Anaki. Suwe chewona saviya mpasi kulongozi kwawo, nawo nivyo wachiwone suwe.”<verse eid="NUM 13:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="NUM 14" />
  <para style="s">Wantu wa Izulaeli wafuzuma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 14:1" />Waizulaeli wose wailaga wakaboha ichilo icho. <verse eid="NUM 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 14:2" />Niyo wamfuzumila Musa na Haluni wakagamba, “Navitenda vyedi hegu chabanikile kudya Misili, hegu ahano hedijangwa. <verse eid="NUM 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 14:3" />Ni mbwani Zumbe kachigala mwe isi ino?.” Nachibanikile kwe nkondo, na wavyele wetu na wana wetu nawatahigwe! Havyendile vyedi chawiye Misili? <verse eid="NUM 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 14:4" />Ivyo wagambilana, “Chisaguleni chilongozi mtuhu, chuye Misili.”<verse eid="NUM 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 14:5" />Aho, Musa na Haluni wafika madi vinengo vyawo vyabula hasi kwa wantu wa Izulaeli wechisanye. <verse eid="NUM 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 14:6" />Yoshuwa mwana ywa Nuni, na Kalebu mwana ywa Yefune, wadya wendaga mwa wadya waitaga kupelemba isi iyo, niyo watatula izisuche zawo. <verse eid="NUM 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 14:7" />Na kuwagamba Waizulaeli, “Isi chitile kuipelemba ibuka utana. <verse eid="NUM 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 14:8" />Uneva Zumbe anachibweda suwe, nachigale uko achijinke isi iyo ina sanga yedi naho ikuwagila kulima na ludimo. <verse eid="NUM 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 14:9" />Mna msekumwasa Zumbe, naho msekuwogoha wakaya weisi iyo. Kwaviya wowo niwasokezi du mwetu. Chegamo chawo chusigwa kwawo na Zumbe ehamwenga na suwe. Msekogoha!” <verse eid="NUM 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 14:10" />Mna wantu wose wawatisa Yoshuwa na Kalebu kuwatowa mayuwe. Ahadya ung'azi wa Zumbe Chohile walaila mlanga mwe Idihema Dikukile kwa Waizulaeli wose.<verse eid="NUM 14:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Musa awalombezeza wantu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 14:11" />Chohile niyo amgamba Musa, “Wantu wano nawanibele kubula ini? Naho, hawanizumile kubula ini, hamwenga na mpituko zose nidamanye mwawo? <verse eid="NUM 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 14:12" />Naniwegaile nyonje dikutisa na kuwaduila hale, mna kulaila mwako nanidamanye si ntuhu nkulu inanguvu vitendese kujinka wowo.” <verse eid="NUM 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 14:13" />Mna Musa amgamba Zumbe Chohile, “Kuwalavya wano wantu kweisi ya Misili kwa udahi wako mkulu. Wamisili waneva kugamba kuwadamanya awantu wako ivyo, <verse eid="NUM 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 14:14" />nawawagambile wantu we isi ino ulosi uwo. Kwaviya wantu weisi ino weva kale ulosi kugamba weye Zumbe Chohile wihamwenga na suwe, kwaviya weye Zumbe Chohile welagisa pwilili ingu dyako dikachimala halanga hetu, na kugamba weye nomsi wachilongoila kwa nguzo ya ingu, nechilo wachilongoza kwa nguzo ya moto. <verse eid="NUM 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 14:15" />Elo, haluse, unawakoma wantu wose chahamwenga, wantu wa si ntuhu Wakanani wevile izimbuli zako nawalonge, <verse eid="NUM 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 14:16" />‘Chohile kawakoma wantu wakwe kwedijangwa kwaviya kadunduga kuwegala kwe isi aungile awenke.’ <verse eid="NUM 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 14:17" />Ivyo, nakunga weye Zumbe, uchilagise udahi wako kwa kudamanya saviya ulongile. <verse eid="NUM 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 14:18" />‘Miye Zumbe Chohile suyo mhufu ywa maya, simema ungi hewine udumo, nimta kulekeila masa na ubanasi. Mna, kwavyovyose viya sanileke kuwakantila wana na wezukulu kubula cheleko cha katatu na cha kane kwa masa ya welesi wawo.’ <verse eid="NUM 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 14:19" />Nakweila walekeile wantu wano masa yawo, kwa ungi wako mkulu hewikuhitukila saviya uwalekeile kukongela walaile Misili kubula haluse.”<verse eid="NUM 14:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 14:20" />Zumbe ahitula, “Siwalekeila seivyo ulombeze. <verse eid="NUM 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 14:21" />Mna chindedi, kwaviya sikudaha kubanika na saviya isi ikunga imeme ukuka wangu, <verse eid="NUM 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 14:22" />hahana hata mntu yumwenga nengile mwe isi idya, wawone ukulu wangu ne izimpintuko zangu nidamanye uko Misili na kwedijangwa mna wajendeleza kunijeza nkanana zilozize naho walemela kuniva, <verse eid="NUM 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 14:23" />hahana hata yumwenga ywawo wadya wanilemele nawone isi idya nelisize kuwenka wadalahala wawo. Iviya wadya wakunibela hawaiwone. <verse eid="NUM 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 14:24" />Mna mndima ywangu Kalebu kwaviya kesima kanivisa nanimbuze kwe iyo isi engile na welekwa wakwe nawaiguhe itende yawo. <verse eid="NUM 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 14:25" />Msekwita kwe isi ya Waameleki na Wakanani wakwikala mwa amakolongo ye isi iyo, mna luvi muye kwedijangwa kuhinga kwe bahali ya shamu.”<verse eid="NUM 14:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 14:26" />Ivyo Chohile awauza Musa na Haluni, <verse eid="NUM 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 14:27" />“Bunga dino dya wantu wehiye nadijendeleze kufuzuma kubula ini? Sihwa na amafuzumo ya Waizulaeli mwangu! <verse eid="NUM 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 14:28" />Haluse wahitule vino, ‘Kwaviya sikubanika, nelisa miye Zumbe Chohile, naniwadamanyize ayadya nivile mkalonga. <verse eid="NUM 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 14:29" />Nambanike vimba vyenyu navizagale mwe dijangwa. Kwaviya mnifuzumila miye hahana yumwenga mwenyu mta lika dya mihilimo milongo midi na kujendeleza akunga engile. <verse eid="NUM 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 14:30" />Akunga engile mwe isi iyo nelisize kuwenka itende yenyu ni Kalebu mwana ywa Yefune, na Yoshuwa mwana ywa Nuni. <verse eid="NUM 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 14:31" />Mna nyuwe mgamba kugamba wanenyu nawatahigwe, mna, miye wanenyu naniwabuze kweisi mbeile, chani waimanye naho itende wikazi wawo. <verse eid="NUM 14:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 14:32" />Mna, nyuwe nambanikile umuno mwe dijangwa!. <verse eid="NUM 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 14:33" />Wana wenyu nawadime muno mwe dijangwa kwa mihilimo milongo mine kwa kuswesa uzumizi kubula aho namhulukile mwe dijangwa pele. <verse eid="NUM 14:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 14:34" />Kulawana na masa yenyu, namwangadike kwa mihilimo milongo mine, sayadya amazuwa milongo mine mpelembe isi, mhilimo umwenga kwa chila zuwa dimwenga, chani mnamanye kugamba chilemana. <verse eid="NUM 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 14:35" />Miye Zumbe Chohile nagamba, Chindedi naniwadamanyeni ivyo nyuwe nyose mchintane hano kunihiga. Wose nawahulukile umuno mwe dijangwa na kubanikila umuno.’” <verse eid="NUM 14:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 14:36" />Wadya awantu Musa asigile waite wakaipelembe isi wauya na kuhosa wantu wamfuzumile Chohile kwa kwigala mbuli ihiye mwe isi, <verse eid="NUM 14:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 14:37" />Wadya wantu mlongo wegale mbuli za lulimi mwe isi, niyo wabanika kwa nyonje dikutisa kulongozi kwa Zumbe Chohile. <verse eid="NUM 14:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 14:38" />Mna Yoshuwa mwana ywa Nuni, na Kalebu mwana ywa Yefune awodu nawo wasigaile wajima mgati mwa wadya wantu waitile kuipelemba isi.<verse eid="NUM 14:38" /></para>
  <para style="s">Waizulaeli wakonga kuyebunga isi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 14:39" />Musa awangambila Waizulaeli wose ulosi uwo, nawo niyo waila kwa usungu utendese. <verse eid="NUM 14:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 14:40" />Zuwa ditimile niyo wenuka chilochilo waita hantu ho lugulu, wakagamba, “Haluse chemalanya kale kwita ahantu hadya Chohile achigambile. Chazumila kugamba chikola masa.” <verse eid="NUM 14:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 14:41" />Mna Musa niyo agamba, “Haluse ni mbani hamtozize idilagizo dya Zumbe Chohile? Ivyo hamdahe! <verse eid="NUM 14:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 14:42" />Msekwita uko kolugulu mnase kutoigwa na awankondo wenyu, kwaviya, Zumbe hamuli mwenyu. <verse eid="NUM 14:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="NUM 14:43" />Mnawebunga Waameleki na Wakanani, nambanikile kwe nkondo, kwaviya mumhituka Zumbe, uyo hatende hamwenga na nyuwe.” <verse eid="NUM 14:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="NUM 14:44" />Mna wowo walahiliza kukwela kolugulu, kubula kolunenengwe, hata hegu idisanduku dye dilagano dya Zumbe Chohile hadilavigwe, Musa naye hahalaile he nkambi. <verse eid="NUM 14:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NUM 14:45" />Naho Waameleki na Wakanani, wendaga wakekala mwe isi iyo yolugulu, niyo wasela, wawebunga na kuwahuda. Niyo wawabalaza kubula komzi wa Holima.<verse eid="NUM 14:45" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="NUM 15" />
  <para style="s">Malagizo mwe malavyo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 15:1" />Chohile amgamba Musa, <verse eid="NUM 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 15:2" />“Wagambile Waizulaeli kugamba aho nambwile mwe isi huwenkani umo namwikale, <verse eid="NUM 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 15:3" />mkanilavize malavyo miye Zumbe Chohile kulaila mo ludimo lwenyu, lavyo dya kutikimya hegu ntambiko chani mntu achintize nazili ekiye hegu kulavya lavyo dya kunga mwenye hegu lavyo dya ngasu zenyu zikigwe, na kudamanya mhempe wedi ukuniwagila miye Zumbe Chohile, <verse eid="NUM 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 15:4" />iviya, yudya akunga alavye lavyo dyakwe, namwigaile Zumbe Chohile lavyo dya nkande chilo imwenga ya unga udinyike ukandigwe na kuhanganywa na lita imwenga ya mavuta, <verse eid="NUM 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 15:5" />hamwenga na divai ya lavyo dya kunywa lita imwenga, vintu ivyo navitimilane na chila mnyama ywa lavyo dya kutikimya hegu ngoto hegu mbuzi.” <verse eid="NUM 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 15:6" />“Chipindi cha kulavya lavyo dya ndolome, chilo mbili za unga ukandigwe na lita imwenga na nusu ya mavuta nailavigwe saviya lavyo dya nkande, <verse eid="NUM 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 15:7" />hamwenga na lavyo dya kunywa dya lita imwenga na nusu dya divai, na kudamanya mhempe wedi wa amalavyo ayo kumuwangila Zumbe Chohile. <verse eid="NUM 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 15:8" />Chipindi namumlavize Chohile njeku kwa lavyo dya kutikimya hegu ntambiko chani kuchitiza nazili hegu lavyo dya utondowazi, <verse eid="NUM 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 15:9" />mntu nalavye lavyo dya chilo ntatu za unga uhanganywe na lita mbili za mavuta ya mizaituni, <verse eid="NUM 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 15:10" />hamwenga na lavyo dya kunywa lita mbili za divai, na kudamanya lavyo dina mhempe wedi wa kumwagila Zumbe Chohile.”<verse eid="NUM 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 15:11" />“Vino nivyo ivinyu vikungwa vilavigwe hamwenga na chila njeku hegu mwate hegu ndolome hegu vulata. <verse eid="NUM 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 15:12" />Uwazwa we ivintu ivyo naujenyezwe kuligana na uwazwa wa wanyama wakunga walavigwe. <verse eid="NUM 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 15:13" />Chila mkaya ywa Izulaeli natongele malagizo yano chipindi akalavya lavyo dya kutikimya dina mhempe ukumuwagila Zumbe Chohile. <verse eid="NUM 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 15:14" />Hegu hana mjeni akwikala hamwenga na nyuwe kwa chipindi hegu kale na kale akaunga alavye lavyo dyakwe dya kutikimya, dina mhempe ukumuwangila Zumbe Chohile, mntu uyo nadamanye saviya nyuwe mkudamanya. <verse eid="NUM 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 15:15" />Malagizo ayadya mkunga mtimile mwe vyeleko vyose vikwiza, nayo akunga atimile mjeni yoyose akunga ekale hamwenga na nyuwe, kwa Zumbe Chohile namtende mwi wamwe. <verse eid="NUM 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 15:16" />Nyuwe na uyo namtende mwe sigilizi idya idimwenga na malagizo ayadya.” <verse eid="NUM 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 15:17" />Niyo Zumbe Chohile amgamba Musa, <verse eid="NUM 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 15:18" />Wagambile Waizulaeli kugamba, “Umo nawengile mwe isi huwegala, <verse eid="NUM 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 15:19" />chila nkanana mkadya ulozo we isi iyo, namsente chihendo chisiku na kuninka miye Zumbe Chohile. <verse eid="NUM 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 15:20" />Aho namokele imigate, mgate wa nkongo wo ulozo wa nkongo we nkande yenyu naulavigwe saviya lavyo dya hantu ha kuhetela ngano. <verse eid="NUM 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 15:21" />Mwe ivyeleko vyenyu vyose vikwiza namnilavize miye Zumbe Chohile malavyo yano yesimane kulaila mo unga wenyu wa nkongo ukandigwe.”<verse eid="NUM 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 15:22" />“Mna uneva mnabalanga kutimila malagizo yose yadya miye Zumbe Chohile niwenkileni kwa sila ya Musa, <verse eid="NUM 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 15:23" />hegu mazuwa yakwiza wantu hanawatimile yose yadya miye Zumbe nimlagize Musa, <verse eid="NUM 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 15:24" />ivyo, uneva masa ayo yadamanyika suko kwakwekamba, bunga hadimanyize, bunga dyose nadilavye njeku itende lavyo dya kutikimya dina mhempe ukumuwagila Zumbe Chohile, hamwenga na lavyo dyakwe dya nkande na divai kutimila na malagizo yakwe. Naho wantu nawalavye vulata dimwenga kutenda lavyo dya kusa masa. <verse eid="NUM 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 15:25" />Mavyantambiko nadamanye wivano kwa bunga dyose dya Waizulaeli, nawo nawalekeilwe, kwaviya nawakola masa hewekambile naho nawegala lavyo dyawo dya nkande saviya lavyo dya kusa masa. <verse eid="NUM 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 15:26" />Bunga dyose dya Waizulaeli, hamwenga na wajeni wakwikala nawo, nawalekeilwe kwaviya wose nawemwe amasa ayo.”<verse eid="NUM 15:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 15:27" />“Mntu yumwenga anadamanya masa hekambile, nalavye ntogota ya mhilimo umwenga kutenda lavyo dya kusa masa. <verse eid="NUM 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 15:28" />Mlavyantambiko namlavize lavyo dya kumkukiza mntu uyo abalange kwa Zumbe, mntu uyo hekambile nalekeilwe. <verse eid="NUM 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 15:29" />Namtimile lagizo dimwenga kwa chila akunga abalange hekambile atende mkaya ywa Izulaeli hegu ni mjeni akwikala hamwenga na nyuwe.”<verse eid="NUM 15:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 15:30" />“Mntu yoyose akunga abalange kwa kwekamba, atende mwana si hegu mjeni, natende amtila Zumbe Chohile, naho naikigwe hale na wantu wakwe. <verse eid="NUM 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 15:31" />Kwaviya kalemela yadya alongile Chohile na kubalanga lagizo dyakwe. Mntu uyo naenegwe ulo na ulo, lema dyakwe naditende mwakwe mwenye.”<verse eid="NUM 15:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ubanasi mwe zuwa dya Kuhumula</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 15:32" />Zuwa dimwenga chipindi Waizulaeli wezewatende kwe dijangwa, wawona mntu yumwenga akalogota nkuni zuwa dya kuhumula. <verse eid="NUM 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 15:33" />Ivyo, mntu uyo niyo egalwa ha Musa na Haluni na hawantu wose. <verse eid="NUM 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 15:34" />Wawo niyo wamwika na kumdima kwa viya nendile hawamanyize wamtende mbwani. <verse eid="NUM 15:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 15:35" />Naho Chohile niyo amgamba Musa, “Mntu uyo akomwe, Waizulaeli wose wamtowe mayuwe kuse kwe nkambi.” <verse eid="NUM 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 15:36" />Ivyo wantu wamlavya kuse kwe nkambi, niyo wamkoma kwa kumtowa mayuwe saviya Zumbe Chohile amlagize Musa.<verse eid="NUM 15:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vilepe mwa maheto ye izisuche</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 15:37" />Vikaheza Chohile niyo amgamba Musa, <verse eid="NUM 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 15:38" />“Wagambile wantu wa Izulaeli, wadamanye vilepe mwa maheto yezisuche zawo na kwika uzi wa buluu mlanga mwe vilepe. Ivyo Wagambile mwa welekwa wawo wose. <verse eid="NUM 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 15:39" />Vilepe ivyo navitende lukumbusa lwenyu. Chila aho namviwone, namkumbuke amalagizo yangu yose na kuyatimila, chani mnase kutimila mbuli zenyu na yadya mkuyawona kwa meso yenyu. <verse eid="NUM 15:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 15:40" />Vilepe ivyo naviwakumbuseni amalagizo yangu yose na kuyatimilisa, nyuwe namtende wakukile wangu. <verse eid="NUM 15:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 15:41" />Miye ni Zumbe Chohile, nawalavyaga kwe isi ya Misili. Miye ni Zumbe Chohile ywenyu.”<verse eid="NUM 15:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="NUM 16" />
  <para style="s">Masa ya Kola na Dasani na Abilamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 16:1" />Zuwa dimwenga Kola mwana ywa Ishali alaile molukolo lwa Kohati alaile mwedikabila dya Walawi elungaga na wantu watatu wo lukolo lwa Lubeni awo ni Dasani na Abilamu wana wa Eliabu na Oni mwana ywa Pelesi. <verse eid="NUM 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 16:2" />Awo wose nawevana ne vilongozi wamanyikise magana maidi milongo mishano wasagulwe ni Waizuleli, chani wamhituke Musa, <verse eid="NUM 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 16:3" />walungana wawahige Musa na Haluni nakuwagamba, “Nyuwe mtendesa! Bunga dyose ni wakuka na chila mntu mwe dibunga dino ni mkuka naho Chohile ehamwenga na suwe. Nimbwani nyuwe mkwetenda masekulu wedibunga dya Chohile?” <verse eid="NUM 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 16:4" />Umo Musa eze eve ayo niyo afika madi na kufunamiza umtwi wakwe hasi. <verse eid="NUM 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 16:5" />Vikaheza amgamba Kohati na weyawe, “Luvi mtondo Zumbe nalagise ywakwe ni yuhi na mkuka ni yuhi naho akunga amsagule nuyo namlekeile asogele hokulu wakwe. <verse eid="NUM 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 16:6" />Ivyo damanyeni vino, luvi mtondo weye hamwenga na weyawo guhani kapati kashaba kakokela mavunkizo, <verse eid="NUM 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 16:7" />mwike makala ya moto na kujela na mavunkizo mlanga mwakwe vikaheza muyegale ha Zumbe. Namuwone ni yuhi asagulwe ni Zumbe. Nyuwe Walawi mtendesa!” <verse eid="NUM 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 16:8" />Musa ajendeleza kulonga na Kola, “Kwetegelezeni nyuwe Walawi! <verse eid="NUM 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 16:9" />Siyo mbuli ndodo kwenyu kugamba Chohile ywa Izulaeli kawasenta nyuwe na mdugano wa Izulaeli, chani awagoneke kwakwe chani mtende hajihi na Zumbe msankane mwe Idihema dya Zumbe? Na kuchimala kwe midugano ya wantu wose wa Izulaeli. <verse eid="NUM 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 16:10" />Kawenkani ntunyo yakutenda hajihi naye na walukolo wenyu wose wana Walawi, mna haluse mwaunga ndima ya ulavyantambiko? <verse eid="NUM 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 16:11" />Suyo Haluni du akufuzumilwa, weye hamwenga na wantu wose wakukutimila mna chindedi mwamfuzumila Zumbe.”<verse eid="NUM 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 16:12" />Musa niyo asigila ulosi kwa Datani na Abilamu wana wa Eliabu chani wetangwe mna niyo wagamba, “Suwe hachikwize.” <verse eid="NUM 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 16:13" />Elo ni mbuli ndodo kugamba kuchilavya Misili kwe isi ina sanga yedi naho ikuwagila kulima chani wize kuchikoma muno mwedijagwa! Naho wetenda kugamba wi mkulu ywetu? <verse eid="NUM 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 16:14" />Hamwenga na ayo huchigale kwe isi ina sanga yedi naho ikuwagila kulima na ludimo naho huchinkile nkonde ne zinkonde ze mizabibu. Wafanyanya kugamba wantu wano ni matuntu? Hachize! <verse eid="NUM 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 16:15" />Musa niyo emukiswa ni maya amgamba Zumbe Chohile, “Usekuzumila malavyo yawo nawakwigaile miye siguhile mpunda ya mntu yoyose naho silumize mntu!”<verse eid="NUM 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 16:16" />Musa amgamba Kola, “Luvi usekuswesa kwiza na weyawo ha Zumbe. Haluni naye natende eyaho. <verse eid="NUM 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 16:17" />Chila yumwenga ywenyu aguhe idizae dyo kokela amavunkizo nakwika mavunkizo vikaheza negale ha Zumbe uwazwa wa amazae yo kokela mavunkizo nani magana maidi na milongo mishano, weye hamwenga na Haluni na chila yumwenga akatenda na zae dyakwe.”<verse eid="NUM 16:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 16:18" />Ivyo chila yumwenga ywawo niyo aguha zae dyo kokela mavunkizo na kudijela makala ya moto na mavunkizo niyo waita na kuchimala he nchili ye Dihema Dikukile saviya Musa na Haluni wadamanye. <verse eid="NUM 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 16:19" />Kola naye niyo awaduganya wantu wose wachimala ha Musa na Haluni awo wendaga he nchili ye Dihema Dikukile. Aho niyo ukulu wa Chohile wawalaila wantu wose! <verse eid="NUM 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 16:20" />Niyo Chohile awagamba Musa na Haluni, <verse eid="NUM 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 16:21" />“Kwepaguleni na wantu wano chani niwabalange haluse vino.”<verse eid="NUM 16:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 16:22" />Mna Musa na Haluni niyo wafika madi na kufunamiza imitwi hasi nakulonga, “Weye Zumbe Chohile ukwinkiza ujima kwa vyumbe vyose. Togola mntu yumwenga anakola masa wadihiwa bunga dyose?”<verse eid="NUM 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 16:23" />Chohile niyo amgamba Musa, <verse eid="NUM 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 16:24" />Uwagambile wantu wekale hale na amahema ya Kola, Datani na Abilamu.<verse eid="NUM 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 16:25" />Ivyo Musa akatimilana na wadalahala wa Izulaeli niyo aita kwa Dasani na Abilamu. <verse eid="NUM 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 16:26" />Weze wabule niyo awagamba wantu, “Hampu mlaweni mwa yano amahema ya wantu wehi, naho msekudonta chintu chochose hegu sivyo nambalagwa hamwenga nawo kwa chausa cha masa yawo yose.” <verse eid="NUM 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 16:27" />Ivyo, wantu niyo wamlawa mo wikazi wa Kola, Dasani na Abilamu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NUM 16:27">Dasani na Abilamu niyo wafosa kuse na kuchimala mwe izinchili za amahema yawo wakatenda na wavyele wawo wana wawo na watiti wawo. <verse eid="NUM 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 16:28" />Musa niyo awagamba wantu, “Mwe mbuli ino nammanye kugamba Chohile kanisigila chani nidamanye ndima zino zose, kwaviya miye sizidamanye kwa kunga mwenye. <verse eid="NUM 16:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 16:29" />Hegu wano wantu nawabanike saviya chizwele ivyo nammanye kugamba Chohile hanisigile. <verse eid="NUM 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 16:30" />Mna Zumbe Chohile anadamanya mbuli heinati kulaila, sanga niyo yagubuka na kuwamela wantu hamwenga ne vintu vyawo chani waite kowikazi wa wantu wabanike wakatenda wajima nivyo nammanye kugamba wantu wano wamlemela Zumbe.”<verse eid="NUM 16:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 16:31" />Ahadya eze abinde ukulonga ayo, isanga hasi ha Dasani na Abilamu niyo yagubuka, <verse eid="NUM 16:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 16:32" />nakuwamela wantu awo walukolo wawo hamwenga na wakumtimila Kola na vintu vyawo wose. <verse eid="NUM 16:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 16:33" />Ivyo wawo hamwenga ne vintu vyose nawananavyo niyo wasela kowikazi wa wantu wabanike wakatenda wachei wajima. Sanga niyo yawagubika, wose niyo hawawoneke mo mdugano wa Waizulaeli. <verse eid="NUM 16:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 16:34" />Wantu wose wendaga hajihi wasumka eze weve izindilo zawo wakagamba, “Chisumkeni sanga naichimele naswi.”<verse eid="NUM 16:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 16:35" />Vikaheza Zumbe asigila moto na kuwabalanga wadya wantu magana milongo midi na milongo mishano waitile kwe Idihema Dikukile kuvunkiza amavunkizo.<verse eid="NUM 16:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mazae ya shaba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 16:36" />Vikaheza Zumbe amgamba Musa, <verse eid="NUM 16:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 16:37" />“Mgambile Eleazali mwana ywa mlavyantambiko Haluni ause ayo amazae mwa amasigale ya awantu wokigwe numoto, izinkala azimwaganise hale kwaviya mazae ayo yakuka. <verse eid="NUM 16:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 16:38" />Mazae ayo yakuka kwaviya wantu awo wayegalaga he nchanja ya kumlaviza Chohile malavyo. Ivyo yaguhe amazae ya wantu wano wabanike kwa masa yawo, yasuntwe chani yatende ngubiko ye nchanja yo kulaviza ntambiko. Naditende fundo kwa waizulaeli wose.” <verse eid="NUM 16:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 16:39" />Ivyo mlavyantambiko Eleazali niyo ayaguha amazae ayo ye shaba yadya yegalwe kwa Chohile na awantu wakomigwe nu moto kwa masa yawo ayasana itende ngubiko ya nchanja yo kulaviza ntambiko. <verse eid="NUM 16:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 16:40" />Icho chendaga lukumbusa kwa wana wa Izulaeli, chani mjeni yoyose suyo mwelekwa ywa Haluni, asekusogeila akavunkiza mavunkizo ha Zumbe anase kubalangwa saviya Kola na awantu wakwe, ayo yose yadamanyikaga saviya Zumbe amlagize Musa.<verse eid="NUM 16:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Haluni awakombola wantu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 16:41" />Mna zuwa dya kaidi mdugano wose wa wana wa Izulaeli wamfuzumila Musa na Haluni wakagamba, “Nyuwe muwakoma awantu wasiku wa Chohile.”<verse eid="NUM 16:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 16:42" />Weze wadugane kumfuzumila Musa na Haluni niyo wakaula ntendele ye Idihema Dikukile wawona ingu digubika Idihema ukulu wa Chohile wawoneka. <verse eid="NUM 16:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="NUM 16:43" />Musa na Haluni niyo waita na kuchimala kwe Dihema Dikukile. <verse eid="NUM 16:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="NUM 16:44" />Chohile niyo amgamba Musa, <verse eid="NUM 16:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NUM 16:45" />“Kwenege mwa wano wantu chani niwabalange haluse vino!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NUM 16:45">Mna wowo niyo wafika madi na kufunamiza imitwi hasi. <verse eid="NUM 16:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="NUM 16:46" />Musa niyo amgamba Haluni, “Guha idizae dyako dijele moto na kudika hankanda he nchanja yo kulaviza ntambiko, ukajika dijele mavunkinzo wite nadyo usunguze kwa awantu uwadamanyize wivano. Sunguzisa! Maya ya Chohile yemuka ayo amanyonje ya kutisa yakonga.” <verse eid="NUM 16:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="NUM 16:47" />Elo, Haluni adamanya saviya Musa amgambile, niyo asunguza kwita komdugano, eze awone unyonje wihise ukonga mwa awantu niyo ajela mavunkizo mo moto na kuwadamanyiza wivano awantu awo. <verse eid="NUM 16:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="NUM 16:48" />Eze adamanye ivyo nkomano iyo niyo yaleka, niyo achimala mgati wantu wajima na wabanike. <verse eid="NUM 16:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="NUM 16:49" />Wantu wabanikaga kwa unyonje uwo wendaga magana milongo mine na magana mfungate, ukaleka wadya wabanikaga mwe mbuli ya Kola. <verse eid="NUM 16:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="NUM 16:50" />Unyonje wize uleke Haluni niyo amuwiya Musa hadya he nchili ye Idihema Dikukile.<verse eid="NUM 16:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="NUM 17" />
  <para style="s">Nkome ya Haluni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 17:1" />Vikaheza Chohile niyo amgamba Musa, <verse eid="NUM 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 17:2" />“Wagambile Waizulaeli wakwigaile nkome mlongo na mbili, chila chilongozi ywa kabila nkome imwenga. Iwandikwe zina dya chila yumwenga ywawo mwe nkome yakwe. <verse eid="NUM 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 17:3" />Zina dya Haluni diwandikwe mwe nkome ikulagisa kabila dya Lawi. Nahatende na nkome imwenga kwa chila chilongozi ywa kabila. <verse eid="NUM 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 17:4" />Guha nkome mwe Idihema Dikukile na kuika he dishanduku dye dilagano, hantu hudugana na nyuwe. <verse eid="NUM 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 17:5" />Nkome yo mntu hunga nimsagule naisuke. Kwa sila iyo nanibinde ukufuzuma kwa wana wa Izulaeli wakuwafuzumilani nyuwe.” <verse eid="NUM 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 17:6" />Musa niyo alonga na awantu wa Izulaeli. Chila chilongozi wawo wamwinka nkome chila yumwenga kwa mligano wedikabila dyakwe niyo zatenda nkome mlongo na mbili, nkome ya Haluni naikigwa hamwenga nezinkome izo. <verse eid="NUM 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 17:7" />Musa niyo azika izinkome izo zose ha Zumbe mwe Idihema Dikukile. <verse eid="NUM 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 17:8" />Dyendaga ni zuwa dya kaidi Musa niyo engila mwe Idihema. Umo kebwila inkome ya Haluni ywe dikabila dya Lawi, isuka na kulavya maluwa na kweleka ntunda ziviye za mti ukwitangwa mlozi! <verse eid="NUM 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 17:9" />Akaheza Musa niyo azilavya kuse izo izinkome zose kulaila ha Zumbe Chohile na kuziika hawana wa Izulaeli wose niyo wazisinya na chila yumwenga niyo aguha inkome yakwe. <verse eid="NUM 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 17:10" />Niyo Zumbe amgamba Musa, “Ike inkome ya Haluni he dishanduku dye dilagano ikaile aho chani ditende fundo kwa awo wabanasi. Dino nadibinde mafuzumo mwangu na kuchinda file kujendeleza.” <verse eid="NUM 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 17:11" />Musa niyo adamanya saviya Zumbe asigile.<verse eid="NUM 17:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 17:12" />Waizulaeli niyo wamgamba Musa, “Kaula haluse chahuluka! Chasila! Chose chisila. <verse eid="NUM 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 17:13" />Mntu yoyose nasogeile Idihema Dikukile abanika. Togola chose hachibanike?”<verse eid="NUM 17:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="NUM 18" />
  <para style="s">Ndima za Walavyantambiko Walawi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 18:1" />Zumbe niyo amgamba Haluni, “Weye na wanawo na welekwa wako kulaila mwe idikabila dya Walawi namgwelwe ni wihi wose kwe Idihema Dikule. Mna weye na wanawo namgwelwe ni wihi wo ulavyantambiko. <verse eid="NUM 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 18:2" />Wegale welekwa wako we idikabila dya Walawi wakwambize kudamanya ndima umo weye na wanawo mkasankana kwe Dihema Dikukile. <verse eid="NUM 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 18:3" />Nawasankane hantu hako na mwe Idihema Dikukile dyose, mna wasekudonta iviya vikukile vye nchanja yo kulaviza ntambiko wanase kukomwa hamwenga na nyuwe. <verse eid="NUM 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 18:4" />Nawatende na weye mo kuchimaila kwe Dihema Dikukile mwe undima wose mna mjeni yoyose hekuwagila mwe indima iyo asekuwambizani. <verse eid="NUM 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 18:5" />Nyuwe wenye namsankane mwe Idihema Dikukile na kusankana mwe nchanja yo kulaviza ntambiko idamanywe kwa shaba chani amaya yangu yanase kuwagwela naho wana wa Izulaeli. <verse eid="NUM 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 18:6" />Miye siwasagulani nyuwe mwa walukolo wenyu Walawi mwa Waizulaeli watende saviya jeleko kwenyu, wasentigwe kwa Zumbe chani wasankane mwe Idihema Dikukile. <verse eid="NUM 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 18:7" />Weye na wanawo na msankane mo ulavyantamiko wenyu, mwe chila chiya chimwe nchanja yokulaviza ntambiko, na vintu vyose vihantu Hakukise, nanywi namsankane. Nawenkani ulavyantambiko utende usankani wa jeleko, naho mntu yoyose suyo mlavyantambiko nasogele mwe Idihemda Dikukile nakomwe.”<verse eid="NUM 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chihendo cha walavyantambiko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 18:8" />Niyo Zumbe amgamba Haluni “Sikwika utende mchimaila ywa malavyo yangu ya kwinula, kwaviya viya vyose vya awana wa Izulaeli visentigwe, kutenda ni vyenyu na wanenyu wose mazuwa yose. <verse eid="NUM 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 18:9" />Vintu vino navitende ni vyako mwe viya vikukise, vinasekutikimya, malavvyo yawo yose. Chila lavyo dya nkande na chila lavyo dyawo dya kusa masa chila lavyo dyawo dya maliho nawanilavize naditende dikukise mwako na wanawo. <verse eid="NUM 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 18:10" />Naudye ivintu ivyo saviya vintu vikukise, wagosi awodu nawo wakungwa wadye ivintu ivyo, navitende vikuka kwako.”<verse eid="NUM 18:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 18:11" />“Naho malavyo yano ni yako idyo idilavyo dya kwinula, malavyo yose ya kwinula ya wana wa Izulaeli yano sikwinka weye na wanawo hamwenga na wanachiche wako, ni yenyu mazuwa yose, chila mntu akuzumilika mwe nyumba yako nadye ayo amalavyo.”<verse eid="NUM 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 18:12" />“Mavuta yedi ya mizeituni na ulozo wedi wa zabibu na ulozo wedi wa nkande na malimbulo yakwe nawamwinke Zumbe, ayo sikwinka weye. <verse eid="NUM 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 18:13" />Ntunda za nkongo zikwiva zose mwe isi yawo nawamwigaile Zumbe, nazitende zako chila mntu suyo mzavu mwe nyumba yako nadye mwe izo. <verse eid="NUM 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 18:14" />Chila nchintu chisentigwe mwe Izulaeli ni chako.”<verse eid="NUM 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 18:15" />“Chila chintu cha nkongo cha Waizulaeli wose nawakilavye kwa Zumbe chitende mwelekwa ywa nkongo ywa mntu hegu ludimo ni chako, mna mwelekwa ywa nkongo ywa wantu uyo wongigwa umkombole naho mwelekwa ywa nkongo ywa ludimo hekuwagila naumkombole. <verse eid="NUM 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 18:16" />Na awo awanyama nawakombolwe wakatenda mhilimo wa kukongela mwezi umwenga saviya nauwaze uwazwa wo utali wawo kwa vihande vishano vya mayuwe ya chumbu kwa vihande vya mayuwe ya chumbu vya maliho kuligana na chihimo che Idihema Dikukile. <verse eid="NUM 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 18:17" />Mna mwelekwa ywa nkongo ywa ng'ombe hegu mwelekwa ywa nkongo ywa mbuzi hegu ndolome hozikombole kwaviya zikuka naujuluze isakame yawo mwe inchanja yo kulaviza ntambiko na kutikimya kwa lavyo disogezwe kwa Zumbe ditende lavyo dya mhepe ukuwagila. <verse eid="NUM 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 18:18" />Naho inyama yawo naitende ni yako saviya ichifuwa cha kwinula na ichiga cha kulume naitende yako.”<verse eid="NUM 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 18:19" />“Malavyo yose ya kwinula ye ivintu vikukile wakulavya Waizulaeli kwa Zumbe sikwinka weye na wanawo na wandele wako ni yenyu mazuwa yose idinilagano nikiye mwako na welekwa wako hadivunwe. <verse eid="NUM 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 18:20" />Vikaheza Zumbe niyo amgamba Haluni, naho hachatendaga na fungu dyo dyose mwawo, miye nuyo idifungu dyako, na ulisi wako, mwa awana wa Izulaeli.”<verse eid="NUM 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Fungu dya Walawi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 18:21" />“Walawi siwenka fungu dya mlongo dyose Waizulaeli wakunilaviza kutenda ni dyawo, ayo ni maliho youndima wawo wakudamanya mwangu wokusankana mwe Idihema Dikukile. <verse eid="NUM 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 18:22" />Kukongela vino haluse Waizulaeli watuhu wanasekusogeila Idihema Dikukile wanase kukola masa na kubanika. <verse eid="NUM 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 18:23" />Mna Walawi nawo nawasankane kwe Dihema Dikukile, naho nawagwele ni wihi mwa ayo yanatendeka. Dino naditenge lagizo dya mazuwa yose mwe vyeleko vyenyu vyose naho Walawi hawatende na ulisi mwana Waizulaeli, <verse eid="NUM 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 18:24" />kwaviya siwenka fungu dya mlongo dya wana wa Izulaeli wakudilavya kwa Zumbe Chohile. Nivyo vikuleka sigamba wowo hawatende na ulisi mwa Waizulaeli.”<verse eid="NUM 18:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Fungu dya mlongo dya Walawi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 18:25" />Vikaheza niyo Zumbe amgamba Musa, <verse eid="NUM 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 18:26" />Longa na Walawi “Umo nauhokele fungu dya mlongo kulaila mwa Waizulaeli niwenkileni nyuwe ditende ulisi wenyu. Namlavye fungu dya mlongo mwe ivintu mhokele ditende lavyo fungu dya mlongo dya amalavyo yano ya mlongo mkulavya kwa Zumbe. <verse eid="NUM 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 18:27" />Malavyo yenyu nayawazwe saviya malavyo yadya yakulavigwa ni mlimi kwa ulozo mhya wa nkande na divai. <verse eid="NUM 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 18:28" />Ivyo nyuwe nanywi namsogeze lavyo dya kwinula kwa Zumbe Chohile mwa amafungu yenyu yose ya malavyo ya fungu dya mlongo, fungu dya mlongo na mnilavize na mumwinke mlavyantambiko Haluni. <verse eid="NUM 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 18:29" />Kulaila mwa amalavyo yose namhokele, namumlavize Zumbe Chohile ntendele yedi na ikukise ya chila na mwinkigwe. <verse eid="NUM 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 18:30" />Mkaheza kulavya lavyo dyedi na wike chihendo chisigale saviya mlimi akwika chihendo hadya akuhezeza kulavya izintambiko zakwe ze nkande na zabibu. <verse eid="NUM 18:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 18:31" />Nyuwe Walawi na welekwa wenyu namdye inkande ino hantu hohose namunge kwaviya ni maliho yenyu kwa kusankana mwe Idihema Dikukile. <verse eid="NUM 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 18:32" />Hamtende na wihi wowose mkadya ivintu ivyo hegu mumlaviza Zumbe Chohile hantu hedi vitendese kujinka vyose, nyuwe hamvijele uzavu ivintu viya vikukile vya wana wa Izulaeli nakubanika.”<verse eid="NUM 18:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="NUM 19" />
  <para style="s">Maivu ya ng'ombe inkundu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 19:1" />Chohile niyo awagamba Musa na Haluni, <verse eid="NUM 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 19:2" />“Ino niyo imiko ya malagizo yadya miye Chohile nilavize. Wagambile Waizulaeli wawegaile moli inkundu heine lema dyodyose hedamanye ndima ya kulima. <verse eid="NUM 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 19:3" />Nyuwe namumwinke mlavyantambiko Eleazali ingo'mbe iyo. Nailavigwe kuse kwe nkambi na kuchinjwa kulongozi kwa uyo mlavyantambiko.”<verse eid="NUM 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 19:4" />“Vikaheza mlavyantambiko Eleazali naguhe chihendo cha sakame nakuimyaga kwa dole dyakwe nkanana mfungate, kuhinga ntendele ya kulongozi kwe Idihema Dikukile.” <verse eid="NUM 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 19:5" />Ng'ombe yose nayokigwe kwa moto halongoziha mlavyantambiko. Chila chintu chakwe nachokigwe, mkota na nyama na sakame na utumbo wakwe. <verse eid="NUM 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 19:6" />Ukajika mlavyantambiko naguhe mti wa mwelezi na huto dya hisopo na uzi winkundu na kuvijela mo moto uwo ukokelwa in'gombe iyo. <verse eid="NUM 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 19:7" />Ayo yakaheza mlavyantambiko nafule izisuche zakwe na kuhaka, ukajika adaha kwingila kwe nkambi, natende hakuzumilika mokumvikila Chohile kubula chisingi. <verse eid="NUM 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 19:8" />Mntu nayoke ing'ombe iyo, naye nafule izisuche chakwe na kuhaka, mna naye natende hakuzumika mokumvikila Chohile kubula chisingi. <verse eid="NUM 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 19:9" />Vikaheza mntu yoyose akuzumilika mokuvika nazole amaivu ye ng'ombe na kuyegaga kuse kwenkambi hantu hedi. Maivu ayo nayatunduliwe chani yajesezwe ni wantu wose wa Izulaeli mwe kudamanya mazi ya kumtenda mntu azumilike mwe kumvikila Zumbe, nuko kusa masa. <verse eid="NUM 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 19:10" />Mntu uyo nause amaivu ayo ye ing'ombe nafule izisuche zakwe mna hazumilike mokumvika Chohile kubula chisingi mbuli iyo naitende sigilizi ya mazuwa yose, kwa Waizulaeli na mjeni akwikala mwawo.<verse eid="NUM 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malagizo mwe kukukizwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 19:11" />Mntu anatoza mntu abanike yoyose, natende mzavu mwe sila yo kumvikila Chohile kwa mazuwa mfungate. <verse eid="NUM 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 19:12" />Nekukize kwa ayo amazi zuwa dya katatu na zuwa dya mfungate natende kakuka, kwaviya hegu hekukize zuwa dya katatu, zuwa dya mfungate natende hakukile. <verse eid="NUM 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 19:13" />Mntu yoyose yudya natoze chimba cha mntu hanekukize nabalange Idihema Dikukile dya Zumbe naye nadulwe hale na wantu wa Izulaeli kwaviya mazi ayo yo kusa ulemanyi hayamyagilwe mwake natende hakukile uzavu wakwe nautende wiyaho.<verse eid="NUM 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 19:14" />Dino nidyo idilagizo dya kutimila kwa mntu anabanikila mwe idihema dyakwe, chila mntu naengile mwe dihema idyo, hegu emndani mwe dihema idyo, natende mzavu mwe sila yo kumvikila Chohile kwa mazuwa mfungate. <verse eid="NUM 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 19:15" />Chiya chochose chigubulwe hechine ngubiko mlanga mwakwe navitende vizavu. <verse eid="NUM 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 19:16" />Mntu yoyose natoze chimba cha mntu abanike kwa kukomwa na mabamba hegu abanike mwenye hegu anatoza vuha dya mntu hegu mbila, mntu uyo natende mzavu mwe sila yo kumvikila Chohile kwa mazuwa mfungate.<verse eid="NUM 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 19:17" />“Kwa wadya wantu wazavu nawaguhe amaivu yedilavyo dya kusiza masa dyokigwe, amaivu ayo nayahanganywe na mazi ya komto mwe nyungu. <verse eid="NUM 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 19:18" />Mntu akukile naguhe mti ukwitangwa hisopo, naichafike mwa amazi ayo, akaheza nadimwagile idihema ne iviya vyose vimndani mwe idihema na wantu weyumo mndani. Seivyo, namyagile mntu akufize vuha dya mntu hegu mwili wa mntu akomigwe hegu mntu abanike mwenye hegu mntu akufize mbila. <verse eid="NUM 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 19:19" />Mwe zuwa dya katatu nadya mfungate, mntu akukile namyagile mntu uyo mzavu mwe sila yo kmvikila Chohile ayo amazi, ivyo zuwa dya mfungate, namkukize uyo umntu umzavu, uyo nafule suche zakwe na kuhaka, chisingi natende kakuka.”<verse eid="NUM 19:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 19:20" />“Mna umntu uyo mzavu mwe sila yo kumvikila Chohile hanekukize, mntu uyo nalemelwe na awantu wakwe kwaviya nadijele uzavu Idihema Dikukile dya Zumbe Chohile. Kwaviya hamyagilwe amazi yo kukukizwa, uyo ni mzavu. <verse eid="NUM 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 19:21" />Dino ni lagizo dya kalenakale kwa wantu wose. Mntu akujuluziza nafule izisuche zakwe na mntu yoyose nakufye amazi natende mzavu kubula nechisingi. <verse eid="NUM 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 19:22" />Mntu yoyose mtuhu natoze chintu chizavu nachitende chizavu, yoyose natoze ichintu icho ichizavu natende mzavu kubula chisingi.”<verse eid="NUM 19:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="NUM 20" />
  <para style="s">Mazi yalaile mwe luwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 20:1" />Wana wa Waizulaeli wabula kwedijangwa dya Sini mwe dizuwa dya nkongo dyo mwezi na kuzenga nkambi haguhi nomzi wa Kadeshi. Wakatenda uko Miliamu niyo abanika na kuhambwa. <verse eid="NUM 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 20:2" />Hantu hadya wazengaga inkambi na hehana mazi. Ivyo wantu wose, niyo wechisanya na kuwafuzumila Musa na Haluni. <verse eid="NUM 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 20:3" />Wose wakagamba, “Navinda vyedi hegu cha banikile hamwenga na walukolo wetu wadya wabanikaga kulongozi kwa Zumbe! <verse eid="NUM 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 20:4" />Ni kwambwani mchigala suwe wantu wa Zumbe Chohile kuno kwedijangwa? Togolani mchigala chani chibanike hamwenga no ludimo lwetu? <verse eid="NUM 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 20:5" />Kwambwani mchilavya Misili na kuchigala hano hantu hehiye? Hehena nkande hegu tini hegu mizabibu hegu makomamanga naho hahana mazi ya kunywa!” <verse eid="NUM 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 20:6" />Aho, Musa na Haluni niyo wahalawa mo mdugano wa awantu, niyo waita wakuchimala kwe nchili ye Idihema Dikukile, niyo wafika madi kubula hasi. Ivyo, ung'azi wa Zumbe Chohile niyo wawalaila,<verse eid="NUM 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 20:7" />Niyo Zumbe amgamba Musa, <verse eid="NUM 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 20:8" />“Guha idya inkome yako ikigwe kwedishanduku dye idilagano, ukaheza weye na mlukolo ywako Haluni muwaduganye awantu hamwenga. Vikaheza, kulongozi kwawo, lugambe uluwe lwendaga hameso yawo, lulavye mazi yakwe. Uwalavize mazi mwo luwe awantu wose no ludimo lwawo ludahe kunywa.” <verse eid="NUM 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 20:9" />Musa niyo aguha idya inkome halongozi heidishanduku dye idilagano saviya agambilwe ni Zumbe.<verse eid="NUM 20:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 20:10" />Vikaheza Musa na Haluni niyo wawachisanya awantu wose hamwenga holuwe, Musa niyo awagamba, “Haluse tegelezani nyuwe wabanasi, mwaunga chiwalavizeni mazi kulaila mo luno uluwe.?” <verse eid="NUM 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 20:11" />Ivyo Musa enula mkono wakwe kulanga, niyo atowa ludya uluwe nkanana mbili ne nkome yakwe. Mazi yalozize niyo yalawa, wantu niyo wanywa hamwenga no ludimo lwawo.<verse eid="NUM 20:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 20:12" />Mna Zumbe niyo awagamba Musa na Haluni, “Kwaviya nyuwe hamnizumile, nakunileka nilagise udahi wangu hameso ya Waizulaeli, ivyo kwa ayo hamuwegale awantu wano kwe isi niwenkile.”<verse eid="NUM 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 20:13" />Ayo ni mazi ya Meliba, kugamba, “Kufuzuma.” Hantu Waizulaeli wafuzumaga kwa Zumbe Chohile, naye niyo elavyanya kugamba ni mkuka kwawo.<verse eid="NUM 20:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Seuta ywa Edomu awachinda Waizulaeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 20:14" />Musa niyo asigila walosi kulaila Kadeshi uko waikaga inkambi kwita kwa seuta ywa Edomu amgamba, “Mlukolo ywako Izulaeli agamba vino, weye kumanya izinkunto zose zichigwele. <verse eid="NUM 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 20:15" />Viya wadalahala wetu waitaga Misili, kudya chekalaga kwa chipindi chitali na ivyo Wamisili wawasulumize wadalahala wetu, seivyo niyo wachisulumiza suwe naswi. <verse eid="NUM 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 20:16" />Niyo chamuza Zumbe, niyo etegeleza indilo yetu, niyo achigaila mlosi ywakwe achusize Misili. Haluse chihano Kadeshi, mzi ukuhakana ne isi yako. <verse eid="NUM 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 20:17" />Hampu chinkesila chijinke mwe isi yako. Hachijate inkonde yenyu, hata idya ye mizabibu, naho hachinywe mazi ye mwama sima yenyu. Nachitimile isila nkulu ya seuta na kuitongela ulonaulo naho hachihituke kulume hegu kumoso, kubula chikafosa mwe isi yako.”<verse eid="NUM 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 20:18" />Mna seuta ywa Edomu niyo amhitula, “Bule! Hahana hekujinkila mwe isi yangu, uneva unajinka nanifose na kukwebunga.” <verse eid="NUM 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 20:19" />Waizulaeli niyo wagamba, “Suwe nachitongele isila inkulu, uneva suwe noludimo lwetu chinanywa amazi yenyu, nachilihe. Chikulombeza uchilekeile chijinke du lwaviga hachikunga ulosi wowose mtuhu.”<verse eid="NUM 20:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 20:20" />Mna seuta ywa Edomu niyo awalandula “Hachiwalekeile.” Niyo seuta ywa Edomu afosa na wata nguvu walozize chani wawachinde. <verse eid="NUM 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 20:21" />Ivyo, Waedomu niyo walemela kuwenka sila Waizulaeli kujinka mwe mihanka yawo. Waizulaeli wahituka na kutoza sila ntuhu.<verse eid="NUM 20:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kubanika kwa Haluni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 20:22" />Waizulaeli wose watamba kulaila Kadeshi, niyo wabula kolugulu lwa Holi wimomhaka na Edomu. <verse eid="NUM 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 20:23" />Uko niyo Zumbe awagamba Musa na Haluni, <verse eid="NUM 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 20:24" />“Haluni nabanike, hengile mwe isi idya niwenkile Waizulaeli kwaviya nyuwe waidi mhituila lagizo dyangu kudya kwa amazi ya Meliba. <verse eid="NUM 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 20:25" />Mguhe Haluni na mwanawe Eleazali, uwegale kolugulu lwa Holi. <verse eid="NUM 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 20:26" />Uko, Umhambule Haluni izisuche zo ulavyantambiko umvise mwanawe Eleazali. Haluni nabanike uko kolugulu.” <verse eid="NUM 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 20:27" />Musa niyo adamanya saviya alagizwe ni Zumbe. Wose watatu niyo wakwela kolugulu lwa Holi wantu wose wakawakaula. <verse eid="NUM 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 20:28" />Ivyo Musa niyo amhambula Haluni izisuche zakwe zo ulavyantambiko, niyo amvisa mwanawe dya Haluni uyo Eleazali. Haluni niyo abanikila hadya holunenengwe lo lugulu. Ivyo Musa na Eleazali niyo wasela hasi. <verse eid="NUM 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 20:29" />Waizulaeli weze weve kugamba Haluni kabanika, niyo walomboleza kwa mazuwa milongo mitatu.<verse eid="NUM 20:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="NUM 21" />
  <para style="s">Waizulaeli wawahuda Wakanani uko Holima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 21:1" />Seuta yumwenga Mkaanani ywa Aladi ekalaga ntendele ya kwamwenyemzi ya Kanani, eze eve mbuli kugamba Waizulaeli nawakeza kwe sila ya Atalimu, niyo aita akuwebunga na kuwataha awamwenga aita nawo. <verse eid="NUM 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 21:2" />Aho Waizulaeli niyo wamwikiya Zumbe nazili wakagamba, “Uneva unachinka udahai wa kuwahuda wano wantu, nachikubalangile imizi yawo vitendese.” <verse eid="NUM 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 21:3" />Zumbe niyo eva idilombezo dyawo, awenka uhuda mwa Wakanani. Waizulaeli niyo waibalangisa imizi yawo. Ivyo hantu hadya hetangwa Holima, kugamba “Hantu habalangiswe.”<verse eid="NUM 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nyoka isanigwe kwa shaba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 21:4" />Waizulaeli niyo wakonga ntambo kulaila ko lugulu lwa Holi, wangwila sila ikulaila kwebahali inkundu chani waizunguluke isi ya Edomu. Mna mwe sila wantu niyo wafachevu kwa idya isila. <verse eid="NUM 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 21:5" />Ivyo wakonga kumfuzumila Zumbe na Musa, wakagamba, “Ni mbwani mchilavya Misili chize chibanikile mwe dijangwa? Muno hamna nkande hegu mazi, naho chisokezwa ni nkande hezine mwile.” <verse eid="NUM 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 21:6" />Aho Zumbe niyo asigila nyoka zina usungu mgati mwa wantu, niyo zawaluma Waizulaeli walozize niyo wabanika. <verse eid="NUM 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 21:7" />Wantu niyo wambasa Musa, wamgamba, “Chikola masa kwa kumfuzumila Zumbe na weye. Umlombeze Zumbe achusize zino izinyoka.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NUM 21:7">Ivyo Musa awalombezeza wantu. <verse eid="NUM 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 21:8" />Niyo Zumbe amgamba Musa, “Sana nyoka ya shaba, uihasike halanga he mti. Mntu yoyose akunga alumwe ni nyoka, anaisinya inyoka iyo ye shaba, nahone.” <verse eid="NUM 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 21:9" />Musa niyo asana nyoka ya shaba, niyo aihasika halanga hegwao. Chila alumigwe ni nyoka eze aisinye inyoka iyo ye shaba, nakahona.<verse eid="NUM 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ntambo kwita kwedibwandasi dya Wamoabu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 21:10" />Waizulaeli wajendeleza ne ntambo yawo, niyo waika nkambi uko Oboti. <verse eid="NUM 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 21:11" />Kulaila uko watamba kubula Iye abalimu, mwe dijangwa ntendele ya ulailo wa zuwa wa Moabu. <verse eid="NUM 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 21:12" />Kulaila uko watamba, niyo waika nkambi yawo mwedibwandasi dya Zeledi. <verse eid="NUM 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 21:13" />Kulaila uko Watamba, niyo waika nkambi ntendele hampezo homto wa Alinoni, uwo wikwedijangwa dikubula komhaka wa Waamoli, Alinoni nuwo umhaka wa Wamoabu na Waamoli. <verse eid="NUM 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 21:14" />Ivyo, iwandikwa mwe chitabu che izinkondo cha Zumbe Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:14">“Mzi wa Wahebu mwe isi ya Sufa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:14">na makolongo ya Alinoni,<verse eid="NUM 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 21:15" />na seleza za kolongo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:15">dikubula ko mzi wa Ari,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:15">na kujendeleza komhaka wa Moabu.”<verse eid="NUM 21:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 21:16" />Kulaila uko Waizulaeli niyo watamba kubula Beli, kugamba sima diya Zumbe Chohile amgamba Musa, “Wachisanye wantu hamwenga, miye naniwenke mazi.”<verse eid="NUM 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 21:17" />Waizulaeli niyo wachema nchemo ino,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:17">Itika mazi, weye sima! Dichemeleni.<verse eid="NUM 21:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 21:18" />Sima disimbigwe ni wakulu, wakulu wa wantu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:18">niyo wadisikula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:18">kwa nkome za ukulu na bonkola, kwa nkome zawo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NUM 21:18">Kulaila mwe dijangwa watamba kubula Matana. <verse eid="NUM 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 21:19" />Kulaila Matana kubula Nahalieli, kulaila Nahalieli kubula Bamoti, <verse eid="NUM 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 21:20" />Kulaila Bamoti kubula mwe dikolongo dikwingila mwe isi ya Moabu, kolunenengwe lo lugulu Pisiga, chikuhinga hasi kwedijangwa.<verse eid="NUM 21:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Waizulaeli wawahuda mauta Sihoni na Ogi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 21:21" />Waizulaeli wasigila walosi waite kwa seuta Sihoni ywa Waamoli wegale ulosi uno, <verse eid="NUM 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 21:22" />“Chilekeile chijinke mwe isi yako, hachihituke kunkanda na kwingila mwe nkonde hegu mwe nkonde ye mizabibu, naho hachinywe amazi ye disima dyako, nachijinke du mwe sila nkulu yo useuta kubula aho nachimlawe mwe isi yako.” <verse eid="NUM 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 21:23" />Mna seuta Sihoni hawalekeile Waizulaeli wajinke mwe isi yakwe. Niyo awachisanya wagombankondo wakwe wose, awebunga Waizulaeli mwe dijangwa agombankondo nawo hantu hakwitangwa Yahasa. <verse eid="NUM 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 21:24" />Mna Waizulaeli niyo wamkoma, niyo wataha isi yakwe kukongela ko mto Alinoni kubula mto Yaboki, kubula isi ya Waamoni, nawo wo mhanka we isi ya Amoni wendile ukadimwa vidala. <verse eid="NUM 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 21:25" />Waizulaeli niyo waitaha imizi yose niyo waitoza imzi yose ya Waamoli hamwenga nomzi wa Hesiboni ne izikaya zakwe. <verse eid="NUM 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 21:26" />Kwaviya Hesiboni wendaga mzi wa Sihoni seuta ywa Moabu, atowanaga na seuta ywa Moabu na kumhuda niyo aguha isi yakwe yose kubula komto wa Alinoni. <verse eid="NUM 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 21:27" />Ivyo nivyo vikuleka wakale umo Waizulaeli hewenati kwiza wachemaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:27">“Soni Heshiboni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:27">Mzi wa Sihoni uzengwe na kutogezwa.”<verse eid="NUM 21:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 21:28" />Kwaviya moto ulaile Heshiboni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:28">ubalanga umzi wa Moabu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:28">Mwali wa moto ulaile momzi wa Sihoni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:28">Wakulu wa hantu henukile Alinoni.<verse eid="NUM 21:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 21:29" />Nyuwe wantu wa Moabu namluwone!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:29">Mbalangwa, nyuwe wantu mkumvikila Kemosi!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:29">Muwalavya wana wenyu watenda wakusumka</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:29">Wandele wako kuwaleka waite koutumwa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:29">Wambase Sihoni seuta ywa Waamoli. <verse eid="NUM 21:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 21:30" />Mna haluse wekekwa wawo nawa wabalangwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:30">Kulaiala Hesiboni kubula Diboni, hajihi na Medeba.<verse eid="NUM 21:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 21:31" />Ivyo, Waizulaeli niyo wekala mwe isi ya Waamoli. <verse eid="NUM 21:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 21:32" />Vikaheza Musa niyo asigila wantu wakapelembe umzi wa Yazeli, niyo Waizulaeli wataha imizi ye izisi izo ne zikaya zakwe, wawabalaza Waamoli wekalaga umo.<verse eid="NUM 21:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 21:33" />Waizulaeli niyo wahituka na kuhinga ntendele ya chenya kwita Basani. Seuta Ogi ywa Basani niyo afosa na awankondo wakwe wakuwebunga uko Edilei. <verse eid="NUM 21:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 21:34" />Mna Zumbe niyo amgamba Musa, “Usekogoha, kwaviya nahwinke uhuda mwakwe hamwenga na awantu wakwe wose we isi yakwe yose. Naumdamanyize saviya uwadamanyize Sihoni seuta ywa Waamoli na yudya nakekala Heshiboni.” <verse eid="NUM 21:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 21:35" />Ivyo, Waizulaeli wamkoma Ogi, wanawe na awantu wakwe wose na wankondo wakwe wose, hawasigaze mntu hata yumwenga mjima na kuguha isi yakwe.<verse eid="NUM 21:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="NUM 22" />
  <para style="s">Seuta Balaki amwitanga Balaamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 22:1" />Vikaheza Waizulaeli wakonga ntambo waita wakwika nkambi yawo mwedibwandasi dya Moabu, ntendele ya ulailo wa zuwa momto wa Yolidani, ntendele ya kaidi yo mzi wa Yeliko.<verse eid="NUM 22:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 22:2" />Balaki mwana ywa Sipoli, seuta ywa Moabu nakamanya izimbuli zose Waizulaeli wawadamanyize Waamoli. <verse eid="NUM 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 22:3" />Seuta ywa Moabu hamwenga na awantu wakwe wawogohesa Waizulaeli, kwaviya na walozesa, ivyo Wamoabu niyo waungumilwa mwa Waizulaeli. <verse eid="NUM 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 22:4" />Ivyo Wamoabu wawagamba wadalahala wa Midiani, “Wankondo wano na wabinde chila chintu chinanacho saviya ng'ombe ikulunja mani mwe nkonde.” Mwe chipindi icho Balaki mwana ywa Sipoli endaga seuta ywa Moabu, <verse eid="NUM 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 22:5" />ivyo Balaki asigila walosi kwa Balamu mwana ywa Beoli uko Petoli, hajihi nomto Fulati mwe isi ya Amawi. Niyo amgamba Balamu vino, “Hana wantu walaile Misili, nawo wamema chila hantu mwe isi, naho waika wikazi haguhi ne isi yangu. <verse eid="NUM 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 22:6" />Haluse so uniligitile awantu wano kwaviya wananguvu kujinka miye. Mafani nadaha niwahude na kuwabalaza wasekwingila mwe isi yangu, kwaviya simanya kugamba weye unamjimbika mntu ajimbikwa, unamligita mntu aligitwa.”<verse eid="NUM 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 22:7" />Wadalahala wa Moabu, na wadalahala wa Midiani, niyo waita kuno wegala maliho kuliha Balamu awaligite Waizulaeli, wahalawa kwita kwa Balamu. Weze wabule, wamgambila Balamu ulosi uwo wa Balaki. <verse eid="NUM 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 22:8" />Balamu niyo awagamba, “Gonani kuno ichilo chino, miye naniwagambile viya Zumbe Chohile akunga anigambile.” Ivyo, wadalahala awo wa Moabu niyo wagonaga kwa Balamu.<verse eid="NUM 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 22:9" />Chohile niyo amwizila Balamu, amgamba, “Ni wantu wani awo unanawo?”<verse eid="NUM 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 22:10" />Balamu amhitula Chohile, “Balaki mwana ywa Sipoli seuta ywa Moabu kanigaila ulosi uno, <verse eid="NUM 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 22:11" />kuna wantu wasiku walaile Misili, wamema chila hantu mwe isi. Kanilombeza nite hawaligite awantu awo mafani nadaha kutowana nawo na kuwabalaza.” <verse eid="NUM 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 22:12" />Chohile amgamba Balamu, “Usekwita hamwenga na awantu wano, naho usekuwaligita wantu awo kwaviya wajimbikwa.”<verse eid="NUM 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 22:13" />Mtondo wakwe Balamu niyo enuka, awagamba wadya walosi wa Balaki, “Uyani kwe isi yenyu, kwaviya Zumbe hakunga kunilekeila nite hamwenga na nyuwe.” <verse eid="NUM 22:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 22:14" />Ivyo wadya walosi kulaila Moabu niyo wahalawa, wauya kwa Balaki, wamgamba, “Balamu kalemela kwiza hamwenga na suwe.”<verse eid="NUM 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 22:15" />Akaheza Balaki niyo asigila wakulu watuhu walozize wata udahi kujinka wadya wa nkongo. <verse eid="NUM 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 22:16" />Awo niyo wabula kwa Balamu, wamgamba, “Balaki mwana ywa Sipoli agamba vino, usekuzumila kuchindwa ni chochose vinaleke usekwiza kwangu, <verse eid="NUM 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 22:17" />Nahutunyise na kukwinka chochose naunilombeze. So uniligitile awantu wano.”<verse eid="NUM 22:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 22:18" />Mna Balamu niyo awahitula awo walosi wa Balaki, “Hata uneva Balaki naninke inyumba yakwe imemile chumbu hamwenga na zahabu, miye sanidahe kubalanga lagizo dya Zumbe Chohile ywangu, mwembuli yoyose, nkulu hegu ndodo ivituhu. <verse eid="NUM 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 22:19" />Mna gonani ahano ichilo chino saviya wadya awenyu, miye nilonde chani nimanye chiya Zumbe akunga anigambile.”<verse eid="NUM 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 22:20" />Ivyo, Chohile amwizila Balamu mwe ichilo chiya amgamba, “Kwaviya awantu wano weza kukwitanga, hita hamwenga nawo, mna damanya diya nahugambile.” <verse eid="NUM 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 22:21" />Balamu eze enuke mtondo aitandaza impunda yakwe mlanga, aita hamwenga na wadya awakulu wa Moabu.<verse eid="NUM 22:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Balamu ne impunda yakwe na mndima ywa kwembingu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 22:22" />Chohile niyo emukwa ni maya kwaviya Balamu nakaita, ivyo mndima ywa kwembingu ywa Zumbe niyo ekala mwe sila kumhiga. Balamu nendile kakwela impunda yakwe, na wandima wakwe waidi wendaga wehamwenga naye. <verse eid="NUM 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 22:23" />Ivyo, impunda niyo yamwona mndima ywa kwembingu ywa Zumbe kachimala mwe sila, niyo yasongoloza isila. Balamu niyo aitowa vituhu aivuza mwesila. <verse eid="NUM 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 22:24" />Vikaheza mndima ywa kwembingu ywa Zumbe niyo alongola kulongozi, niyo achimala mwe sila finyu imgati mwe zinkonde ze mizabibu ina viwambaza ntendele zose mbili. <verse eid="NUM 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 22:25" />Impunda ize imuwone umndima uyo ywa kwembingu ywa Zumbe, niyo yafifinya hankanda hechiwambaza na kufinyankiza ichiga cha Balamu. Ivyo, Balamu niyo aitowa naho. <verse eid="NUM 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 22:26" />Vikaheza mndima ywa kwembingu ywa Zumbe niyo alongola naho, niyo achimala hafinyu hehena luhenyo lwa kujinkila kulume hegu kumoso. <verse eid="NUM 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 22:27" />Impunda ize imuwone yudya mndima wa kwembingu ywa Zumbe, niyo yagona hasi iviya Balamu emlanga. Balamu emukwa ni maya, niyo aitowa impunda nenkome yakwe. <verse eid="NUM 22:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 22:28" />Aho Zumbe Chohile aitenda impunda ilonge, niyo yamgamba Balamu, “Sikubalanga mbwani vikuleka ukunitowa nkanana ntatu.?”<verse eid="NUM 22:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 22:29" />Balamu niyo aigamba impunda, “Weye kunibela! Hegu nendile na bamba nasikukoma ivino haluse.”<verse eid="NUM 22:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 22:30" />Impunda niyo yamgamba Balamu “Togola miye suyo mpunda ywako hwinule mwo wikazi wako wose kubula dyelo? Sizwela kukudamanya savino?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NUM 22:30">Balamu ahitula, “Bule.”<verse eid="NUM 22:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 22:31" />Aho, Zumbe niyo amtenda Balamu amuwone uyo umndima ywa kwembingu ywa Zumbe kachimala mwesila, katoza bamba mo mkono wakwe disomolwe kulaila mwe yala yakwe. Balamu niyo afikamadi na kwinamila kubula hasi. <verse eid="NUM 22:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 22:32" />Mndima ywa kwembingu ywa Zumbe amgamba Balamu, “Nimbwani kuitowa impunda yako nkanana ntatu? Siza kukuchinda, kwaviya sila yako iha.” <verse eid="NUM 22:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 22:33" />Impunda yako iniwona nkanana ntatu niyo yapaguka. Hegu hayahituke hale na miye chindedi nasikukoma weye na kuileka impunda njima.<verse eid="NUM 22:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 22:34" />Balamu niyo amgamba mndima ywa kwembingu ywa Zumbe, “Sidamanya masa, simanyize kugamba kuchimala mwesila kwa kunichinda. Haluse uneva havikuwagile nijendeleze nentambo ino nanuye kaya.”<verse eid="NUM 22:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 22:35" />Mndima ywa kwembingu ywa Zumbe niyo amgamba Balamu, “Hita na awantu wano, mna nolonge chiya du hunga hugambile. Elo Balamu niyo ajendeleza nnteambo hamwenga na awandima wa Balaki.”<verse eid="NUM 22:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Balaki amsingila Balamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 22:36" />Balaki eze eve kugamba Balamu eza niyo afosa aita akumhokela komzi wa Ari wendaga mmpezo momto wa Alinoni komhaka wa Moabu. <verse eid="NUM 22:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 22:37" />Balaki amgamba Balamu, “Ni mbwani husunguze kwiza kwangu nize hwitange? Togola nokafanyanya kugamba sikudaha kukutogolesa?”<verse eid="NUM 22:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 22:38" />Balamu amhitula Balaki, “Haluse vitenda zeze! Mna, nina udahi wa kulonga mbuli yoyose? Mbuli Chohile nanigambile niyo hungigwa nilonge.” <verse eid="NUM 22:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 22:39" />Ivyo, Balamu niyo aita hamwenga na Balaki. Wabula komzi wa Kiliati Husoti. <verse eid="NUM 22:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 22:40" />Uko Balaki niyo alavya lavyo dya ng'ombe na ngonto, awasangila Balamu na wandima wendaga hamwenga nawo.<verse eid="NUM 22:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Balamu awajimbika Waizulaeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 22:41" />Mtondo wakwe Balaki, niyo amguha Balamu, akwela naye kubula hanyu wakumvikila Baali, kulaila uko, Balamu kadaha kuwawona Waizulaeli wasiku.<verse eid="NUM 22:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="NUM 23" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 23:1" />Balamu niyo amgamba Balaki, “Nizengela nchanja mfungate za kulaviza ntambiko hano ukajika unigaile njeku mfungate na ndolome mfungate.”<verse eid="NUM 23:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 23:2" />Balaki kadamanya saviya Balamu alongile. Ivyo, niyo walaviza mlanga kwa chila nchanja ya kulaviza ntambiko njeku imwenga na ndolome imwenga. <verse eid="NUM 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 23:3" />Ivyo Balamu amgamba Balaki, “Ikala hano hajihi ne dilavyo dyako dyo kutikimya, miye nite. Mafani Zumbe nadugane na miye. Chochose nanilagise nanize hugambile.” Ivyo, Balamu niyo aita ichedu kulanga kolugulu. <verse eid="NUM 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 23:4" />Chohile adugana na Balamu, Balamu niyo amgamba, “Sidamanya nchanja mfungate za kulaviza ntambiko na kulavya njeku imwenga na ndolome imwenga mlanga mwe chila nchanja yokulaviza ntambiko.”<verse eid="NUM 23:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 23:5" />Zumbe Chohile amwinka Balamu mbuli akunga alonge na kumgamba auye akamgambile Balaki. <verse eid="NUM 23:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 23:6" />Balamu auya, ambwila Balaki kachimala ahadya hajihi nedilavyo dyakwe dyo kutikimya, hamwenga na wadya awandima wose wa Moabu.<verse eid="NUM 23:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 23:7" />Balamu awagambila ulosi uno,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:7">“Balaki kanigala hano</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:7">kulaila Alamu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:7">chindedi, seuta ywa Moabu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:7">kanigala kulaila lugulu ulailo wa zuwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:7">so uniligitile wantu wa Yakobo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:7">Naho uwalonge vihiye Waizulaeli!”<verse eid="NUM 23:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 23:8" />“Nanimligite vivihi mntu yudya Chohile hemligite? Naniwalonge vihiye vivihi wantu hewelongigwe vihiye ni Zumbe?”<verse eid="NUM 23:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 23:9" />Kulaila kolunenengwe lwa mayuwe makulu nawawona,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:9">kulaila kulanga kolungulu nawasaguila awo wantu wa si ntuhu, wantu wakwikala ichedu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:9">hewekweduvya saviya wantu wa si ntuhu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:9">Wamanya kugamba wajimbikwa kujinka wantu watuhu.<verse eid="NUM 23:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 23:10" />Ni yuhi akudaha kuwaza uwazwa wa wantu wa Yakobo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:10">hegu kuwafanyanya idifyo dya Izulaeli walozize saviya tifili.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:10">Leka nibanike file ikuwagila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:10">uhelo wangu nautende saviya wawo.<verse eid="NUM 23:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 23:11" />Ivyo, Balaki amgamba Balamu, “Kunidamanyiza mbwani? Sikwigala hano uwaligite wankondo wangu, mna weye kuwajimbika!”<verse eid="NUM 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 23:12" />Balamu amhitula Balaki, “Nanilonge ulosi udya du Zumbe anigambile.”<verse eid="NUM 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ulosi wa kaidi wa Balamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 23:13" />Vikaheza Balaki niyo amgamba Balamu, “Chite hantu hatuhu hadya ukudaha kuwawona, nowawone wajeche du howawone wose. Kulaila uko uniligitele awantu awo.” <verse eid="NUM 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 23:14" />Ivyo, Balaki niyo amguha Balamu hantu haligane, mlanga mo uhelo wo lugulu lwa Pisiga. Aho niyo azenga nchanja mfungate za kulaviza ntambiko na kulavya njeku imwenga na ndolome imwenga mwe chila nchanja yo kulaviza ntambiko. <verse eid="NUM 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 23:15" />Balamu niyo amgamba Balaki, “Sigala hano hajihi na amalavyo yako yokutikimya, umo miye haita kudya hadugane na Zumbe.” <verse eid="NUM 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 23:16" />Zumbe Chohile amwinka Balamu mbuli akunga alonge na kumgamba auye akamgambile Balaki. <verse eid="NUM 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 23:17" />Ivyo, Balamu auya, ambwila Balaki kachimala hajihi na amalavyo yokutikimya hamwenga na awandima wose wa Moabu. Balaki niyo amuza Balamu, “Zumbe kakugambila mbwani?” <verse eid="NUM 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 23:18" />Vikaheza, Balamu niyo amgambila Balaki ulosi uno,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:18">“Chimala, Balaki, utegeleze!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:18">Unitegeleze, weye mwana ywa Sipoli!”<verse eid="NUM 23:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 23:19" />Chohile suyo mntu, alonge udanti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:19">naho suyo mntu, ahituile fanyanyi zakwe!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:19">Alagane chintu asekuchidamanya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:19">hegu alonge chintu asekuchidamanya? <verse eid="NUM 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 23:20" />Sinkigwa lagizo dya kujimbika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:20">uyo kajimbika, miye sikudaha kuhituila.<verse eid="NUM 23:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 23:21" />Zumbe Chohile hawone wihi mwa awantu wa Yakobo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:21">Naho hawone kuhiga mwa wantu wa Izulaeli.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:21">Zumbe Chohile ywakwe ehamwenga nawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:21">wowo nawagambe uyo ni seuta ywawo.<verse eid="NUM 23:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 23:22" />Chohile kawegala kulaila Misili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:22">uyo awagombela saviya mbogo.<verse eid="NUM 23:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 23:23" />Chindedi hahana ligito nadimbwile Yakobo</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:23">Naho hahana usai naumpate Izulaeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:23">hegu ugangana mwa awantu wa Izulaeli.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:23">Haluse mbuli za Yakobo na Izulaeli nazilongwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:23">Kaula mbuli adamanye Chohile!<verse eid="NUM 23:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 23:24" />Kaula wantu wano wakumpukila saviya simba fyele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:24">saviya simba ikwenula yenye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:24">haigone kubula itatavula amaingo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:24">na kunywa isakame ya amaingo yakwe.<verse eid="NUM 23:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 23:25" />Balaki niyo amgamba Balamu, “Ivyo, usekuwaligita naho usekuwa jimbika!” <verse eid="NUM 23:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 23:26" />Mna Balamu niyo amgamba Balaki, “Togola sikugambile chiya Zumbe nalonge nicho hunga nidamanye?”<verse eid="NUM 23:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ulosi wakatu wa Balamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 23:27" />Balaki niyo amgamba Balamu, “So nahwigale hantu hatuhu. Mafani Chohile nakuzumile uniligitile awantu awo kulaila uko.”<verse eid="NUM 23:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 23:28" />Ivyo, Balaki niyo amwigala Balamu kubula kolunenengwe lo lugulu lwa Peoli, hantu mntu anachimala awona kubula hasi kwe dijangwa. <verse eid="NUM 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 23:29" />Balamu niyo amgamba Balaki, “Nizengele nchanja mfungate za kulaviza ntambiko hano, unikiye njeku mfungate na ndolome mfungate.”<verse eid="NUM 23:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 23:30" />Ivyo, Balaki niyo adamanya saviya agambilwe ni Balamu, niyo alavya njeku imwenga na ndolome imwenga mlanga mwe chila nchanja yokulaviza ntambiko.<verse eid="NUM 23:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="NUM 24" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 24:1" />Ivyo Balamu eze awone kugamba vimuwagila Zumbe kuwajimbika Waizulaeli, saviya hadya nkongo, chani alonde usai, mna kahitwila uso wakwe na kukaula kwedijangwa, <verse eid="NUM 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 24:2" />Balamu niyo enula ameso yakwe, kawawona Waizulaeli waika nkambi chila kabila hantu hakwe, Muye wa Chohile niyo wamwizila. <verse eid="NUM 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 24:3" />Niyo agamba, uyo akwiva ulosi wa Chohile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:3">Uyo nawone ulosi wa Zumbe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:3">akagwa chifudifudi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:3">akuwona pwilili,<verse eid="NUM 24:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 24:4" />Agamba uyo evile ulosi za Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:4">mntu akuwona ulosi wa Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:4">akafika madi kubula hasi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:4">kuno kagubulwa ameso.<verse eid="NUM 24:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 24:5" />Weye Yakobo mahema yako ni matana vivihi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:5">wikazi wako weye Izulaeli!<verse eid="NUM 24:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 24:6" />Mligano wa makolongo yakwitila mazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:6">saviya miti ihandigwe hankanda homto,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:6">saviya miti ya mishubili ahandile Zumbe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:6">saviya miti ya mielezi mnkanda mwe mazi.<verse eid="NUM 24:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 24:7" />Mazi nayajulizikile mwe izindoo zawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:7">mbeyu zakwe nazitende mwe mazi yalozize.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:7">Seuta ywakwe na atunyiswe kujinka Agagi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:7">useuta wakwe nautunyiswe.<verse eid="NUM 24:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 24:8" />Chohile kamwigala kulaila Misili</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:8">ananguvu saziya za mbogo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:8">Natule amavuha yawo vihandehande.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:8">Naawamele wankondo wakwe kwa misale yawo.<verse eid="NUM 24:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 24:9" />Nabandagale, niyo akweta saviya simba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:9">nabandagale na kukweta saviya simba fyele, ni yuhi najeze kumsetula?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:9">Ajimbikwe chila akukujimbika weye Izulaeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:9">naaligitwe chila akukuligita.<verse eid="NUM 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 24:10" />Balaki niyo amwemukila maya Balamu niyo atowa magasa kwa maya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:10">“Sikwitanga chani uniligitile awankondo wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:10">mna, nkanana zose ntatu kuwajimbikisa! <verse eid="NUM 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 24:11" />Ivyo haluse kweitile. Nasunga hujeleke,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:11">mna Zumbe haungile upate izintunyo izo, kalemela!” <verse eid="NUM 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 24:12" />Balamu niyo amgamba Balaki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:12">“Togola wakumbuka ivyo niwagambile awalosi wadya usigile kwangu? <verse eid="NUM 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 24:13" />Hata hegu waninkile chumbu na zahabu vimwenyumbako.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:13">Miye sikudaha kukola masa kwa Zumbe kwa kudamanya mbuli yoyose yedi hegu ihiye kwa kunga miye mwenye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:13">silonga kugamba chiya akunga alonge Zumbe nicho nanidamanye.”<verse eid="NUM 24:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ulosi wo udumo wa Balamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 24:14" />Balamu niyo amgamba Balaki, “Haluse nanuye kwa awantu wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:14">mna goja hugambile mbuli ziya wantu awo nawawadamanyize wantu wako mazuwa yakwiza.” <verse eid="NUM 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 24:15" />Ivyo, Balamu niyo alonga ulosi uno,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:15">“Ulosi wangu miye Balamu mwana ywa Beoli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:15">ulosi wa mntu agubulwe ameso pwilili, <verse eid="NUM 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 24:16" />ulosi wa mntu evile mbuli za Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:16">Akumanya umanyi ukulaila kwa Chohile mkulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:16">mntu akuwona uwoni wa mta nguvu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:16">Akufikamadi nakubula hasi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:16">mntu akuwona ulosi wa Chohile.”<verse eid="NUM 24:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 24:17" />Namuwona mna siyo haluse,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:17">nawamsinye, mna saho hajihi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:17">seuta nalaile saviya ntondo nailaile kwa Yakobo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:17">Seuta nalaile mgati mwa Izulaeli. Nayo naizitowe izimpembe za Moabu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:17">na kuwatagantiza imitwi welekwa wa Seti.<verse eid="NUM 24:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 24:18" />Edomu naitahigwe</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:18">Iviya, Seili naitende yakwe, awo wendile wankondo wakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:18">Izulaeli nawatende wahuda wakulu.<verse eid="NUM 24:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 24:19" />Chilongozi nalaile kwa Yakobo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:19">nawabalange wadya nawasigale komzi.<verse eid="NUM 24:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 24:20" />Vikaheza awasinya Waamaleki, niyo alavya ulosi uno,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:20">Waamaleki wendaga na nguvu mwa wantu wa si ntuhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:20">mna udumo nawabalangwe.<verse eid="NUM 24:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 24:21" />Vikaheza awasinya Wakeni, niyo alavya ulosi uno,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:21">“Wikazi wako utoga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:21">saviya sasa dikigwe mwe luwe.<verse eid="NUM 24:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 24:22" />Hamwenga na ayo Wakeni nawabindwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:22">Hadya Ashulu nawatahe.<verse eid="NUM 24:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 24:23" />Niyo alavya ulosi uno</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:23">Namluwone! Ni yuhi nahone, umo Chohile nadamanye yano?<verse eid="NUM 24:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 24:24" />Mna mashuwa nazize kulaila mpwani ya Kitimu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:24">nazimmwebunge Ashulu na Ebeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:24">naweyebunge Asulu na Ebeli, mna awo nawo nawakomwe.”<verse eid="NUM 24:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 24:25" />Ivyo, Balamu niyo ahalawa, auya kukaya kwakwe, Balaki naye niyo aita zakwe.<verse eid="NUM 24:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="NUM 25" />
  <para style="s">Wantu wa Izulaeli uko Peoli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 25:1" />Waizulaeli weze wakale Sitimu, wagosi niyo wakonga kujenda uyaga na wavyele wa Moabu. <verse eid="NUM 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 25:2" />Wavyele awo wawagonekwa Waizulaeli wehange mwe ntambiko wamvikile mlungu ywawo, Nawo Waizulaeli wadya nkande na kuvikakila mlungu ywawo. <verse eid="NUM 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 25:3" />Nivyo Waizulaeli welunga na kumvikila na mnugu Baal Peoli, maya ya Zumbe niyo yawemukila. <verse eid="NUM 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 25:4" />Ivyo, Zumbe amgamba Musa, “Waguhe vilongozi wose wa Izulaeli walongoze wantu vihiye, uwalungike mwedizuwa halongozi hangu chani maya yangu yausigwe mwa Waizulaeli.” <verse eid="NUM 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 25:5" />Musa amgamba vilongozi ywa Izulaeli, “Chila yumwenga ywenyu amkome mntu yoyose mwenyu yudya amvikie mnungu Baal.” <verse eid="NUM 25:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 25:6" />Vikaheza mntu yumwenga kamwigala mvyele yumwenga Mmidiani mwe nyumba yakwe halongozi ha Musa na Waizulaeli wose umo walomboleza mwe nchili ye Idihema Dikukile. <verse eid="NUM 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 25:7" />Ivyo, Finehasi mwana ywa Eleazali mwezukulu ywa mlavyantambiko Haluni eze awone ayo, niyo achimala afosa aguha idiguha dyakwe, <verse eid="NUM 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 25:8" />na kumtimila yudya Mwizulaeli kubula kundani kwedihema dya uyo mntu, niyo awatunga guha wose waidi mwe zinda. Kwakudamanya ivyo unyonje wihise wendile ukawabinda Waizulaeli niyo wasila. <verse eid="NUM 25:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 25:9" />Wantu wabanike kulaila mo unyonje udya vihise wendaga wantu magana maidi mlongo na magana mane. <verse eid="NUM 25:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 25:10" />Zumbe amgamba Musa, <verse eid="NUM 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 25:11" />“Finehasi mwana ywa Eleazali, mwezukulu ywa mlavyantambiko Haluni, kachinda amaya yangu mwa waizulaeli, nuyodu mwenyu haungile kuwona mnungu mtuhu avikilwe mna miye du. Kwauyo nivyo vilekile siwabalange Waizulaeli wose kwa maya yangu. <verse eid="NUM 25:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 25:12" />Mgambile Finehasi kugamba nanidamanye naye lagano dya utondowazi. <verse eid="NUM 25:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 25:13" />Silagana naye kugamba uyo nawelekwa wakwe nawatende walavyantambiko mazuwa yose, kwaviya haungile kuwona mnungu mtuhu avikilwe mna miye du na kuwadamanyiza wivano wana wa Izulaeli na miye.”<verse eid="NUM 25:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 25:14" />Uyo mwizaeli akomigwe hamwenga na mvyele ywa Kimidiani naketangwa Zimuli mwana ywa Salu, chilongozi ywa kaya siku mwedikabila dya Simeoni. <verse eid="NUM 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 25:15" />Zina dya uyo mvyele ywe Chimidiyani akomigwe naketangwa Kozibi mwana ywa Suli, endaga chilongozi ywa lukolo lusiku mwe idikabila dya Midiyani. <verse eid="NUM 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 25:16" />Zumbe Chohile amgamba Musa, <verse eid="NUM 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 25:17" />“Webunge na kuwakoma Wamidiani, <verse eid="NUM 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 25:18" />Kwaviya nawawadantani na kuwatenda mumvile mnungu Baali na mchiche ywawo Kozibi akomagwa mounyonje wihiye umo walailaga uko Peoli.”<verse eid="NUM 25:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="NUM 26" />
  <para style="s">Uwazwa wa kaidi wa Waizulaeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 26:1" />Eze womboke unyonje wihise, Zumbe niyo amgamba Musa na Eleazali mwana ywa mlavyantambiko Haluni. <verse eid="NUM 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 26:2" />“Wawazeni wantu wose mwa Waizulaeli mwezikaya zawo, wadya wose wana lika kukongela mihilimo kukongela milongo midi na kujendeleza, wakudaha kwita kwenkondo.” <verse eid="NUM 26:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 26:3" />Akaheza Musa na Eliazali mlavyantambiko walonga nawo mwe isi yamabwandasi ya Moabu hajihi nomto wa Yolodani uko Yeliko, wawagamba, <verse eid="NUM 26:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 26:4" />“Wawazeni wantu wose wata lika kukongela mihilongo milongo midi na kujendeleza saviya Zumbe amlagize Musa.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NUM 26:4">Wano nawo Waizulaeli walaile uko Misili. <verse eid="NUM 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 26:5" />Nkongo ni kabila dya Lubeni, mwelekwa ywa nkongo ywa Yakobo, Hanoki na Palu, <verse eid="NUM 26:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 26:6" />Na Helisoni wa kaya ya Wahelisoni na Kalimi, we kaya ya Wakalimi. <verse eid="NUM 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 26:7" />Zino ni izinkolo zeidikabila dya Lubeni wadya wawazigwe wendaga wantu milongo mine na magana mfungate na milongo mitatu elufu. <verse eid="NUM 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 26:8" />Welekwa wa Palu wendaga ni Eliabu, <verse eid="NUM 26:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 26:9" />na wanawe wendaga ni Eliabu, Nemueli, na Dasani, na Abilamu. Awo nawo Dasani na Bilamu wasagulwe nidibunga wahiganaga na Musa na Haluni momdugano wa Kola, aho wamlemelaga Zumbe. <verse eid="NUM 26:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 26:10" />Isanga niyo yatulika na kuwamela Kola na awantu wakwe, moto wize uwabalange wantu magana maidi na milongo mishano. Dino dyendaga kanyo kwa Waizulaeli. <verse eid="NUM 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 26:11" />Hata ivyo wanawe dya Kola hawabanikaga. <verse eid="NUM 26:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 26:12" />Welekwa wa Simeoni kwa kaya zawo, wendaga ni Nemueli kwa lukolo lwa Wanemueli, na lukolo dya Yamini kwa kaya za Wayamini, na Yakini kwa kaya za Wayakini, <verse eid="NUM 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 26:13" />Sohali kwa kaya za Wasohali, Washaulu kwa kaya za Washauli. <verse eid="NUM 26:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 26:14" />Zino nizo izinkolo za dikabila dya Simeoni, wawazigwa wendaga magana milongo midi mlongo na milongo midi elufu.<verse eid="NUM 26:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 26:15" />Kulaila mwe idiabila dya Gadi dyendaga na nkolo za Wasifoni na nkolo na Wahagi, na nkolo za Washuni, <verse eid="NUM 26:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 26:16" />wa Eziboni, kwa nkolo za Waziboni, na Waeli kwa kaya za wa Eli, <verse eid="NUM 26:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 26:17" />wa Alodi, kwa kaya za Alodi, na Aleli, kwa kaya za wa Aleli. <verse eid="NUM 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 26:18" />Zino nizo izinkolo za kabila dya Gadi, wagosi wendaga milongo mine magana na mashano. <verse eid="NUM 26:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 26:19" />Kabila dya Yuda wendaga ni Eli na Onani. Awo Eli na Onani wabanikilaga mwe isi ya Kanani. <verse eid="NUM 26:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 26:20" />Wanawe Yuda kwa kaya zawo, wa Shela, kwa kaya za Washela, wa Pelesi, kwa kaya za Wapelesi, wa Zela, kwa kaya za Wazela. <verse eid="NUM 26:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 26:21" />Lukolo ywa Pelesi lwendaga lupangana vyeleko vidi, lweleko lwa Heziloni na lweleko lwa Hamuli. <verse eid="NUM 26:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 26:22" />Zino nizo izinkolo za Yuda, wawazagwa, wagosi wendaga magana milongo mfungate mlongo na magana mashano elufu.<verse eid="NUM 26:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 26:23" />Kulaila kabila dya Isakali na lukolo lwa Tola, kwa kaya za wa Tola, wa Puva, kwa lukolo lwa Puva, <verse eid="NUM 26:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 26:24" />Lukolo lwa Yasubu na lukolo lwa Simeoni. <verse eid="NUM 26:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 26:25" />Zino nizo izinkolo za Isakali, wawazagwa wagosi wendaga magana mlongo magana mtandatu na wane na magana matatu.<verse eid="NUM 26:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 26:26" />Kulaila kabila dya Zebuloni kwa nkolo za Seledi, kwa kaya na lukolo lwa Eloni, kwa kaya za Eloni, wa Yaleli, kwa kaya za Wayaleli. <verse eid="NUM 26:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 26:27" />Zino nizo izi nkolo za Wazaabuloni, wawazagwa wawagosi wendaga magana milongo mtandatu mlongo na magana mashano.<verse eid="NUM 26:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 26:28" />Yusufu endaga na wana waidi, Manase na Efulaimu. Awo weza kutenda makabila.<verse eid="NUM 26:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 26:29" />Manase endaga na mwana yumwenga uyo ni Makili, Makili mwanawe ni Gileadi. <verse eid="NUM 26:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 26:30" />Nkolo zilawane na Gileadi, zendaga ni lukolo lwa Biezali na lukolo lwa Hekeli, <verse eid="NUM 26:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 26:31" />lukolo lwa Asilieli na lukolo lwa Shekemu, <verse eid="NUM 26:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 26:32" />lukolo lwa Shemida na lukolo lwa Hefeli. <verse eid="NUM 26:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 26:33" />Selofohadi mwana ywa Hefeli hendaga na wana wachilume, mna wachiche awodu, na mazina ya awo wandele wa Selofohadi ni yano, Mala, na Noa, na Hogla, na Milka na Tilisa elufu. <verse eid="NUM 26:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 26:34" />Izo nizo izinkolo za Manase, wawazagwa wagosi wendaga magana mashano mlongo na waidi na magana mfungate elufu. <verse eid="NUM 26:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 26:35" />Kabila dya Efulaimu dyendaga na lukolo lwa Shutela na lukolo lwa Bekela na lukolo lwa Tahani, <verse eid="NUM 26:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 26:36" />Kulaila molukolwa lwa Shushela kwendaga na lukolo lwa Elani. <verse eid="NUM 26:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 26:37" />Zino nizo izinkolo za Efulaimu, wagosi wawazagwa wendaga magana matatu mlongo na waidi na magana mashano elufu. Nkolo zose izo za amakabila ayo amaidi zalawanaga na Yusufu. <verse eid="NUM 26:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 26:38" />Kulaila mweidikabila dya Benjamini kwendaga na lukolo lwa Bela na lukolo lwa Ashibela, na lukolo lwa Ahilamu, <verse eid="NUM 26:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 26:39" />lukolo lwa Sufamu na lukolo lwa Hufamu. <verse eid="NUM 26:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 26:40" />Kulaila kwa Bela kwendaga na vyeleko vya Namani na Alidi. <verse eid="NUM 26:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 26:41" />Zino nizo izinkolo za Benjamini, wagosi wawazagwa wendaga magana mane mlongo na mashano na magana mtandatu elufu.<verse eid="NUM 26:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 26:42" />Kulaila mwedikabila dya Dani kwendaga na nkolo za Suhani na lukololwa Dani. <verse eid="NUM 26:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="NUM 26:43" />Mwe dikabila dya Washuhamu, wawazagwa wendaga wagosi wendaga magana mtandatu mlongo na wane na magana mane. <verse eid="NUM 26:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="NUM 26:44" />Mwe dikabila dya Asheli, kwa kaya zawo, wa Imna, kwa kaya za Waimna, wa Ishivi, kwa kaya za Waishivi, wa Beliya, kwa kaya za Wabeliya. <verse eid="NUM 26:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NUM 26:45" />Vyeleko vya Beliya vyendaga Hebeli na Malikieli. <verse eid="NUM 26:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="NUM 26:46" />Asheli endaga na mchiche akwitangwa Sela. <verse eid="NUM 26:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="NUM 26:47" />Zino nizo izi nkolo ze idikabila dya Asheli, wagosi wawazagwa wendaga magana milongo mashano mlongo na ntatu na magana mlongo mine elufu. <verse eid="NUM 26:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="NUM 26:48" />Mwe dikabila dya Nafutali nkolo zakwe ni Yeseli na Guni, <verse eid="NUM 26:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="NUM 26:49" />Yeseli na Shilemu. <verse eid="NUM 26:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="NUM 26:50" />Zino nizo izi nkolo zedikabila dya Nafutali, wagosi wawazagwa wendaga magana mine mlongo na mine na magana mane elufu. <verse eid="NUM 26:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="NUM 26:51" />Waizulaeli wawazagwa wagosi wendaga magana milongo mtandatu magana mfungate na milongo mitatu. <verse eid="NUM 26:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="NUM 26:52" />Vikaheza Zumbe niyo amgamba Musa, <verse eid="NUM 26:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="NUM 26:53" />“Wantu wano wapangile isi itende ulisi wawo, kuligana no uwazwa wawo. <verse eid="NUM 26:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="NUM 26:54" />Awo nawatende na uwazwa ulozize nowenke ntendele nkulu yo ulisi, na awo wahunguke mo uwazwa nauwenke ntendele ndodo yo ulisi, Chila wantu saviya wawazigwe, nivyo nenkigwe ulisi wakwe. <verse eid="NUM 26:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="NUM 26:55" />Mna isi na ipangwe kwa tegatega, kutimilana na mazina ya makabila ya watati zawo, nivyo nawenkigwe ulisi. <verse eid="NUM 26:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="NUM 26:56" />Ulisi wa chila kabila nadisangilwe kwa tegatega, nivyo navitendeke.”<verse eid="NUM 26:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="NUM 26:57" />Zino nizo izinkolo za Walawi ziwazigwe nkolo zawo Gelisoni na lukolo lw Kohasi na lukolo lwa Melali. <verse eid="NUM 26:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="NUM 26:58" />Vino nivyo ivyeleko Libuni na Hebloni na Mala Mushi na Kola. Kohati amwelekaga Amlamu. <verse eid="NUM 26:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="NUM 26:59" />Zina dya mkaza Amlamu endaga aketangwa Yokebedi mndele ywa kabila dya Walawi, yudya elekagwa kudya Lawi mwe isi ya Misili, na uyo Yokebedi amwelekaga Amlamu wana waidi Haluni na Musa, na lumbu dyawo Miliyamu. <verse eid="NUM 26:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="NUM 26:60" />Haluni endaga na wana wane, Nadabu na Abihu na Eleazali na Itamali. <verse eid="NUM 26:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="NUM 26:61" />Nadabu na Abihu wabanika hadya wamlavizaga Zumbe lavyo dya moto heuwagile. <verse eid="NUM 26:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="NUM 26:62" />Walawi wawazagwa wana chigosi wata lika dya mwezi umwenga na kujendeleza wendaga magana maidi mlongo na watatu elufu. Awo hawawazigwe hamwenga na Waizulaeli watuhu kwaviya hawenkigwe ulisi wa sanga mwa wana wa Izulaeli. <verse eid="NUM 26:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="NUM 26:63" />Wano nawo wagosi wawazagwa ni Musa na Eleazali mlavyantambiko, wawawazaga wana wa Izulaeli mwe dibwandasi dya Moabu, ntendele ya kaidi yomto wa Yolodani, haguhi na Yeliko. <verse eid="NUM 26:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="NUM 26:64" />Mna mgati mwawo hendaga hahana mntu hata yumwenga asigale mwa wadya wawazigwe ni Musa na mlavyantambiko Haluni, wawawazize mouwazwa wa nkongo kwedijangwa dya Sinai. <verse eid="NUM 26:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="NUM 26:65" />Kwaviya Zumbe kalonga mwawo, nawabanike kwedijangwa. Naho hahasigale hata mntu yumwenga mgati mwawo, ukaleka Kalebu mwana ywa Yefune, na Yoshuwa mwana ywa Nuni.<verse eid="NUM 26:65" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="NUM 27" />
  <para style="s">Lombezo dya wana chiche wa Zelofehadi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 27:1" />Zuwa dimwenga wandele wano Mala na Nowa na Hogula na Milika na Tiliza wana wa Selofehadi wambasaga Musa. Uyo Selofehadi endaga mwana ywa Hefeli mwana ywa Zelofehadi endaga mwana ywa Gileadi, mwana ywa Makili, mwana ywa Manase, mwana dya Yusufu. <verse eid="NUM 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 27:2" />Wandele awo niyo wachimala ha Musa na Eliazali mlavyantambiko na havilongozi na hawantu wose he nchili ye Idihema Dikukile niyo wagamba, <verse eid="NUM 27:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 27:3" />“Tati yetu abanikaga kwedijangwa, uyo nahamuli mwa wadya wamtimilaga Kola awo wamhigaga Zumbe, uyo abanikaga kwa masa yakwe mwenye, mna nendile hana mwana yoyose ywa chilume. <verse eid="NUM 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 27:4" />Ni mbwani idizina dya tati yetu dikauswa molukolo lwakwe, kwaviya hana wana chilume? Naviwagila suwe chinkwe ulisi weisi hamwenga na walukolo wa tati yetu.” <verse eid="NUM 27:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 27:5" />Ivyo Musa niyo egala laho dyakwe kwa Zumbe Chohile. <verse eid="NUM 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 27:6" />Zumbe niyo amgamba Musa, <verse eid="NUM 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 27:7" />“Icho wakulonga wana chiche wa Selofehadi ni chindedi, uwenke ulisi weisi hamwenga na walukolo watati yawo. <verse eid="NUM 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 27:8" />Ukaheza wagambile Waizulaeli kugamba mntu yoyose anabanika hanasize mwana chilume, ulisi wakwe we sanga nenkigwe mwanawe ywa chiche. <verse eid="NUM 27:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 27:9" />Uneva hana mwana ywa chiche, ulisi uwo we sanga nenkigwe mlukolo ywakwe ywa chilume. <verse eid="NUM 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 27:10" />Uneva hana walukolo wa chilume, ulisi wakwe we sanga nawenkigwe watati zakwe wakulu hegu wadodo. <verse eid="NUM 27:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 27:11" />Uneva tati yakwe hana walukolo wa chilume, ivyo, ulisi wakwe we sanga negailwe mlukolo yakwe ywa haguhi, naguhe saviya ugoli wakwe. Dino naditende lagizo kwa Waizulaeli, saviya miye Chohile hugambile.”<verse eid="NUM 27:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yoshuwa asagulwa awalongoze Waizulaeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 27:12" />Vikaheza Zumbe amgamba Musa, “Kwela kolugulu luno lwa Abalimu wikaule isi niwenkile Waizulaeli. <verse eid="NUM 27:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 27:13" />Ukaheza kwiwona, weye nawe naubanike saviya mlukolo ywako Haluni ivyo abanike. <verse eid="NUM 27:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 27:14" />Weye nobanike kwaviya huzumile idilagizo dyangu kudya kwedijangwa dya Sini. Chipindi wantu wose weze wanifuzumile kudya Meliba, hamlekile nguvu zangu zikukile ziwoneke mwawo umo wongile wenkigwe mazi.” Meliba ni sokwe ya mazi ya Kadeshi mwe dijangwa dya Sini.<verse eid="NUM 27:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 27:15" />Musa amgamba Zumbe, <verse eid="NUM 27:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 27:16" />“Weye Chohile ukwinkiza ujima kwa vyumbe vyose, nakulombeza umsagule mntu wakuwalongoza wano wantu. <verse eid="NUM 27:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 27:17" />Uyo nuyo nawalongwele na kuwalongoza mwe zindima zawo zose, chani wantu wa Izulaeli wanase kutenda saviya ngoto hezina mdimi.”<verse eid="NUM 27:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 27:18" />Niyo Zumbe amgamba Musa, “mguhe Yoshuwa mwana ywa Nuni, mntu mta muye wedi mgati mwakwe, ukamwikiye umokono wako, <verse eid="NUM 27:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 27:19" />na kumchimalisa ha mlavyantambiko Eliazali na wantu wose, umwinke indima ya kulongoza kulongozi kwa wantu kuno wakamsinya. <verse eid="NUM 27:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 27:20" />Mwinke hantu hodahi wako chani mdugano wose wa Waizulaeli wamzumile. <verse eid="NUM 27:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 27:21" />Uyo namwegamile Eliazali mlavyantambiko yudya namanye ungi wangu kwa kujeseza yuwe dya ulosi. Yuwe dya ulosi kwa Chiebulania Ulimu na Sumimu yendaga mayuwe maidi yajesezwe ni mlavyantambiko kumanya viya Chohile akunga. Mweisila ino Eliazali na mlongoze Yoshuwa na umdugano wose wa Izulaeli umo wakafosa na wakengila.” <verse eid="NUM 27:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 27:22" />Musa niyo adamanya saviya Zumbe amlagize, amguha Yoshuwa, amwika ha meso ya Eliazali mlavyantambiko no mdugano wose wa Waizulaeli. <verse eid="NUM 27:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 27:23" />Akaheza amwikiya imikono yakwe mo mtwi na kumlagiza alongoze awantu saviya Zumbe Chohile.<verse eid="NUM 27:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="NUM 28" />
  <para style="s">Malavyo ya chila zuwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 28:1" />Niyo Zumbe amgamba Musa, <verse eid="NUM 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 28:2" />Uwagambile Waizulaeli ivyo vikungwa, “Nyuwe namnilavize ntambiko, kwa chipindi chakwe nkande za kutikimya zina mhempe ukuniwagila. <verse eid="NUM 28:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 28:3" />Uwagambile awantu dino nidyo idilavyo dyo kutikimya namnilavize chila zuwa, namlavye wadolome waidi wa mhilimo umwenga, hewena lema. <verse eid="NUM 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 28:4" />Kadolome akamwenga nakalavigwe nomtondo na umtuhu nalavigwe chisingi. <verse eid="NUM 28:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 28:5" />Chila yumwenga akatenda na malavyo ya chilo imenga ya unga uhanganywe na lita imwenga ya mavuta yedi ya mzeituni. <verse eid="NUM 28:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 28:6" />Dino ni lavyo dya chila zuwa dilavigwe kwa kutikimya kwa nkanana ya nkongo ko lugulu lwa Sinai kutenda lavyo dya nkande ina mhempe wakumuwagila Zumbe Chohile. <verse eid="NUM 28:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 28:7" />Na lavyo dyakwe dya kunywegwa ni lita imwenga ya mpombe kwa chila mwana ngoto, nawiijuluzize lavyo dino chila hantu aho hakukile. <verse eid="NUM 28:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 28:8" />Na mwana ngoto ywa kaidi no mlavye chisingi, saviya lavyo dya nkande dilavigwe mtondo, na saviya lavyo dya kunywegwa nivyo na udilavye, na umlavye kwa moto saviya mhempe ukumuwagila Zumbe Chohile.”<verse eid="NUM 28:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malavyo ya zuwa dya Kuhumula</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 28:9" />“Mwe dizuwa dya Kuhumula, namlavye lavyo dya wadolome waidi wa mhilimo umwenga hewena lema, lavyo dya nkande dya chilo mbili za unga uhanganywe na mavuta, ditende lavyo dya kunywegwa. <verse eid="NUM 28:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 28:10" />Lavyo dino dyo kutikimya nadilavigwe chila zuwa dya Kuhumula ukaleka idyo idilavyo dya chila zuwa hamwenga ne dilavyo dyakwe dyo kunywegwa.”<verse eid="NUM 28:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malavyo ya chila mwezi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 28:11" />Mwe chila nkongelo ya chila mwezi, namumlavize Zumbe Chohile lavyo dya kutikimya, wajeku waidi, ndolome imwenga, na wana ngoto mfungate wa mhilimo umwenga, hewana lema. <verse eid="NUM 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 28:12" />Namumlavize malavyo ya nkande ya unga udinyike chilo ntatu, uhanganywe na mavuta kwa chila njeku imwenga, namlavye chilo mbili za unga, kwa chila ndolome, <verse eid="NUM 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 28:13" />na chilo imwenga ya unga kwa chila mwana ngoto. Malavyo yano ye nkande yakulavigwa kwa kutikimya yatende ya mhempe ukumwangila zumbe Chohile. <verse eid="NUM 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 28:14" />Chihimo che dilavyo dyo kunywa chikungigwa ni lita mbili za divai kwa chila njeku, lita imwenga na nusu kwa chila ndolome, na lita imwenga kwa chila mwana ngoto. Dino nidyo idilavyo dyo kutikimya dya chila zuwa dya nkongo dya mwezi mwe mhilimo mjima. <verse eid="NUM 28:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 28:15" />Naho namlavye vulata dimwenga kwa Zumbe kutenda lavyo dya kusa masa, ukaleka diya idilavyo dyo kutikimya dya chila zuwa na lavyo dya kunywegwa.<verse eid="NUM 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lavyo dya Pasaka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 28:16" />Mwe idizuwa dya mlongo na mine dyo mwezi wa nkongo ni Pasaka ya Zumbe Chohile. <verse eid="NUM 28:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 28:17" />Mwe dizuwa dya mlongo na shano yo mwezi uwo ni sikunkulu. Namdye mgate heijeligwe hamila kwa chipindi cha mazuwa mfungate. <verse eid="NUM 28:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 28:18" />Mwe dizuwa dya nkongo dye ngasu namtende na mdugano wa kunivikila. Mwe idizuwa idyo hamdamanye ndima yoyose. <verse eid="NUM 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 28:19" />Namlavye malavyo ya kutikimya, ni malavyo ya nkande kwa Zumbe Chohile, wajeku mbili, ndolome imwenga wana ndolome mfungate wa mhilimo umwenga, wose hewena lema. <verse eid="NUM 28:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 28:20" />Lavya lavyo dikuwagila dya nkande dya unga wedi uhanganywe na mavuta, na chilo ntatu kwa chila njeku na chilo mbili kwa chila ndolome, <verse eid="NUM 28:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 28:21" />chilo imwenga kwa ziya ndolome mfungate. <verse eid="NUM 28:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 28:22" />Naho namlavye vulata dimwenga kutenda lavyo dya kusa masa chani kuwadamanyiza wivano. <verse eid="NUM 28:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 28:23" />Namlavye ivintu vino ukaleka diya idilavyo dya mazwela dya kutikimya dikulavigwa chila zuwa nomtondo. <verse eid="NUM 28:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 28:24" />Ivyo kwa chipindi cha mazuwa mfungate, namlavye chila zuwa lavyo dya nkande dya kutikimya. Naditende dya mhempe ukumwagila Zumbe Chohile. Dino na mdilavye ukaleka diya idilavyo dya kutikimya dya chila zuwa na lavyo dyakwe dya kunywegwa <verse eid="NUM 28:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 28:25" />Mwe idizuwa dya mfungate namdamanye mdugano ukukile, msekudamanya ndima.<verse eid="NUM 28:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lavyo dya ngasu ya ulozo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 28:26" />Mwe dizuwa dya nkongo dye ngasu yo ulozo namwigale ulozo wenyu mhya kwa mkamlaviza Zumbe Chohile ulozo mhya we zinkande zenyu, namdamanye mdugano ukukile, msekudamanya ndima. <verse eid="NUM 28:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 28:27" />Na mlavye malavyo ya kutikimya, yana mhempe ukumwagila Zumbe Chohile, wajeku mbili, ndolome imwenga, na wana ndolome mfungate wa mhilimo umwenga, wose watende hawana lema. <verse eid="NUM 28:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 28:28" />Lavya lavyo dikuwagila dya nkande dya unga wedi uhanganywe na mavuta ya mzeituni lita ntantu na chilo ntatu kwa chila njeku, chilo mbili kwa chila ndolome, <verse eid="NUM 28:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 28:29" />na chilo imwenga kwa chila mwana ngoto. <verse eid="NUM 28:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 28:30" />Namlavye iviya vulata dimwenga kutenda lavyo dya kusa masa chani kuwadamanyiza wantu wivano. <verse eid="NUM 28:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 28:31" />Namlavye ivintu vino na malavyo ya divai na mkaleka diya idilavyo dyo kutikimya dya mazwela hamwenga na lavyo dyakwe dya kunywegwa.<verse eid="NUM 28:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 28" />
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="NUM 29" />
  <para style="s">Lanvyo dya ngasu dya mhilimo mhya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 29:1" />Zuwa dya nkongo dya mwezi wa mfungate, namdamanye mdugano ukukile. Msekudamanya ndima. Mwe idi zuwa idyo na mtowe magunda. <verse eid="NUM 29:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 29:2" />Namlavye lavyo dya kutikimya, dina mhempe wakumuwakila Zumbe Chohile, njeku imwenga na wana ngoto mfungate wa mhilimo umwenga hewena lema. <verse eid="NUM 29:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 29:3" />Namlavye naho lavyo dya nkande za unga wedi uhanganywe na mavuta, chilo ntatu kwa chila njeku, na chilo mbili kwa chila ndolome imwenga, <verse eid="NUM 29:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 29:4" />na chilo imwenga kwa chila mwate. <verse eid="NUM 29:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 29:5" />Naho namlavye vulata dimwenga ditende lavyo dya kusa masa chani kuwadamanyiza wantu wivano. <verse eid="NUM 29:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 29:6" />Namlavye ivintu vino ukaleka lavyo dya kutikimya mwe zuwa dya nkongo dya mwezi mhya na lavyo dya unga, na idyo idi lavyo dya kutikimya dya chila zuwa na lavyo dyakwe dya unga na malavyo yakwe ya kunywegwa yana mhempe wa kumuwagila Zumbe Chohile yalavigwe kwa moto.<verse eid="NUM 29:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malavyo ya zuwa dya kulekeilwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 29:7" />Mwe idizuwa dya mlongo dya mwezi wa mfungate namdamanye mdugano ukukile. Zuwa idyo mongigwa mfunge naho msekudamanya ndima. <verse eid="NUM 29:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 29:8" />Namumlavize Zumbe Chohile lavyo dya kutikimya, ina mhempe wa kumuwagila Zumbe Chohile, njeku imwenga na ndolome mfungate za mhilimo umwenga hezina lema. <verse eid="NUM 29:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 29:9" />Ukaleka ivintu ivyo namlavye lavyo dya unga wedi uhanganye na mavuta chilo ntantu hamwenga na chilo ntatu za unga hamwenga ne injeku iyo, na chilo mbili za unga hamwenga ne indolome, <verse eid="NUM 29:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 29:10" />na chila imwenga kwa chila mwana ngoto. <verse eid="NUM 29:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 29:11" />Namlavye vulata dimwenga kwa lavyo dya kusa masa ukaleka lavyo dya kuwadamanyiza wantu wivano, hamwenga na lavyo dya mazwela dya kutikimya na lavyo dyakwe dya nkande na lavyo dya kunywegwa.<verse eid="NUM 29:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lavyo dya ngasu ya makumbi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 29:12" />“Zuwa dya mlongo na shano wo mwezi wa mfungate, na mdamanye mdugano ukukile. Hamdamanye ndima mwe dizuwa idyo, namvine ngasu kwa Chohile kwa mazuwa Mfungate. <verse eid="NUM 29:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 29:13" />Namlavye malavyo ya kutikimya, yana mhempe wedi ukumuwagila Zumbe Chohile, wajeku mlongo na ntatu, ndolome mbili, wana ngoto mlongo na wane wa mhilimo umwenga. Wose wasekutenda na lema. <verse eid="NUM 29:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 29:14" />Malavyo ayo nayatende hamwenga na unga wedi uhanganywe na mavuta, chilo ntatu kwa chila njeku, chilo mbili kwa chila ngoto, <verse eid="NUM 29:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 29:15" />na chilo imwenga kwa chila mwana ngoto, <verse eid="NUM 29:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 29:16" />iviya namlavye vulata dimwenga ditende malavyo ya kusa masa ukaleka malavyo ya mazwela ya kutikimya, hamwenga na lavyo dyakwe dya nkande na dya kunywegwa.”<verse eid="NUM 29:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 29:17" />“Zuwa dya kaidi namlavye njeku mlongo na mbili, ndolome mbili, na wana ngoto mlongo na nne, wa mhilimo umwenga hewena lema. <verse eid="NUM 29:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 29:18" />Namlavye naho lavyo dya unga na lavyo dya kunywegwa hamwenga ne zinjeku ne zindolome na wana ngoto wa mhilimo umwenga, kuligana no uwazwa wawo saviya vilagizwe. <verse eid="NUM 29:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 29:19" />Naho namlavye vulata dimwenga ditende lavyo dya kusa masa, ukaleka malavyo yakwe ya mazwela ya kutikimya na malavyo yakwe ya unga na lavyo dya kunywegwa.”<verse eid="NUM 29:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 29:20" />“Zuwa dya katatu namlavye njeku mlongo na imwe, na ndolome mbili na wana ngoto mlongo nawane wa mhilimo umwenga, hewena lema. <verse eid="NUM 29:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 29:21" />Namlavize hamwenga malavyo yakwe ya unga na malavyo yakwe ya kunywegwa, kwe izinjeku na kwe izindolome izo na wadya wana ngoto saviya vikuligana no uwazwa wawo saviya lagizo dili. <verse eid="NUM 29:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 29:22" />Iviya namlavye vulata dimwenga ditende lavyo dya kusa masa, kongezeza malavyo yakwe ya mazwela za kutikimya na malavyo yakwe ya unga na lavyo dyakwe dya kunywegwa.”<verse eid="NUM 29:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 29:23" />“Mwe idizuwa dya kane namlavye njeku mlongo na ndolome mbili, wana ngoto milongo na nne hewena lema. <verse eid="NUM 29:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 29:24" />Namlavye lavyo dya unga na malavyo ya kunywegwa, hamwenga na izo izinjeku na ndolome na wana ngoto kuligana na uwazwa wawo saivyo vikungwa. <verse eid="NUM 29:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 29:25" />Iviya namlavye vulata dimwenga ditende lavyo dya kusa masa, kongezeza malavyo yakwe ya mazwela za kutikimya na malavyo yakwe ya unga na lavyo dyakwe dya kunywegwa.”<verse eid="NUM 29:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 29:26" />“Zuwa dya shano namlavye njeku chenda, na ndolome mbili, wana ngoto wa mhilimo umwenga mlongo na wane hewena lema, <verse eid="NUM 29:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 29:27" />hamwenga na malavyo yakwe ya unga na malavyo yakwe yo kunywagwa kwe izo izinjeku na izo indolome na wana ngoto kuligana na uwazwa wawo saviya vikungigwa. <verse eid="NUM 29:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 29:28" />Iviya namlavye vulata dimwenga ditende lavyo dya kusa masa, ukaleka malavyo yakwe ya mazwela za kutikimya na malavyo yakwe ya unga na lavyo dyakwe dya kunywegwa.”<verse eid="NUM 29:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 29:29" />“Mwe idizuwa dya mtandatu namlavye njeku mnane na ndolome mbili, wana ngoto wa mhilimo umwenga mlongo na wane hewena lema, <verse eid="NUM 29:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 29:30" />hamwenga na malavyo yakwe ya unga na malavyo yakwe yo kunywa kwe izo izinjeku na izo indolome na wana ngoto kuligana na uwazwa wawo saviya vikungwa. <verse eid="NUM 29:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 29:31" />Iviya namlavye vulata dimwenga ditende lavyo dya kusa masa, ukaleka malavyo yakwe ya mazwela za kutikimya na malavyo yakwe ya nkande na lavyo dyakwe dya kunywegwa. <verse eid="NUM 29:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 29:32" />Zuwa mfungate namlavye njeku mfungate na ndolome mbili na wana ngoto wa mhilimo umwenga mlongo na wane hewena lema, <verse eid="NUM 29:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 29:33" />Malavyo ya unga na malavyo ya kunywegwa hamwenga ne izinjeku na ndolome, na wana ngoto kuligana na uwazwa wawo saviya vikungwa. <verse eid="NUM 29:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 29:34" />Iviya namlavye vulata dimwenga ditende lavyo dya kusa masa, ukaleka malavyo yakwe ya mazwela na kutikimya na malavyo yakwe ya unga na lavyo dyakwe dya kunywegwa.”<verse eid="NUM 29:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 29:35" />“Mwe idizuwa dya mnanne mdugano mnivikile, msekudamanya ndima idizuwa idyo. <verse eid="NUM 29:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 29:36" />Namlavye malavyo ya kutikimya, yana mhempe wedi ukuniwagila miye Zumbe Chohile, njeku imwenga na ndolome imwenga na wana ngoto mfungate wa mhilimo umwenga wose hewena lema. <verse eid="NUM 29:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 29:37" />Malavyo ya unga na malavyo ya kunywegwa hamwenga ne izinjeku na ndolome, na wana ngoto kuligana na uwazwa wawo saviya vikungwa. <verse eid="NUM 29:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 29:38" />Naho namlavye vulata dimwenga ditende lavyo dya kusa masa, ukaleka malavyo yakwe ya mazwela ya kutikimya na malavyo yakwe ya unga na lavyo dyakwe dya kunywegwa.”<verse eid="NUM 29:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 29:39" />“Yano nayo amalagizo mwe malavyo ya chila nkasu saviya yalagizwe, ukaleka kujala malavyo ya nazili na kutikimya na malavyo ya nkande na malavyo ya kunywegwa na malavyo ya utondowazi na malavyo yenyu ya kunga.”<verse eid="NUM 29:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 29:40" />Ivyo Musa niyo awagambila wana wa Izulaeli saviya vyose asigilwe ni Zumbe Chohile.<verse eid="NUM 29:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 29" />
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="NUM 30" />
  <para style="s">Malagizo ya Kwika nazili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 30:1" />Musa niyo awagambila Waizulaeli mbuli zose alagizwe ni Zumbe, <verse eid="NUM 30:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 30:2" />Mntu anaika nazili kwa Zumbe Chohile hegu kwa kuika lagano kwa cheliso kwa funga mwenye aungwa achintize nazili yakwe aungwa adamanye yose yadya alongile mwenye.<verse eid="NUM 30:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 30:3" />Uneva mndele acheikwikala kwa tati yakwe anaika nazili kwa Zumbe Chohile nakwefunga mwenye kwa cheliso. <verse eid="NUM 30:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 30:4" />Tati yakwe akatenda eva icheliso icho ase kumhiga ivyo inazili iyo ne dilagano dyakwe haditimilane. Ivyo Zumbe Chohile namlekeile kwaviya tati yakwe kadihiga idilagano idyo. <verse eid="NUM 30:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 30:5" />Mna tati yakwe aneva inazili iyo na icheliso icho, niyo amhiga, ivyo nazili zakwe navyeliso vyakwe havimfunge kwaviya Zumbe Chohile namlekeile kwaviya tati ywakwe kaihiga imbuli iyo.<verse eid="NUM 30:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 30:6" />Uneva mndele anasolwa akaheza kwika inazili, hegu kwika lagano hefanyanye vyedi, uyo kefunga mwenye, <verse eid="NUM 30:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 30:7" />Vikaheza mgosiwe aneva imbuli iyo ase kumhiga, ivyo izinazili zakwe na malagano yakwe nazitimilane na malagano yakwe. <verse eid="NUM 30:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 30:8" />Mna uneva mgosiweaneva imbuli iyo na kumhiga, ivyo uyo mgosiwe nahitwile inazili ya mkaziwe na lagano dyakwe aikiye hefanyanye, naye Zumbe Chohile namlekeile.<verse eid="NUM 30:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 30:9" />Mna nazili hegu lagano dyodyose aikiye mvyele abanikilwe ni mgosi hegu mvyele inkigwe talaka kwa iyo kefunga mwenye.<verse eid="NUM 30:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 30:10" />Mvyele asoligwe anaika nazili hegu lagano kwa kwelisa akatenda kwa mgosiwe, <verse eid="NUM 30:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 30:11" />akaheza mgsiwe aneva imbuli iyo mna ase kumhiga, hegu kumgaambila chintu, ivyo, inazili zakwe zose na zimfunge mwenye. <verse eid="NUM 30:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 30:12" />Mna uneva mgosiwe aneva izimbuli zakwe, nakuzusa na kuzihitwila, ivyo, hata hegu nakaunga achintiza, mgosiwe natende kaziusa na Zumbe Chohile na mlekeile. <verse eid="NUM 30:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 30:13" />Mgosiwe adaha kulavyanya hegu kusa izinazili hegu malagano zozose zikumfunga. <verse eid="NUM 30:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 30:14" />Mna uneva mgosiwe hanalongile mbuli yoyose kukongela mwe idizuwa nevile imbuli ye nazili na lagano dya mkaziwe, ivyo, natende kazizumila mwe idizuwa idyo eze eve izimbuli zakwe kwaviya halongile dyodyose. <verse eid="NUM 30:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 30:15" />Mna ana zihitwila na kuzusa kwa chipindi chisiku eze eve izimbuli zakwe, ivyo, uyo natende na wihi kwa masa ya mkaziwe.<verse eid="NUM 30:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 30:16" />Yano nayo amalagizo mwe kwika nazili na malagano yadya Zumbe amlagize Musa mwe mgosi na mkaziwe na tati ya mntu na mwanawe wa chiche mo undele wakwe akatenda achei kwa tati yakwe.<verse eid="NUM 30:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 30" />
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="NUM 31" />
  <para style="s">Waizulzeli waliha chikoda kwa Wamidiani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 31:1" />Niyo Zumbe alonga na Musa, akamgamba, <verse eid="NUM 31:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 31:2" />“Walihize chikoda wa Wamidiani mwe mbuli wawadamanyize Waizulaeli, ukaheza weye naubanike.”<verse eid="NUM 31:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 31:3" />Ivyo, Musa niyo alonga na awantu akawagamba, “Mwike wa nkondo waite wakawebunge Wamidiani kwa kuwalihiza chikoda kwaviya wawadamanyize Waizulaeli mwa Chohile. <verse eid="NUM 31:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 31:4" />Kulaila kwa chila kabila dya Waizulaeli, namwigale wantu magana gana dimwenga kwe nkondo.”<verse eid="NUM 31:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 31:5" />Ivyo, wantu mlongo umwenga gana wegalagwa kulailamwe chilakabila mgati mwa elufu ya Waizulaeli, umwenga wawo wendaga milongo midi nambili gana wana viziha. <verse eid="NUM 31:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 31:6" />Musa awegalaga kwe nkondo mo ulongozi wa Finehasi, mwana ywa Eleazali mlavyantambiko. Akatenda na viya vya hantu hakukile na magunda ya kulaviza vilagiso. <verse eid="NUM 31:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 31:7" />Wawebungaga wantu wa Midiani, saviya Zumbe Chohile amlagize Musa, niyo wawakoma awagosi wose. <verse eid="NUM 31:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 31:8" />Mgati mwa awantu awo wakomigwe, kwendaga na maseuta washano wa Midiani, Evi na Lekemu na Suli na Huli na Leba. Naho wawakomaga Balamu mwana ywa Beoli.<verse eid="NUM 31:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 31:9" />Waizulaeli watahaga, ng'ombe na ngoto na ugoli wawo wose. <verse eid="NUM 31:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 31:10" />Mizi yawo yose, wikazi wawo na nkambi zawo zose wazibalanga kwa moto. <verse eid="NUM 31:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 31:11" />Waguhaga vintu vyose na watahwa wose, wantu na wanyama, <verse eid="NUM 31:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 31:12" />Wamwigaila Musa na Eleazali, nezikaya zose za Waizulaeli wendaga kwenkambi mwe isi ye dibwandasi ya Moabu, mwe ng'ambo yo mto wa Yolodani hajihi na Yeliko.<verse eid="NUM 31:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuya kulaila kwe nkondo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 31:13" />Musa, na mlavyantambiko Eleazali, na vilongozi wose wa na mabunga ya Waizulaeli walawa kwe nkambi, niyo waita kuwasingila wankondo. <verse eid="NUM 31:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 31:14" />Musa ehizagwa ni awo wakulu wa wankondo, na masekulu wachimaile kwa mabunga ya wankondo magana na mabunga ya vilongozi we nkondo magana mlongo wawiye kulaila kwe nkondo. <verse eid="NUM 31:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 31:15" />Musa niyo awauuza, “Nimbwani hamuwakomile awavyele wano?” <verse eid="NUM 31:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 31:16" />“Mkumbuke kugamba wavyele nawo watimile lagiso dya Balaamu, vyaleka wawahosa Waizulaeli wamleke Zumbe Chohile kudya Peoli na manyonje yehiye niyo yawabwila wantu wakwe Chohile. <verse eid="NUM 31:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 31:17" />Ivyo haluse wakomeni, wana wose wa chilume na chila mvyele ajendile na mgosi. <verse eid="NUM 31:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 31:18" />Mna msekuwakoma wandele wose wadya hewenati kujenda na wagosi, walekeni wekale kwachausa chenyu wenye. <verse eid="NUM 31:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 31:19" />Wadya wose na wemgati mwenyu wadya wakomile mntu hegu kukufya wabanike wekale mwe nkambi kwa chipindi cha mazuwa mfungate, wekukize hamwenga na watahigwe wenyu mwe zuwa dya katatu na dya mfungate. <verse eid="NUM 31:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 31:20" />Mkukize chila suche na chila chintu chidamanywe kwa mkota, na kwa mazoya ya ngoto na viya vidamanywe kwa mti.”<verse eid="NUM 31:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 31:21" />Mlavyantambiko Eleazali niyo awagambila wagosi wawiye kwe nkondo, “Dino nidyo idilagizo dya Zumbe Chohile amwinkile Musa. <verse eid="NUM 31:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 31:22" />Zahabu, chumbu, na mayuwe ya shaba, na mayuwe ya chuma na mayuwe ya bati na mayuwe ya lisasi, <verse eid="NUM 31:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 31:23" />ivyo chila chintu hechikuhya, saviya zahabu, mayuwe ya chumbu, mayuwe ya chuma na mayuwe ya bati na mayuwe ya shaba na mayuwe ya lisasi. Naho, navilujulwe kwa moto. Chintu chituhu chochose nachi kukizwe kwa mazi. <verse eid="NUM 31:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 31:24" />Zuwa dya mfungate mfule izisuche zenyu namtende mkuka na kudaha kwingila kwe nkambi.”<verse eid="NUM 31:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Usangilo wa vintu na wantu wawatahigwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 31:25" />Zumbe Chohile niyo alonga na Musa, akamgamba, <verse eid="NUM 31:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 31:26" />“Weye na mlavyantambiko Eleazali, hamwenga na vilongozi we zinkolo za awantu wa Waizulaeli, damanyani uwazwa wa vintu na awantu no ludimo mtahile. <verse eid="NUM 31:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 31:27" />Sangilani vitu mtahile mwe mafungu maidi, fungu dimwenga dya wankondo wetile kwe nkondo na fungu tuhu kwachausa cha wantu wose. <verse eid="NUM 31:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 31:28" />Vikaheza kulaila mwe difungu dya wankondo waitile kwe nkondo, lavya fungu dimwenga dya maliho mwe chila vintu magana mashano vikatenda ni wantu hegu ng'ombe hegu mpunda, hegu ndolome hegu mbuzi, <verse eid="NUM 31:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 31:29" />umwinke ivintu ivyo mlavyantambiko Eleazali vitende jeleko kwa Zumbe Chohile. <verse eid="NUM 31:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 31:30" />Kulaila mwe nusu ya idya ya awantu Waizulaeli, guha chintu chimwenga kulaila mwe chila vintu milongo mishano, ulavye fungu dimwenga, vitende ni wantu hegu ng'ombe hegu mpunda hegu ndolome hegu mbuzi. Ivyo nauwenke Walawi wadya wata kusankanila kwe Idihema Dikukile dya Zumbe Chohile.” <verse eid="NUM 31:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 31:31" />Musa na mlavyantambiko Eleazali wadamanya saviya Zumbe Chohile amlagize Musa.<verse eid="NUM 31:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 31:32" />Vintu visigale viya vyatahagwa na wankondo vyendaga, ngoto magana mtandatu mlongo na milongo mfungate na shano elfu. <verse eid="NUM 31:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 31:33" />Ng'ombe magana mfungate na mbili elfu, <verse eid="NUM 31:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 31:34" />Mpunda magana gana mtandatu na imwenga. <verse eid="NUM 31:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 31:35" />Na wandele wadya nahewenati kujenda na mntu milongo mitatu na midi. <verse eid="NUM 31:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 31:36" />Nusu ya viya vitahigwe wenkagwa awankondo waitile kwe nkondo vyendaga ngoto na mbuzi magana gana milongo mitatu na magana milongo mitatu na milongo mfungate na shano. <verse eid="NUM 31:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 31:37" />Maliho ya ngoto na mbuzi kwa Zumbe Chohile zendaga magana mtandatu milongo mfungate na mtandatu. <verse eid="NUM 31:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 31:38" />Mwe zing'ombe gana magana matandatu zilavigwe kwa Zumbe Chohile ni ng'ombe milongo mfungate na mbili. <verse eid="NUM 31:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 31:39" />Mwe mpunda magana milongo mitatu na mashano, zilavigwe kwa Zumbe Chohile yendaga milongo mtandatu na imwenga, wandele hewajendaga na mgosi wendaga magana gana na magana mtandatu na wandekle milongo mitatu na waidi wendaga maaliho kwa Zumbe. <verse eid="NUM 31:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 31:40" />Wantu nawendile wantu milongo mtandatu, mwe awo hantu ha Chohile wendaga wantu milongo mitatu na midi. <verse eid="NUM 31:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 31:41" />Ivyo, Musa amwinka mlavyantambiko Eleazali maliho ayo yendaga malavyo kwa Zumbe saviya Chohile amlagize. <verse eid="NUM 31:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 31:42" />Naho mwe iyo inusu yendaga iligana na ya wana wa Izulaeli, idya Musa asentaga kwa wantu wetile kwe nkondo, <verse eid="NUM 31:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="NUM 31:43" />idya inusu mwa awantu yendaga ngoto na mbuzi magana gana matatu na magana milongo mitatu na milongo mishano, <verse eid="NUM 31:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="NUM 31:44" />hamwenga na ngo'mbe magana gana matatu na magana mtandatu, <verse eid="NUM 31:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NUM 31:45" />hamwenga na mpunda magana gana magana matatu na magana mashano, <verse eid="NUM 31:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="NUM 31:46" />wandele hewenati kugona na mgosi magana gana milongo mtandatu. <verse eid="NUM 31:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="NUM 31:47" />Vikaheza kulaila mwe difungu wenkigwe Waizulaeli, Musa aguhaga imwenga mwe chila wantu na imwenga mwe chila wanyama milongo mishano, saviya Zumbe Chohile amlagize, niyo awenka Walawi wadya wasankane kwe Idihema Dikukile dya Chohile. <verse eid="NUM 31:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="NUM 31:48" />Vikaheza wakulu wose wa wagomba nkondo wendaga wachimaila wa mabunga ya magana gana ya awo wagomba nkondo na masekulu wa magana gana maga niyo wambasa Musa, <verse eid="NUM 31:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="NUM 31:49" />wamgamba, “Suwe wandima wako chiwawaza awankondo wose wadya we hasi hetu na chiwona kugamba hahana hata yumwenga ywawo hewiye kulaila kwe nkondo. <verse eid="NUM 31:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="NUM 31:50" />Ivyo suwe chigala malavyo kwa Zumbe, apatile chila mntu ya viya vya zahabu, usalu wa mwesingo na mbuji na bangili, na mpete, vinchofu madanga ya mweviga chani chividamanyize wivano kwa Zumbe Chohile kwa kumtogola mwo wikazi wetu.” <verse eid="NUM 31:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="NUM 31:51" />Musa na mlavyantambiko Eleazali wahokelaga zahabu zendaga mwe ivintu ivyo. <verse eid="NUM 31:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="NUM 31:52" />Mligano we zahabu yose ya amalavyo ye zahabu yo kwinula kwa Zumbe Chohile wamlavize yendaga ihajihi na chilo magana maidi. <verse eid="NUM 31:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="NUM 31:53" />Chila mgomba nkondo aguhaga viya ivintu atahile mwenye. <verse eid="NUM 31:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="NUM 31:54" />Ivyo, Musa na mlavyantambiko Eleazali niyo wahokela izahabu iyo kulaila kwa amasekulu wa wagomba nkondo na kuigala kundani mwe Idihema Dikukile, itende lukumbusa lwa Waizulaeli kwa Zumbe Chohile kwa kuwadahiza.<verse eid="NUM 31:54" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 31" />
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="NUM 32" />
  <para style="s">Makabila ya ulailo wa zuwa wo mto wa Yolodani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 32:1" />Makabila ya Lubeni na Gadi yendaga na ludimo lulozese. Ivyo, weze wawone mwe isi ya Yazeli, na isi ya Giliadi ni hantu hedi hakuwagila kwa ludimo, <verse eid="NUM 32:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 32:2" />niyo wambasa Musa, na Eliazali mlavyantambiko na vilongozi wose niyo wawagamba, <verse eid="NUM 32:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 32:3" />“Mizi ya Atalosi na Diboni na Yazeli na Nimla na Heshiboni na Eleale na Sebamu na Nebo na Beoni, <verse eid="NUM 32:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 32:4" />isi idya Zumbe ahudile kwachausa cha wantu wose wa Izulaeli. Isi iyo ni ntana kwa ludimo, suwe china ludimo lutendese. <verse eid="NUM 32:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 32:5" />Ivyo uneva kuchizumila chaunga uchinke isi ino itende ulisi wetu we sanga, msekuchigala ntendele ya kaidi yo mto wa Yolidani chikale uko.”<verse eid="NUM 32:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 32:6" />Musa awahitula awantu wa amakabila ya Gadi na Lubeni, “Togolani mwaunga msigale hano kuno walukolo wenyu waita kwe nkondo?” <verse eid="NUM 32:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 32:7" />Ni mbwani mkuwajela chevu Waizulaeli wasekwita mwe isi idya Zumbe awenkile? <verse eid="NUM 32:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 32:8" />Ivyo nivyo wadamanye wadalahala wenyu hadya nawasigilaga kulaila Kadeshi balinea kuipelemba isi. <verse eid="NUM 32:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 32:9" />Wapelembi awo waitaga kubula mwe dikolongo dya Eshikoli, niyo waiwona isi, mna weze wauye, wawajela chevu Waizulaeli chani wasekwingila mwe isi iyo wenkigwe ni zumbe. <verse eid="NUM 32:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 32:10" />Ivyo, Zumbe niyo emukwa ni maya mwe zuwa idyo, niyo elisa akagamba, <verse eid="NUM 32:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 32:11" />Kwaviya hamnitegeleze chindedi hahana hata mntu mgati mwa wantu walaile Misili mta lika dya mihilimo milongo midi na kujendeleza, akunga aiwone isi nelisize naniwenke, Bulahimu na Isaka na Yakobo. <verse eid="NUM 32:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 32:12" />Wose hawengile mwe iyo isi, ukaleka Kalebu mwana ywa Yefune wolukolo lwa Wakenizi, na Yoshuwa mwana ywa Nuni, kwaviya awo wanizumila kwa moyo wose. <verse eid="NUM 32:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 32:13" />Zumbe niyo emukwa ni maya mwa Waizulaeli, niyo awatenda watumbwazike mwe dijangwa kwa chipindi cha mihilimo milongo mine, kubula lweleko lose ludamanye yehiye hameso yakwe lubanika. <verse eid="NUM 32:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 32:14" />Kaula nyuwe lweleko lwa wata masa, mchimala kwa hantu ha wadalahala wenyu, mongezeza naho amaya ya Zumbe mwa wantu wa Izulaeli. <verse eid="NUM 32:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 32:15" />Uneva nyuwe mnalemela kumtimila, uyo nawaseni naho kwe dijangwa, nyuwe namhose awantu wano wose wakomwe.<verse eid="NUM 32:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 32:16" />Wantu wa kabila dya Gadi na Lubeni niyo wamsogeila Musa, niyo wamgamba, “Haluse chilekeile chizengele izingoto zetu madewa, na kuwazengela mizi ina ngome wanetu. <verse eid="NUM 32:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 32:17" />Mna suwe wenye nachitende chemalanya kwita kwenkondo na walukolo wetu naho na chiwalongoile Waizulaeli, kubula hadya na chiwabuze ahantu hawo, na wanetu nawekale mwe imizi ina madewa, chani kwedima na wenye isi. <verse eid="NUM 32:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 32:18" />Suwe hachuye kwe zi kaya zetu, kubula Waizulaeli nawatende walisi chila mntu ulisi wakwe wa sanga. <verse eid="NUM 32:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 32:19" />Mna hachiguhe chintu chochose ntendele ya kaidi yo mto wa Yolidani, kwaviya ulisi wetu chipata mwe intendele ya ulailo wa zuwa wo mto Yolodani.”<verse eid="NUM 32:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 32:20" />Ivyo, Musa niyo awagamba, “Hegu chindedi namdamanye seivyo mlongile, ahano ha Zumbe Chohile, kwemalanyeni mhinge kwenkondo. <verse eid="NUM 32:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 32:21" />Chila mgomba nkondo ywenyu nomboke umto wa Yolodani mkatenda mwalongozwa ni Zumbe Chohile namuwebunge awankondo wetu kubula Zumbe Chohile awahude, <verse eid="NUM 32:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 32:22" />na kutaha isi. Mnadamanya ivyo namuye kwenyu kaya, kwaviya ndima yenyu kwa Zumbe na kwa walukolo wenyu Waizulaeli namtende muibinda kale. Vikaheza Zumbe Chohile nazumile ino isi ulailo wa zuwa ya Yolidani itende yenyu. <verse eid="NUM 32:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 32:23" />Mna nawafundani kugamba uneva mnadunduga kuchintiza imbuli ino na mtende mkolamasa kulongozi kwa Zumbe, naho mmanye kugamba masa yenyu chindedi nayamanyike. <verse eid="NUM 32:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 32:24" />Wazengeleni mizi wavyele wenyu na wanenyu na madewa kwa chausa cho ludimo lwenyu, mna damanyani saviya mlagane.”<verse eid="NUM 32:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 32:25" />Vikaheza wantu wa Gadi na wa Lubeni niyo wamgamba Musa, “Suwe wandima wako nachidamanye saviya uchigambile. <verse eid="NUM 32:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 32:26" />Wavyele wetu na wanetu nawasigaile ahano ludimo lwetu nazisigale ahano he mizi ya Gileadi. <verse eid="NUM 32:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 32:27" />Mna suwe wandima wako chichinta kwita kwenkondo mwe ulongozi wa Zumbe. Nachomboke umto wa Yolidani na kutowana, saviya ulongile.”<verse eid="NUM 32:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 32:28" />Ivyo Musa alavya malagizo kwa Eliazali mlavyantambiko na Yoshuwa mwana ywa Nuni na kwa vilongozi wa wantu wa amakabila ya wana wa Izulaeli. <verse eid="NUM 32:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 32:29" />“Uneva wantu wa Gadi na wantu wa Lubeni nawomboke umto wa Yolidani hamwenga na nyuwe wakatenda wemalanya kwa nkondo mwe ulongozi wa Zumbe Chohile, mnahuda na kuiguha iyo isi, ivyo namuwenke isi ya Gileadi itende ugoli wawo. <verse eid="NUM 32:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 32:30" />Mna hegu hawomboke umto wa Yolidani hamwenga na nyuwe wakatenda wemalanya kwa nkondo, ivyo nawaguhe hantu he isi ya Kanani intendele ya uswelo wa zuwa hamwenga na nyuwe.”<verse eid="NUM 32:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 32:31" />Wantu wa Gadi na wantu wa Lubeni niyo wamgamba, “Sekulu suwe nachidamanye saviya Zumbe achigambile suwe wandima wako. <verse eid="NUM 32:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 32:32" />Chikalongozwa ni Zumbe nachomboke chikagombe nkondo kubula kweisi ya Kanani, mna ulisi wetu we sanga nautende ntendele ino ya ulailo wa zuwa yo mto wa Yolodani.”<verse eid="NUM 32:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 32:33" />Ivyo, Musa awenka awo wantu wa amakabila ya Gadi na Lubeni ne inusu ye idikabila dya Manase mwana ywa Yusufu, isi yose ya seuta Sihoni ywa Waamoli ne isi ya seuta Ogi ywa Bashani hamwenga ne mizi immpezo mwe iyo imizi. <verse eid="NUM 32:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 32:34" />Wantu wedikabila dya Gadi niyo waizenga naho imizi ya Diboni na Atalisi na Aloeli, <verse eid="NUM 32:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 32:35" />na Atolisi Shofani na Yazeli na Yogibeha, <verse eid="NUM 32:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 32:36" />na Beti Nimla na Beti Halani. Mizi iyo yendaga na ngome na madewa ya ludimo. <verse eid="NUM 32:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 32:37" />Wantu we idikabila dya Lubeni nawazenga naho imizi ya Heshiboni na Eleale na Kiliataimu, <verse eid="NUM 32:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 32:38" />na Nebo na Bali Meoni na Sibuma. Mizi wazengile uhya niyo wahituila amazina yawo.<verse eid="NUM 32:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 32:39" />Welekwa wa Makili mwana ywa Manase nawayebunga isi ya Gileadi, niyo waitaha na kuwabalaza Waamoli wendaga wakekala umo. <verse eid="NUM 32:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 32:40" />Ivyo, Musa niyo awenka wantu wolukolo lwa Makili mwana ywa Manase isi ya Giliadi wekala umo. <verse eid="NUM 32:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 32:41" />Lukolo lwa Yaili mwana ywa Manase wavyebungaga vijiji visiku vya Giliyadi niyo avitaha na kuvinka zina dya Howati Yaili. Kugamba vijiji vya Yaili. <verse eid="NUM 32:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 32:42" />Vikaheza lukolo lwa Noba niyo waita wakuyebunga na kuitaha Kenati ne vijiji vyakwe niyo awitanga Nobo, saviya idizina dyawo dili.<verse eid="NUM 32:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 32" />
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="NUM 33" />
  <para style="s">Ntambo ya Waizulaeli kulaila Misili kubula Moabu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 33:1" />Zino ni ntulwe Waizulaeli wekiye nkambi weze walawe kwe isi ya Misili wakatenda mwe mabunga ya makabila yawo wakalongozwa ni Musa na Haluni. <verse eid="NUM 33:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 33:2" />Musa niyo awandika ivyo walaile mwe izintulwe zawo, ntulwe kubula ntulwe ntuhu, kwa lagizo dya Zumbe, zino nizo izintambo zawo na ukofosa kwawo ivyo kwendaga. <verse eid="NUM 33:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 33:3" />Waizulaeli wahalawa homzi wa Lamesesi chipindi cha zuwa mlongo na shano dyo mwezi wa nkongo, zuwa dimwenga Pasaka ize iheze. Wahalawa kwa udahi mkulu ha meso ya Wamisili wose wakawasinya. <verse eid="NUM 33:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 33:4" />Wamisili awo wendaga wakawahamba welekwa wawo wa nkongo we chilume wakomigwe ni Zumbe Chohile, kwaviya Zumbe nendile kaikantila imilungu yawo. <verse eid="NUM 33:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 33:5" />Ivyo Waizulaeli niyo wahalawa Lamesesi, waika ntulwe yawo uko Sukoti. <verse eid="NUM 33:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 33:6" />Kulaila sukoti, nawaika ntulwe yawo uko Etamu, mouhelo we dijangwa. <verse eid="NUM 33:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 33:7" />Kulaila Etamu, wahituka na kuya kubula Piha Hiloti, ulailo wa dizuwa wa Baali Sefoni, niyo waika ntulwe yawo hajihi na Migidili <verse eid="NUM 33:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 33:8" />wahalawa Piha Hiloti, wajinka mwe bahali ya Shamu kubula mwe dijangwa dya Etamu, watamba mwe dijangwa ntambo ya mazuwa matatu, niyo waika ntulwe Mala. <verse eid="NUM 33:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 33:9" />Kulaila Mala watamba kubula Elimu, uko Elimu kwendaga na sokwe milongo midi za mazi na mitende milongo mfungate, niyo waika ntule ahantu aho. <verse eid="NUM 33:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 33:10" />Watamba kulaila Elimu, niyo waika ntule yawo mmpezo mwe Bahali ya Shamu. <verse eid="NUM 33:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 33:11" />Kulaila Bahali ya Shamu waika ntulwe yawo mwe dijangwa dya Sini.<verse eid="NUM 33:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 33:12" />Kulaila mwe dijagwa dya Sini, waika ntulwe yawo Dofika. <verse eid="NUM 33:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 33:13" />Kulaila Dofika waika ntulwe yawo uko Alushi. <verse eid="NUM 33:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 33:14" />Kulaila Alushi waika ntule yawo uko Lefidimu, aho hendaga hahana mazi ya kunywa wantu. <verse eid="NUM 33:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 33:15" />Wahalawa Lefidimu waika ntulwe yawo mwe dijangwa dya Sinai. <verse eid="NUM 33:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 33:16" />Kulaila Sinai waika ntulwe yawo uko Kibuloti Hatava. <verse eid="NUM 33:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 33:17" />Kulaila Kibuloti Hatava, waika ntulwe yawo uko Haseloti. <verse eid="NUM 33:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 33:18" />Kulaila Haseloti, waika ntulwe yawo uko Latima. <verse eid="NUM 33:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 33:19" />Kulaila Latima, waika ntulwe yawo uko Limoni Pelezi. <verse eid="NUM 33:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 33:20" />Kulaila Limoni Pelezi, waika ntulwe yawo uko Libina. <verse eid="NUM 33:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 33:21" />Kulaila Libina waika ntulwe yawo Lisa. <verse eid="NUM 33:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 33:22" />Wahalawa Lisa, waika ntulwe yawo uko Kehelata. <verse eid="NUM 33:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 33:23" />Kulaila Kehelata, waika ntulwe yawo molugulu lwa Shefeli. <verse eid="NUM 33:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 33:24" />Kulaila molugulu lwa Shefeli waika ntulwe yawo Halada. <verse eid="NUM 33:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 33:25" />Kulaila Halada waika ntulwe yawo uko Makeloti. <verse eid="NUM 33:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 33:26" />Kulaila Makeloti, waika ntulwe yawo uko Tahati. <verse eid="NUM 33:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 33:27" />Kulaila Tahati waika ntulwe yawo uko Tela. <verse eid="NUM 33:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 33:28" />Kulaila Tela waika ntulwe yawo uko Mitika. <verse eid="NUM 33:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 33:29" />Kulaila Mitika waika ntulwe yawo uko Hashimona. <verse eid="NUM 33:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 33:30" />Kulaila Hashimona waika ntulwe yawo uko Moseloti. <verse eid="NUM 33:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 33:31" />Kulaila Moseloti, waika ntulwe yawo uko Bene Yakani. <verse eid="NUM 33:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 33:32" />Kulaila Bene Yakani waika ntulwe yawo Holi Hagidigadi. <verse eid="NUM 33:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 33:33" />Kulaila Holi Hagidigadi, waika ntulwe yawo Yoti Bata. <verse eid="NUM 33:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 33:34" />Kulaila Yoti Bata, waika ntulwe yawo Abilona. <verse eid="NUM 33:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 33:35" />Kulaila Abilona, waika ntulwe yawo Esioni Gebeli. <verse eid="NUM 33:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 33:36" />Wahalawa Esioni Gebeli, watamba na kwika ntulwe yawo mwe dijangwa dya Sini, kugamba Kadeshi. <verse eid="NUM 33:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 33:37" />Kulaila Kadeshi, waika ntulwe yawo molugulu lwa Holi, momhaka we isi ya Edomu.<verse eid="NUM 33:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 33:38" />Kwa lagizo dya Zumbe, Haluni mlavyantambiko akwelaga kulanga kolugulu lwa Holi, uko niyo abanika mwe dizuwa dya nkongo dyo mwezi wa shano, mhilimo wa milongo mine chipindi Waizulaeli walaile kweisi ya Misili. <verse eid="NUM 33:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 33:39" />Haluni endaga na lika dya mihilimo gana dimwenga na milongo midi na mitatu umo akabanika kolugulu lwa Holi. <verse eid="NUM 33:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 33:40" />Seuta ywa Aladi, endaga Mkanani, ekale ntendele ya kwamwenyemzi mwe isi ya Kanani keva mbuli kugamba waizulaeli nendile wakeza. <verse eid="NUM 33:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 33:41" />Kulaila kolugulu lwa Holi, Waizulaeli waika ntulwe yawo Salimona. <verse eid="NUM 33:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 33:42" />Kulaila Salimona, waika ntulwe yawo Punoni. <verse eid="NUM 33:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="NUM 33:43" />Kulaila Punoni, waika ntulwe yawo Obati. <verse eid="NUM 33:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="NUM 33:44" />Kulaila Oboti, waika nkambi yawo Liye Abalimu, hantu ha Moabu. <verse eid="NUM 33:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NUM 33:45" />Kulaila Liye Abalimu, Waika ntulwe yawo Diboni Gadi. <verse eid="NUM 33:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="NUM 33:46" />Kulaila Diboni Gadi, watamba na kwika ntulwe yawo Alimoni Dibulataimu. <verse eid="NUM 33:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="NUM 33:47" />Kulaila Alimoni Dibulataimu, watamba na kwika ntulwe yawo mwa amagulu ya Abalimu, lukusinyana nolugulu lwa Nebo. <verse eid="NUM 33:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="NUM 33:48" />Kulaila kwa amagulu ya Abalimu, watamba na kwika ntulwe yawo mwe hantu hebwandasi dya Moabu ntendele yomto wa Yolidani hajihi na Yeliko. <verse eid="NUM 33:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="NUM 33:49" />Waika ntulwe iyo hajihi nomto wa Yolidani mgati mwa Beti Yeshimoti na mwedikolongo dya Abeli Shitimu mwedibwandasi dya Moabu.<verse eid="NUM 33:49" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malagizo hewenati kwingila Kanani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="NUM 33:50" />Mwedibwandasi dya Moabu, Zumbe niyo alonga na Musa mwe isi yedibwandasi dya Moabu hajihi nomto wa Yolidani uko Yeliko, amgamba, <verse eid="NUM 33:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="NUM 33:51" />“Wagambile Waizulaeli kugamba aho namombokele mo mto Yolidani na kwingila mwe isi ya Kanani, <verse eid="NUM 33:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="NUM 33:52" />wabalazeni wakaya wose we isi iyo ha meso yenu. Nambalange amatukuyu yasongolwe ya miti na matukukulu yawo yasanigwe na kuhabalanga chila hantu hawo wakuvikila. <verse eid="NUM 33:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="NUM 33:53" />Namuiguhe isi iyo nakwikala umo kwaviya siwenkeni itende yenyu. <verse eid="NUM 33:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="NUM 33:54" />Namlisi iyo isi kwa tegatega saviya nkolo zenyu zili, awo walozize namuwenke hantu hakulu awo wajeche nowenke kuligana no kuhunguka kwawo, hantu hohose tegatega dinagwela mntu yoyose hantu aho ni hakwe, namlisi kutimilana amakabila ya wababa zenyu. <verse eid="NUM 33:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="NUM 33:55" />Uneva hamkunga kuwabalaza wakaya we isi wamlawe kulongozi kwenyu awo namuwasigaze nawatende saviya mabasi mwa ameso yenyu na saviya miwa mwezimbavu zenyu, awo nawawatumbwadiseni mwe isi iyo mkwikala. <verse eid="NUM 33:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="NUM 33:56" />Hamna wabalaze naniwabalangeni saviya naungile kuwabalanga wowo.”<verse eid="NUM 33:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 33" />
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="NUM 34" />
  <para style="s">Mihaka ye isi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 34:1" />Chohile niyo amgamba Musa, <verse eid="NUM 34:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 34:2" />Wasigile wana Waizulaeli ukagamba, aho namwingile mwe isi ya Kanani, isi idya niwenkile itende ulisi wenyu, imihaka ye isi yenyu naitende savino, <verse eid="NUM 34:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 34:3" />umhaka wa kwamwenyemzi naulaile mwe dijangwa dya Sini mmpezo mo mhaka wa Edomu, na umhaka wenyu wa kwa mwenye mzi naukongele udumo we bahali yo munyu kuhinga ulailo wa zuwa. <verse eid="NUM 34:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 34:4" />Vikaheza nauhinge kwamwenyemzi kukwela Akilabimu, vikaheza kujinkila kujendeleza kwita Sini, na ulailo wakwe na utende ntendele ya kwa mwenye mzi ya Kadeshi Benea, vikaheza na ujendeleze kubula Akilabimu na kujinkila Sini kubula Kadeshi Balineya, vikaheza na ujendeleze kubula Hasali adali, kubula Azimoni, <verse eid="NUM 34:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 34:5" />vikaheza umhaka nauhitukile kulaila Azimoni kujendeleza kwa kamto ka Misili, na ulailo wakwe na utende aho hebahali ya Meditelaniya.<verse eid="NUM 34:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 34:6" />Mhaka wenyu wa ntendele ya uhelo we dizuwa nautende ibahali ya Meditelaniya.<verse eid="NUM 34:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 34:7" />Mhaka wenyu we ntendela ya kwa mwenye mzi nautende nuno, kulaila kwe bahali ya Meditelenia, mhaka nautende kuhinga ko lugulu lwa Holi, <verse eid="NUM 34:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 34:8" />kulaila kolugulu lwa Holi namwike kilagiso kubula kwingila Hamati, na kujendeleza kubula Sedadi, <verse eid="NUM 34:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 34:9" />na ujendeleze kubula Hazali Enani, uwo nuwo nautende umhaka wenyu wa ntendele ya chenya.<verse eid="NUM 34:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 34:10" />“Mhaka wenyu we ntendele ya ulailo wa zuwa nauchuluke kulaila Hazali Enani kubula Shefamu. <verse eid="NUM 34:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 34:11" />Kulaila Shefamu naujendeleze kwa mwenyemzi kubula Liba, ko ulailo wedizuwa wa Aini, vikaheza umhaka uwo naujendeleze ulailo we dizuwa wa bahali yo munyu, <verse eid="NUM 34:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 34:12" />vikaheza nauseleze kutimila mto Yolodani kubula mwe Bahali yo Munyu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NUM 34:12">“Ino niyo isi yenyu ne mihaka yakwe yose.”<verse eid="NUM 34:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 34:13" />Ivyo Musa niyo awagamba Waizulaeli, “Ino niyo isi mkunga mguhe kwa kutowa tegatega, isi iyo Zumbe alagize kuwenka makabila chenda na nusu. <verse eid="NUM 34:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 34:14" />Kwaviya idikabila dya Lubeni na dya Gadi, ne nusu ye kabila dya Manase wenkwa kale ulisi wawo kuligana ne izinkolo zawo, <verse eid="NUM 34:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 34:15" />wenkigwa ulisi wawo mwe ntendele ya ulailo wa zuwa kuhinga Yeliko, wombokelo wo mto wa Yolodani ntendele yo ulailo we dizuwa, wa Yeliko.”<verse eid="NUM 34:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vilongozi nawachimaile usangilo we weisi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 34:16" />Zumbe niyo amgamba Musa, <verse eid="NUM 34:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 34:17" />“Eliazali mlavyantambiko na Yoshuwa mwana ywa Nuni awo nawasangile wantu isi kutenda yawo. <verse eid="NUM 34:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 34:18" />Namguhe chilongozi yumwenga kulaila chila kabila kuwambiza mo kusanga isi.” <verse eid="NUM 34:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 34:19" />Yano nayo amazina yawo, kabila dya Yuda, ni Kalebu mwana ywa Yefune.<verse eid="NUM 34:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 34:20" />Kulaila mwedikabila dya Simeoni endaga ni Shemueli mwana ywa Amihudi.<verse eid="NUM 34:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 34:21" />Kulaila mweidikabila dya Benjamini endaga ni Elidadi mwana ywa Kisiloni. <verse eid="NUM 34:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 34:22" />Kulaila mweidikabila dya Dani endaga ni Buki mwana ywa Yogili.<verse eid="NUM 34:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 34:23" />Kulaila mwe idikabila dya Manase mwanawe Yusufu endaga ni Hanieli mwana ywa Efodi.<verse eid="NUM 34:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 34:24" />Kulaila mwe idikabila dya Efulaimu mwanawe mtuhu dya Yusufu endaga ni Kemueli mwana ywa Shifutani.<verse eid="NUM 34:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 34:25" />Kulaila mwe idikabila dya Zabuloni endaga ni Elisafani mwana ywa Palinaki.<verse eid="NUM 34:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 34:26" />Kulaila mwe idikabila dya Isakali endaga ni Palitieli mwana ywa Azani.<verse eid="NUM 34:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 34:27" />Kulaila mwe idikabila dya Asheli endaga ni Ahihudi mwana ywa Shelomi.<verse eid="NUM 34:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 34:28" />Kulaila mwe idikabila dya Nafutali endaga ni Pedaheli mwana ywa Amihudi.<verse eid="NUM 34:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 34:29" />Awo nawo awantu Zumbe alagize wawasangile Waizulaeli isi ya Kanani itenda ulisi wawo.<verse eid="NUM 34:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 34" />
  <chapter number="35" style="c" sid="NUM 35" />
  <para style="s">Mizi wenkigwe Walawi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 35:1" />Zumbe kalonga na Musa mweisi amabwandasi ya Moabu, ntendele yo mto wa Yolidani hajihi na Yeliko, <verse eid="NUM 35:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 35:2" />“Wagambile Waizulaeli kugamba kulawana na ulisi wakunga waguhe, wawenke Walawi mizi ya kwikala na hantu ha kudimila mmpezo mwe mizi iyo. <verse eid="NUM 35:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 35:3" />Mizi iyo naitende ya Walawi, nawo nawekale umo na hantu hawo hakudimila ng'ombe na ludimo lwawo hamwenga na wanyama wawo watuhu. <verse eid="NUM 35:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 35:4" />Hantu ho kudimila mkunga muwenke Walawi mmpezo mwe mizi nahatende na utali wa mita magana mane na milongo mishano ntendele zose kulaila mwe iviwambaza vye imizi iyo. <verse eid="NUM 35:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 35:5" />Kwaivyo hantu aho hokudimila nahatende mita magana chenda, na dyenele chila ntendele youmzi no mzi wenye ukatenda wihagati, hantu aho nahatende hantu hawo hakudimila mmpezo mwe imizi yawo. <verse eid="NUM 35:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 35:6" />Namuwenke Walawi mizi mtandatu ya kunyilikila ya mntu namkome mnyawe hekambile mwenye, hamwenga na ayo namuwenke mizi mituhu milongo mine na midi. <verse eid="NUM 35:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 35:7" />Imizi yose mkungwa kuwenka Walawi naitende milongo mine na mnane, namuwenke imizi iyo hamwenga na hantu hakudimila. <verse eid="NUM 35:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 35:8" />Naho mwe imizi na muwenke Walawi mo ulisi wa Waizulaeli nailawane no ukulu we dikabila, kabila kulu nadilavye mizi ilozize na kabila dodo nadilavye mizi mijeche, chila kabila dya Izulaeli nadilavye mizi yakwe kwa Walawi kuligana na hantu dikunga dilisi.”<verse eid="NUM 35:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mizi ya kunyilikila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 35:9" />Zumbe niyo amgamba Musa, <verse eid="NUM 35:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 35:10" />“Wagambe Waizulaeli kugamba chipindi namomboke umto Yolodani na kwingila mwe isi ya Kanani, <verse eid="NUM 35:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 35:11" />namsagule mizi ya kunyilikila mwenyu, chani uneva mntu anamkoma mnyawe, hekambile kumkoma, adahe kunyilikila uko. <verse eid="NUM 35:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 35:12" />Mizi iyo naitende hantu hakunyilikila hana utondowazi chani uyo mkomi asekukomwa ni mta kulihiza chikoda umo henati kukantilwa ni idibunga dya awantu. <verse eid="NUM 35:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 35:13" />Mizi iyo yo kunyilikila namuwenke naitende mtandatu. <verse eid="NUM 35:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 35:14" />Mizi iyo mtandatu mgunga muwenke, mitatu itende ntendele ya kaidi yo mto wa Yolidani na mitatu itende mwe isi ya Kanani. <verse eid="NUM 35:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 35:15" />Mizi iyo mtandatu naitende ya kunyilikila ya Waizulaeli, na wajeni wakwila umo hegu wajeni wajinka sila, chani chila akunga akome mntu hekambile, anyilikile umo. <verse eid="NUM 35:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 35:16" />Mna hegu mntu kamtowa mnyawe kwa chiya cha chuma niyo abanika uyo ni mkomi, naye akomwe. <verse eid="NUM 35:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 35:17" />Mntu anamtowa mnyawe na yuwe niyo amkoma, natende ni mkomi naye akomwe. <verse eid="NUM 35:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 35:18" />Hegu kamtowa na chiziha cha mti niyo amkoma mntu uyo ni mkomi naye akomwe. <verse eid="NUM 35:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 35:19" />Mlukolo ywa hajihi ywa uyo akomigwe aho nabwilane na yudya mkomi, namkome uyo mkomi.”<verse eid="NUM 35:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 35:20" />“Iviya hegu mntu amwihiwa mnyawe na kumsindika hegu kumdwila chintu kwa chinyele, <verse eid="NUM 35:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 35:21" />hegu kwa kumtowa ihi niyo abanika ivyo mntu uyo amtoile umnyawe ni mkomi naye akomwe. Mlukolo ywa hajihi na uo mntu akomigwe naye nalihe chikoda kwa kumkoma umkomi aho nadugane naye.”<verse eid="NUM 35:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 35:22" />“Mna hegu mntu anamsindika mnyawe kwa chipumpa hekumwihiwa hegu kumduila chintu chochose hemnyatile, <verse eid="NUM 35:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 35:23" />hegu mntu anadula yuwe dikudaha kumhosa mntu abanike, niyo amkoma mntu hemwekambile hata hegu nendile suyo mnkondo ywakwe naho haungile amlumize, <verse eid="NUM 35:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 35:24" />ivyo, wantu wa Izulaeli nawalamule mwa uyo umkomi na umntu uyo akunga alihe ichikoda kuligana na malagizo yano. <verse eid="NUM 35:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 35:25" />Wantu wa Izulaeli nawamhonye uyo akomile mwe mikono yo mlukolo yo mntu uyo akomigwe na kumvuza komzi endile anyilikile. Nekale uko kubula mlavyantambiko mkulu ywe chipindi icho asentigwe kwa huhakwa mavuta yakukile hadya nabanikile. <verse eid="NUM 35:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 35:26" />Mna uyo akomile anafosa mo mzi anyilikile chipindi chochose chiya, <verse eid="NUM 35:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 35:27" />niyo mlukolo ywa hajihi ywa yudya akomigwe ambwila kuse kwe mihaka yo mzi uwo wo kunyilikila na kumkoma mntu uyo hatende na masa ya kukoma. <verse eid="NUM 35:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 35:28" />Kwaviya uyo mkomi nakaungwa ekale komzi wo kunyilikila kubula ifile ya mlavyantambiko mkulu, mna mlavyantambiko mkulu anabanika uyo mkomi adaha kuya kwekaya nakekala. <verse eid="NUM 35:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 35:29" />Mbuli izo nazitende ni sigilizi kwenyu mwe ivyeleko vyenyu vyose, mowikazi wenyu wose.”<verse eid="NUM 35:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 35:30" />“Mntu yoyose nakome mntu, nakantilwe file kwa ukuzi wa wantu waidi hegu kujinka, mntu yoyose hakudaha kukantilwa file kwa ukuzi wa mntu yumwenga. <verse eid="NUM 35:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 35:31" />Naho msekuhokela maliho yoyose kumhonya mntu akoile masa ya kukoma niyo akantilwa file, mnyu uyo akomwe. <verse eid="NUM 35:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 35:32" />Msekuhokela hegu kuzumila maliho yoyose kulaila kwa mntu anyilikile komzi wo kunyilikila chani auye akekale kwekaya yakwe umo mlavyantambiko mkulu henati kubanika. <verse eid="NUM 35:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 35:33" />Mnadamanya ivyo namuitende isi mkwikala isekuwagila mwangu kwaviya sakame itike yatenda isi isekuwagila, hahana malavyo yakudaha kukukiza isi idamanyizwe ukomi, mna ni kwakumkoma uyo umkomi. <verse eid="NUM 35:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 35:34" />Ivyo msekuibalanga isi mkwikala, iyo hwikala mgati mwakwe kwaviya miye Zumbe nekala mwa Waizulaeli.”<verse eid="NUM 35:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 35" />
  <chapter number="36" style="c" sid="NUM 36" />
  <para style="s">Ulisi kwa wavyele wasoligwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 36:1" />Vikaheza, vilongozi we iyumba yo lukolo lwa Gileadi mwana ywa Makili, mwana ywa manase mwana ywa Yusufu, niyo waita kulonga na Musa na vilongozi watuhu wa nkolo za Waizulaeli. <verse eid="NUM 36:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 36:2" />Wamgamba, “Sekuli ywetu, Zumbe nakakulagiza uwasangila ulisi wawo we isi wantu wa Izulaeli kwa kutoa tegatega itende yawo, iviya kakulagiza uwenke wanachiche wa Selefodi mlukolo ywetu ulisi wa tati yawo. <verse eid="NUM 36:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 36:3" />Mna awo wanasolwa ni makabila matuhu ya Waizulaeli, ulisi wawo we sanga naulawe mwetu na kwigalwa uko kwa amakabila wasoligwe, ivyo ulisi wetu nauhunguke. <verse eid="NUM 36:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 36:4" />Naho mwe ngasu yo lukumbusa lwe ngasu ya mhilimo wa milongo mishano aho ugoli watagagwa ukavuzwa komwenye, ivyo ulisi we isanga ya wanachiche wa Selefodi ulisi uwo nawigalwe uko kwedikabila wasoligwe, ivyo idikabila dyetu hadipate ulisi uwo naho.”<verse eid="NUM 36:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 36:5" />Ivyo, Musa niyo awasigila wana wa Waizulaeli saviya idilagizo dya Zumbe, akagamba, “Wantu wo ulukolo lwe idikabila dya Yusufu walonga chindedi. <verse eid="NUM 36:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 36:6" />Vino nivyo Zumbe Chohile akulagiza mwa wanachiche wa Selofehadi, wadaha kusolwa ni mntu yoyose akunga amsole, mna wasolwe molukolo lwawo. <verse eid="NUM 36:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 36:7" />Chani ulisi wa Waizulaeli usekwigalwa kwe lukolo lutuhu, chila Mwizulaeli nasigale na ulisi molukolo lwakwe. <verse eid="NUM 36:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 36:8" />Mvyele yoyose mta ulisi mwelukolo lolose lwa Izulaeli ongigwa asolwe ni mntu wolukolo lwakwe, chani chila Mwizulaeli aguhe ulisi watati zakwe. <verse eid="NUM 36:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 36:9" />Ivyo hakutende na ulisi wowose ukungigwa kusigwa kulaila kwe kabila dimwenga kwigalwa kwe kabila tuhu. Chila kabila dya Waizulaeli naditozese ulisi wakwe.”<verse eid="NUM 36:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 36:10" />Wandele wa Selofehadi niyo wadamanya saviya Zumbe amlagize Musa. <verse eid="NUM 36:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 36:11" />Wose, mala na Tilisa na Hogila na Milka na Nowa niyo wasolwa ni wana tati zawo wakulu na wadodo. <verse eid="NUM 36:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 36:12" />Wasolagwa mwe lukolo lwe idikabila dya Manase mwana ywa Yusufu, ulisi wawo we sanga niyo wasigala mwe dikabila dya tati yawo. <verse eid="NUM 36:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 36:13" />Zino ni sigilizi na malagizo yadya Zumbe awenkile Waizulaeli kwa sila ya Musa mwe dibwandasi dya Moabu, ntendele yomto wa Yolidani hajihi na Yeliko.<verse eid="NUM 36:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 36" />
</usx>